window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":301,"title":"Chapter 301: No Matter How Loud You Shout, Huailing Can't Hear","paragraphs":["In the cramped space, Qiao Chuchu could feel the warmth radiating from Pei Che’s body.","He leaned in closer, his arms tightening around her like a serpent coiling relentlessly.","Uncomfortable, she tried to break free. \"I don’t need you to buy me a house. I have my own money—I can buy it myself.\"","Pei Che’s gaze was deep and unfathomable, his voice icy. \"You’re still keeping me at arm’s length.\"","He twirled a lock of her long hair around his finger. \"I miss the days when you used to cling to me, begging me to buy you things.\"","Qiao Chuchu had no memory of this and struggled against him.","But Pei Che was far stronger.","Her resistance was utterly futile against his overpowering grip.","Frustrated, she sighed. \"That’s all in the past. You don’t need to dwell on it.\"","Pei Che stiffened, his lips curling into a self-deprecating smile. \"Not for me, it isn’t.\"","He pressed closer, his voice low and earnest. \"I shouldn’t have abandoned you back then. I shouldn’t have ignored you.\"","\"Chuchu, give me a chance to make it up to you.\"","Goosebumps prickled along her neck as she turned her face away. \"I don’t know what you—\"","Knock, knock, knock!","A sharp rapping at the door made her exhale in relief. \"Someone’s outside. Let’s go—we shouldn’t keep them waiting!\"","\"Don’t worry about it,\" Pei Che smirked. \"It’s Weisheng Huailing. No matter what sounds we make in here, he won’t hear a thing.\"","Before she could react, he pinned her against the door, shielding her face with his hand.","Qiao Chuchu gasped as her palms slammed against the wood—","BANG!","Outside, Weisheng Huailing stood cluelessly by the bathroom door, oblivious to the noise.","Her heart pounded as she glared at Pei Che. \"What the hell are you doing?!\"","His lips curved into a sly grin as he looked down at her. \"See? He can’t hear a thing. No matter how loud this door gets, he’ll never know.\"","Knock, knock, knock!","Another impatient series of knocks sounded.","Pei Che only seemed more amused, leaning in closer. \"Chuchu, you can’t be with a man like him. Not that I look down on him, but he’s deaf, volatile, and insecure. No matter how handsome he is, no matter how sweet his sign language, no matter how wealthy—he’ll never be good enough for you. Understand?\"","She squirmed, unnerved. \"I get it. But can we leave now?\"","Pei Che’s grip tightened. \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","He turned her to face him, his tone deliberate. \"We’re two adults alone in a bathroom. What do you think he’ll assume?\"","She scowled. \"I don’t care what he thinks. I don’t care about anyone’s opinions. I just don’t want to stay here anymore. And stop touching me like this—we might be close, but not this close. Learn some boundaries.\"","With that, she yanked the door open.","Pei Che reached out to stop her, but it was too late. He sighed in disappointment.","The moment the door moved, Weisheng Huailing’s face lit up with a friendly smile—until Qiao Chuchu stepped out, followed by a tall man.","A man.","His smile vanished instantly.","Pei Che strode out after her, his lips curved in a casual smirk as he glanced down at Huailing. \"Oh, it’s you.\"","Qiao Chuchu shot him a disgusted look.","[Stop pretending. You knew it was Huailing all along. You just wanted to bully him because he can’t hear—making me slam the door on purpose.]","Pei Che met her glare unflinchingly before turning back to Huailing.","Weisheng Huailing stood frozen.","Slam the door?","What slamming?","How?","They’d been making noise this whole time, and he—deaf as he was—hadn’t heard a thing?","His mind reeled as Pei Che brushed past him, a smug, satisfied grin playing on his lips.","Like he’d just gotten away with something in that bathroom.","Rage surged through Huailing.","His fist shot out before he could stop it—","CRACK!","Pei Che staggered back, slamming into the wall.","Huailing lunged at him, ready to strike again—","\"HUAILING, STOP!\" Qiao Chuchu threw herself between them, shielding Pei Che.","Blood trickled from Pei Che’s lips, but he only grinned wider, as if he’d expected this.","Huailing’s chest heaved, his hands trembling with fury.","Qiao Chuchu shoved him back. \"Enough!\"","This guy was a trained killer—Pei Che didn’t stand a chance.","She kept herself between them, glaring at Huailing. \"What the hell is wrong with you?!\"","Huailing’s hands moved sharply, his signs furious. «You’re protecting him?»","She frowned. \"Of course I am! He’s my brother!\"","Weisheng Huailing’s eyes narrowed as he shot Pei Che a venomous look. «You see him as family, but he doesn’t see you that way! What were you two doing in there?!»","Qiao Chuchu signed back, baffled. «Just talking.»","«Then what was that about slamming the door?!» His fingers trembled with rage. «You won’t even let me kiss you, but you’re banging doors with him?! What’s wrong with me?! Is it because I’m deaf?!»","Qiao Chuchu: \"? I hit the door because he pushed me! If I pushed you against a door, you’d hit it too! Is this really something worth bringing up?\"","Weisheng Huailing froze: \"?\"","He gestured uncertainly: 「You mean literally hitting the door?」","Qiao Chuchu grew impatient: \"What other kind of ‘hitting the door’ could there be?!\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"......\"","He thought it was the other kind—","Realizing this, Huailing’s expression darkened as he glanced at Pei Che.","Damn it! He’d acted impulsively!","Pei Che stood up from the floor, wiping the blood from his lips, and shrugged with exaggerated nonchalance. \"Chuchu, I already told you—this Weisheng Huailing would misunderstand us. And now I got punched for it.\"","\"But I didn’t fight back,\" he added smugly, flashing Huailing a taunting grin. \"I was afraid he’d cry. After all, he’s such a crybaby.\"","Huailing clenched his teeth at Pei Che before turning to Qiao Chuchu with worry.","Qiao Chuchu rose on her tiptoes to inspect Pei Che’s bruised lip. \"But your mouth is already swelling.\"","Pei Che’s smile deepened at her concern. \"It’s fine. Don’t worry about me. Huailing has always been possessive of you. Even though we grew up together and share a deeper bond, he can’t stand anyone else being close to you—he wants you all to himself.\"","\"I get it,\" Pei Che said, his gaze locking onto Huailing’s pale face, his eyes brimming with open provocation. \"I really do.\"","Huailing’s eyes widened as he anxiously searched Qiao Chuchu’s expression.","Her face had already darkened with anger. 「You should go home first, Huailing.」","Huailing’s heart sank. He shook his head frantically, signing with pleading desperation: 「Chuchu, I’m sorry! I thought he was abusing you—that’s why you hit the door! I was just so worried! I acted without thinking!」","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","Abuse?","Huailing explained earnestly: 「I wasn’t jealous, Chuchu! I really thought he was hurting you!」","Pei Che scoffed. \"That’s ridiculous—\"","But Qiao Chuchu seemed convinced. \"Really?\"","Pei Che: \"?\""]},{"number":302,"title":"Chapter 302: Plotting Future Plans","paragraphs":["Pei Che couldn’t help but laugh: “Chuchu, have I spoiled you too much? He’s lying to you, and you actually believe him?”","Qiao Chuchu disagreed: “His explanation makes sense, though.”","“How does it make sense?!” Pei Che frowned. “You don’t have any injuries, and you’re not disheveled—how does it look like I hit you? He’s just making excuses to save face!”","Huai Ling scurried over to Pei Che and typed a message on his phone: “Brother, don’t be angry! Little brother didn’t mean it! Little brother misunderstood you!”","Pei Che was instantly annoyed by his tone: “Can you stop with the ‘brother’ and ‘little brother’ nonsense? Even my real brother doesn’t call me that!”","Weisheng Huailing shook his head and continued typing: “But little brother just wants to address you respectfully, brother. Don’t be angry, little brother knows he was wrong.”","He rubbed his hands together earnestly and gestured: 「Little brother admits his mistake, brother. Please don’t be angry. Little brother is willing to compensate you and even apply medicine for you!」","Seeing this, Qiao Chuchu couldn’t help but translate: “Brother, he says he knows he was wrong and hopes you won’t stay mad. He’s willing to compensate you and help treat your injuries.”","Pei Che’s frown deepened as he stared into Huai Ling’s watery eyes.","Huai Ling bit his lip, tears quickly pooling in his eyes.","Like artificial rain, he was on the verge of crying again.","Pei Che couldn’t be bothered to argue and brushed past him: “Stop crying. I’m leaving.”","Huai Ling watched him walk away, a faint smirk tugging at his lips before he turned to Qiao Chuchu with a pitiful expression: 「Sister, I’m sorry for hitting your brother. Please don’t be mad.」","His gaze drifted to the messy bed, and he licked his lips suggestively: 「I can make it up to you by tucking you in and helping you sleep.」","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Without hesitation, she kicked him out of the room: “Get lost!”","Huai Ling rubbed his sore backside, oddly pleased.","Pei Che stood outside, watching him coldly: “Hmph.”","Huai Ling froze, then quickly typed on his phone: “Why are you still here?”","“I wasn’t leaving until you came out,” Pei Che sneered. “Otherwise, you’d just use me as a scapegoat again.”","With that, Pei Che turned and walked off disdainfully.","Weisheng Huailing glared at his retreating figure, irritated.","None of the men around Qiao Chuchu were any good!","Himself included!","Hmph!","He rushed over to Weisheng Yucan and tugged at her sleeve.","Yucan was relaxing with a face mask on and snapped: “What?!”","Huai Ling glanced around conspiratorially and gestured: 「I want to buy Qiao Chuchu a house! So she can live there!」","The rest of the Weisheng family perked up with interest.","Weisheng Yucan sat up straight, intrigued: 「Buy a house, and then what?」","Weisheng Huailing beamed: 「Propose to her.」","Weisheng Yucan: “?”","Weisheng Biehe burst out laughing: 「You shameless brat, you gave her a stress response just from kissing her once. You think she’d marry you?」","Wen Zhan crossed his legs, smirking: 「Overestimating yourself.」","Weisheng Lin chuckled darkly: “Heh heh heh.”","Weisheng Yucan rolled her eyes: 「I can’t help you with this. I’m not letting her give up an entire forest for one sapling. She’s young, beautiful, talented, with endless suitors—why would she settle down with you in her prime?」","Huai Ling frowned: 「What if I buy a big house for all of us to live in together?」","Weisheng Yucan’s eyes lit up: 「Now that’s an idea!」","Weisheng Lin slapped his thigh: 「I always knew my little brother was a genius.」","Weisheng Wen Zhan pulled out his phone: 「I saw a great property the other day.」","Weisheng Biehe grinned: 「We could all move in and see her every day!」","Shi Yu wheeled his chair over, smiling as he signed: 「No idea what you’re scheming, but count me in.」","The Weisheng family eyed him skeptically: “?”","Shi Yu smiled sweetly: 「If you exclude me, I’ll go tell the Pei family that you’re plotting to buy a house and steal Qiao Chuchu away.」","The Weisheng family: “???”"]},{"number":303,"title":"Chapter 303: Ye Huining's Request","paragraphs":["On the other side, Pei Che handed the estate photos to Pei Yuan: \"What do you think of this new property?\"","Pei Yuan flipped through them casually: \"The interior design is good, well-maintained, and the location is prime—right within the Second Ring Road.\"","Pei Che said, \"This one is the best of the lot. The others all have flaws and are too small. This estate is spacious and grand, complete with a swimming pool, a horse ranch, everything you could want. Plus, it’s only a twenty-minute drive from our workplaces—far better than the old house.\"","Pei Youchuan leaned in to look: \"Then let’s buy this one? I’ll pay for it in full as a gift for her.\"","Pei Fengnong stepped forward: \"I’ll cover it. Money isn’t an issue for me.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci frowned: \"We’re not short on funds either. We’ll pay for it.\"","Pei Buxian loomed ominously to the side: \"I’ll pay in full for Chuchu. If you don’t let me, I’ll throw a tantrum and roll around on the plane.\"","The Pei brothers shot him a disdainful look: \"...\"","\"No amount of rolling will help,\" Lou Tingsi remarked with a smirk, appearing behind them. \"Since everyone wants to chip in, count me in too. I’ll contribute, then move in with my son. After all, we’ve been through life-and-death situations together—living under one roof would be quite the celebration, wouldn’t it?\"","\"Is that really a celebration?\" Pei Buxian glared at him. \"I won’t even bother calling you out.\"","Lin Shen, who had been eavesdropping, seized the moment to step forward: \"I’ll contribute. I want to make Qiao Chuchu happy.\"","The Pei family: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi sucked in a breath, eyeing him incredulously. \"Lin Shen, do you even think before you speak?\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Shen Zhuoyan sat at the far end, listening to their conversation. He checked his bank balance on his phone.","With a bitter sigh, he set his phone down and stared at their backs.","How long would it take for him to reach their level through his own efforts?","He’d have to return to the Shen family and inherit the business first.","Unbuckling his seatbelt, he approached Pei Yuan. \"Mr. Pei Yuan, there’s something I’d like to discuss with you.\"","Pei Yuan, surprised, stood up and followed him aside. \"What is it?\"","Shen Zhuoyan glanced around to ensure no one was watching, then spoke in a low voice.","Pei Yuan’s expression shifted to astonishment. After a moment’s consideration, he grew intrigued and engaged in conversation.","The plane landed safely in Lan City after dark.","But since they’d neglected work for days, they all headed to the office to catch up.","Qiao Chuchu yawned, riding home with Shen Zhuoyan.","Lou Yuejue was scheduled to visit that evening.","Tonight, it would just be her, Lou Yuejue, and Shen Zhuoyan at home.","But as they reached the gate, a car was parked right outside.","Squinting, she found the license plate oddly familiar. \"Whose car is that?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression darkened. \"It’s Ji Yanchuan’s.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Just hearing that name gave her a headache.","She’d already gotten rid of the female lead—why was the male lead still around?!","Annoyed, she stepped out of the car—only for someone else to emerge from the parked vehicle.","Not Ji Yanchuan.","It was Ye Huining.","The moment Ye Huining saw her, relief washed over her face. She rushed forward urgently. \"I’ve been coming to your house for days—where have you been?\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"What’s it to you? Who are you to me? Why are you and your son both so presumptuous?\"","Ye Huining froze, then suppressed her temper. \"I’m just worried. Don’t be angry with me.\"","She pulled out several platinum Hermès crocodile skin bags from the car—unboxed, clearly meant to flaunt their luxury.","Each was a top-tier, exorbitantly priced designer piece.","She shoved them all into Qiao Chuchu’s arms like a pile of pillows.","Qiao Chuchu barely caught them. \"What’s this? Are you giving them to me, or setting me up to drop and break them so you can sue me?\"","Ye Huining didn’t take offense. Instead, she spoke gently, almost pleading. \"Sweetheart, I was wrong to speak to you the way I did before. Please don’t hold it against me.\"","Tears welled in her eyes. \"Ever since my son Ji Yanchuan lost his memory, he’s become a different person. He fell for some ordinary girl, doesn’t recognize me anymore, ignores me when I talk, and runs away when I send people after him. He even calls another woman ‘Mom’ now!\"","Her voice trembled as she clutched Qiao Chuchu’s arm. \"Please, help me! Have pity on a mother’s heart. He’s my only child—not only has he lost his mind, but he’s disowned me!\"","Shen Zhuoyan swiftly removed the bags from Qiao Chuchu and dumped them back into Ye Huining’s car. \"No.\"","Ye Huining paled. \"Those bags are worth a fortune! I’ve only used them once or twice, and they’re impeccably maintained. Even reselling them would fetch millions—and this is just the down payment!\"","She turned to Qiao Chuchu, hopeful. \"Help me, and I’ll give you another five million. I’m sorry—truly, deeply sorry.\"","Qiao Chuchu shut her down. \"You insulted my friend and me before. I have nothing more to say to you. Find someone else.\"","Ye Huining chased after her. \"But my son liked you before he lost his memory! I know he wronged you, and I understand if you can’t forgive him, but I just want him back to normal! The doctors said seeing familiar faces might help!\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored her and walked through the gate.","Ye Huining stood outside, shouting after her. \"If you refuse, I’ll stay right here until you agree!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced back disdainfully. \"Stand there as long as you want. I won’t change my mind.\"","Ye Huining’s shoulders slumped, but she remained, silently pleading.","Two hours passed. Even Lou Yuejue had arrived for his visit, yet Ye Huining still stood outside, waiting stubbornly.","Lou Yuejue peered out the window. \"Sister, she’s still there. How long is she planning to stay? It’s already 8 PM.\"","Qiao Chuchu lounged in front of the TV. \"Ignore her.\"","Lou Yuejue: \"What if she faints? Do we still ignore her then?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She bolted upright, spotting Ye Huining collapsed at the gate, and sprinted outside. \"Oh my god, don’t die on my doorstep! I’d have to hire an exorcist!\"","Lou Yuejue chuckled, trailing behind her cheerfully. \"Dad said he’s staying here for a while, so that means I can move in too, right? Since we’re family now, let me handle this for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? You’ll handle it?\"","\"Of course! Whatever my sister dislikes, I’ll take care of.\" He quickened his pace, overtaking Qiao Chuchu, and addressed the guards at the gate—","\"Please throw this auntie into the trash! Thanks!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Ye Huining (pretending to be unconscious): \"?\""]},{"number":304,"title":"Chapter 304: Ten million is not enough How about twenty million","paragraphs":["Ye Huining sprang up from the ground like a carp leaping out of water, indignant. \"Why were you about to throw me into a trash can?! Is this how you treat someone who's unconscious?!\"","Lou Yuejue remained expressionless. \"If you're going to pretend to faint, commit to it. Why do you care how we treat you?\"","Ye Huining: \"? But you were literally about to toss me into a garbage bin!\"","Lou Yuejue: \"But we didn’t, did we?\"","Ye Huining: \"But you were going to?!\"","Lou Yuejue shrugged. \"If you're going to fake a faint, see it through. Complain after I actually throw you in.\"","Ye Huining turned to Qiao Chuchu in disbelief. \"You’re just going to let this kid talk to me like that?\"","Qiao Chuchu stood with her arms crossed, firmly on Lou Yuejue’s side. \"I talk to you like that all the time. Plus, given your reputation—everyone knows you drove your ex-wife to miscarriage before taking her place—this should be nothing new for you.\"","Ye Huining flushed with anger. \"Stop bringing up the past! All I want is for you to help me find my son. Are you in or not?\"","Qiao Chuchu turned on her heel, flipping her off. \"No!\"","She’d actually thought Ye Huining was going to die on her doorstep!","What a waste of emotions.","Ye Huining, however, wasn’t fazed. \"What if I offer you twenty million to bring my son back safely? Would that change your mind?\"","Lou Yuejue sneered, crossing his arms. \"Auntie, are you joking? You think a measly twenty million is enough to buy my sister’s time? You really underestimate her.\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately marched up to Ye Huining. \"Wire transfer or cash?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","He quickly changed his tune. \"We should draft a contract—voluntary donation terms—to save everyone time.\"","Ye Huining: \"? Wow, you flip-flop fast. No wonder you and Qiao Chuchu get along so well.\"","Lou Yuejue smugly lifted his chin. \"Of course. As her little brother, I’ll always back her up unconditionally.\"","Ye Huining pulled a contract from her car. \"I already had this prepared.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"You were dead set on hiring me, huh?\"","\"Not exactly. I had my assistant print it just now. I didn’t expect you to turn down a few Hermès crocodile bags and five million in cash.\"","Ye Huining handed her the contract. \"Then I thought, if ten million wasn’t enough, doubling it might do the trick.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...And if I still refuse?\"","Ye Huining smirked. \"I’ll keep raising the price.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She bent down to whisper to Lou Yuejue, wincing. \"Damn it, I think I lowballed myself.\"","Lou Yuejue whispered back, \"It’s fine, sis. We can still back out. At worst, we’ll look unethical, but ethics don’t pay the bills.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? You just said money couldn’t buy my time.\"","Lou Yuejue grinned, tilting his head. \"I’m your yes-man. If you like money, I’ll like money too. I’ll always have your back.\"","He glanced at Ye Huining. \"This auntie doesn’t seem too bright. We could probably squeeze more out of her. Want me to negotiate?\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed. \"...No, I don’t want to corrupt a kid.\"","Lou Yuejue looked around. \"Kid? What kid?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eye twitched. Standing up, she said to Ye Huining, \"Fine, I’ll take the job. Where’s your son?\"","Ye Huining perked up. \"There’s an amusement park on the outskirts of the sixth ring road! He’s there!\"","---","Qiao Chuchu and Lou Yuejue stood before the amusement park, staring up at its peeling paint and worn-out facade.","It was 9 PM.","While most amusement parks would be closed by now, eerie lights flickered inside.","A drowsy security guard nodded off in front of a TV, mouth agape.","Beyond the entrance, broken-down rides glittered under garish lights.","A rabbit statue at the gate grinned at them with bulging eyes, clutching something red in its paws.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Lou Yuejue: \"...\"","Ye Huining’s voice crackled through their earpieces, sounding even more nervous than they were. \"This is the amusement park run by my son’s so-called ‘mother.’ I looked into it—this place gets zero visitors all year. It’s a family heirloom, apparently. They don’t make any money, don’t maintain the rides, and today’s their last day open before they move back to the countryside. This is your best chance to get close to my son.\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed her earpiece, exasperated. \"Why aren’t you coming yourself?\"","Ye Huining’s voice was pained. \"I’ve been blacklisted.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? This dump has a blacklist? The whole place should be blacklisted! And where’s the ticket booth anyway?\"","Ye Huining groaned. \"Look to your left.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and saw a sign with Ye Huining’s photo plastered on it.","[No entry for weird women and dogs!]","?","Ye Huining sobbed from her luxury car. \"My son printed that himself! In his eyes, I’m on the same level as a dog!\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed and grabbed Lou Yuejue’s hand. \"Let’s go.\"","Lou Yuejue blinked in surprise at their intertwined fingers.","His usual scowl melted into a delighted grin as he squeezed her hand back.","Shen Zhuoyan wasn’t with them—Pei Yuan had called him away for an urgent meeting.","But Lou Yuejue’s ten bodyguards lurked nearby.","He shot them a look, signaling them to keep their distance, then happily strolled into the amusement park with Qiao Chuchu.","Ye Huining monitored them via drone. \"My son’s technically the heir to this place, so play along when you get in. Don’t raise suspicion—I’ve sent too many people after him, and now he knows when someone’s up to no good.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded. \"Got it. Lure him in like prey. Just keep playing until he takes the bait.\"","That said...","She eyed the decrepit park with disdain.","What was there to even enjoy here?","Lou Yuejue pointed at a rickety roller coaster. \"Sis! Let’s ride that!\"","Qiao Chuchu paled, about to protest its safety, but Lou Yuejue dragged her over.","The ride operator didn’t even look up from his drama. \"A hundred per person per ride.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s jaw dropped. \"A hundred for this death trap?!\"","A cheerful \"ding!\" sounded beside her.","The familiar voice of a payment notification chirped: \"WeChat payment received—two hundred yuan.\"","She turned in shock.","Lou Yuejue waved his phone, beaming. \"Two hundred’s cheap! My treat!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\""]},{"number":305,"title":"Chapter 305: Screaming as if dying miserably","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu bristled with anger: \"Two hundred yuan is cheap?! This piece-of-junk roller coaster isn’t even worth twenty!!\"","Lou Yuejue put down his phone, bewildered: \"What can you buy with twenty yuan? It’s not even enough for a bottle of water.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He walked up to her, looking up at her with concern: \"Sister, do you usually not have any money? Let me send you some pocket money. I’ve been learning financial management with my dad, and I’ve made a lot of money.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Ye Huining chimed in through the Bluetooth earpiece: \"Yeah, what’s two hundred yuan? Qiao Chuchu, you’re so stingy. I can expense this anyway.\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","Her face turned ashen: \"Get on.\"","Lou Yuejue beamed, happily hopping into the front seat and swinging his legs.","Going to the amusement park with Sister!","Yay!","Qiao Chuchu’s face turned green as she boarded the ride, eyeing the peeling, run-down equipment, feeling like death was imminent.","The staff fastened her and Lou Yuejue’s seatbelts—one strap and a U-shaped safety bar.","The bell rang, and the roller coaster started moving.","Lou Yuejue gripped the safety bar excitedly, turning to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Feeling his gaze, she glanced back.","The light fell on Lou Yuejue’s face, the wind lifting his bangs to reveal his delicate features.","His eyes sparkled with joy: \"Sister, you’re so pretty.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, then reached out to ruffle his hair, praising him generously: \"When Yuejue grows up, he’ll be a heartthrob, just as handsome as your dad.\"","Lou Yuejue’s eyebrows rose, his smile widening as he touched her cheek: \"Thank you, Sister!\"","As he raised his hand, a crisp snap echoed.","His seatbelt had snapped.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","They locked eyes.","Then looked up at the roller coaster, now suspended at its peak, ready to plunge.","Qiao Chuchu’s mind short-circuited. She grabbed Lou Yuejue in a death grip!","The roller coaster shot downward!","She shrieked like a boiling kettle: \"AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!\"","Lou Yuejue’s eyes widened in exhilaration. Watching Qiao Chuchu, who was terrified of heights, cling to him so tightly, he felt no fear—just an urge to laugh.","Qiao Chuchu’s scalp nearly flew off from the wind as she struggled to hold onto Lou Yuejue, her fingers digging into his arm, terrified he’d fall!","[Oh fcking hell! If Lou Yuejue falls, I’ll fcking lose it!!]","[I’ll fcking blow this godforsaken place to smithereens with C4!!!!]","Lou Yuejue’s eyes lit up in delight: \"Sister, since when did you learn to transmit Morse code with your swearing?!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t hear him: \"WHAT?!\"","\"Nothing!\" Lou Yuejue spread his arms, embracing the wind, laughing: \"I’m so happy!~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU HAPPY ABOUT?!\"","Meanwhile, Ji Yanchuan sat in the rest area, gloomily surveying the decrepit amusement park.","Meng Xue’er approached, handing him a can of cola: \"Something on your mind?\"","Ji Yanchuan accepted it, sighing: \"I feel like there’s a void inside me. I don’t know who I am or where I belong. And now this park is closing for good—where do I go after today?\"","He sighed again: \"Even on its last day, no one’s here.\"","A boy ran up, panting: \"Ji Yanchuan! We’ve got customers!\"","Ji Yanchuan shot to his feet: \"Really? What ride are they on?!\"","The boy grinned: \"The roller coaster! Someone finally rode our decade-abandoned coaster!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s face brightened: \"Are they screaming?!\"","The boy nodded eagerly: \"Screaming their lungs out!!!\"","Ji Yanchuan sprinted toward the ride, hearing a girl’s bloodcurdling shrieks from afar: \"AHHHHHHHHHH!\"","His eyes welled up: \"After ten years... someone finally rode it. And they sound like they’re dying!\"","He covered his mouth, choked up: \"It’s beautiful.\"","Qiao Chuchu clung to Lou Yuejue, her fear of heights skyrocketing!","Lou Yuejue, flustered by her tight embrace, grinned ear-to-ear!","But then, her thoughts echoed in his mind—","[If anything happens to Lou Yuejue, Lou Tingsi will murder me!]","[And I’m terrified of heights! Why did this have to happen? My heart’s gonna give out!!!]","Lou Yuejue’s smile faded.","Just then, the ride screeched to a halt.","Guiltily, he looked at Qiao Chuchu.","She held him, panting, her face ghostly pale under the dim yellow lights.","Tears welled in her eyes as she frantically checked him: \"Are your arms and legs still attached?! Is your head still on?!\"","Lou Yuejue nodded solemnly, gently smoothing her disheveled hair: \"Sister, your hair’s a mess.\"","He combed it back with his small, warm hands, murmuring: \"I’m sorry for troubling you.\"","Qiao Chuchu waved it off: \"Not your fault.\"","She yelled hoarsely: \"Where’s the owner? Get over here!\"","Ji Yanchuan snapped out of his reverie, signaling the boy to go.","The boy trotted over cheerfully: \"So, wanna go again? Another round’s two hundred.\"","\"AGAIN?!\"","Qiao Chuchu shot up, pointing at Lou Yuejue’s broken seatbelt: \"This kid’s safety strap snapped! He could’ve died, you realize that?!\"","The boy blinked, tugging at the torn belt—then his face darkened: \"This wasn’t our fault! How do we know you didn’t cut it? Our belts haven’t failed in ten years!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s patience snapped: \"Why would I sabotage a ride I’m on?! And he’s just a kid! If anything happened to him, could you even take responsibility?!\"","Lou Yuejue sat silently, his gaze icy.","The boy scoffed: \"You’re just trying to scam us because our rides are old! We’ve seen your type before—no way you’re getting a cent!\"","Lou Yuejue smirked: \"Money? Who cares about your money?\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at him, startled.","He stood, straightening his denim jacket, his voice dripping with disdain: \"My life is worth more than you could ever pay. Since you’ve got no decency, you’ll get nothing.\"","With a flick of his wrist, he signaled his ten bodyguards: \"Destroy it.\""]},{"number":306,"title":"Chapter 306: Give Me a Chance, Qiao Chuchu.","paragraphs":["The bodyguard didn’t hesitate—he grabbed a baton and started smashing everything in sight!","The young man’s face paled as he rushed to shield the equipment. \"What are you doing?! Stop this right now!!\"","Lou Yuejue’s voice was icy as he commanded, \"Move anyone who gets in the way.\"","Ji Yanchuan stormed up to Lou Yuejue in a panic. \"What the hell are you doing?! Did you come here just to cause trouble?!\"","Under the flickering, dim light, Lou Yuejue lazily turned his phoenix-like eyes toward Ji Yanchuan. \"Ji Yanchuan?\"","He smirked, revealing a sharp canine, and tilted his chin up in challenge. \"Do I look like the kind of person who causes trouble for no reason?\"","Ji Yanchuan froze. \"How do you know my name?\"","Lou Yuejue ignored the question, leaning against the railing as he looked down at him with arrogance. \"You should be grateful this is China. If this were my father’s territory, this place would already be in flames—not just a pile of rusted scrap metal that should’ve been abandoned long ago.\"","He kicked the roller coaster with disgust. \"And you don’t even bother maintaining the safety belts, putting customers’ lives at risk. You act like you’re in the right when you’re clearly in the wrong. Smashing this place to pieces is practically a public service.\"","Ji Yanchuan’s temper flared. \"Who gave you the right to destroy my amusement park?!\"","Lou Yuejue scoffed. \"The fact that I paid for it! The fact that you accused us of lying when the safety belt snapped! The fact that this whole mess upset my sister!!\"","He jabbed a finger in Ji Yanchuan’s face, his voice dripping with venom. \"I came here to make my sister happy, not to stress her out! Because of you, she spent the whole time protecting me instead of enjoying herself! I have the power to vent her anger, and I’m going to use it!!\"","Ji Yanchuan was left speechless, his fury barely contained. \"Where is your sister?\"","Lou Yuejue didn’t answer, turning instead to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Ji Yanchuan followed his gaze—and froze.","Qiao Chuchu sat trembling on a folding chair, her auburn hair tousled by the wind as she lifted her eyes to glare at him with disdain.","Ji Yanchuan’s breath caught, utterly captivated by her.","Meng Xue'er stepped past Ji Yanchuan and inspected the safety belt. The fabric had clearly deteriorated from exposure, fraying at the slightest touch.","Guilt-ridden, she bowed deeply to Qiao Chuchu. \"I’m so sorry, ma’am. This was entirely our fault—we didn’t check the safety belt properly. We even wrongfully accused you. Please accept our sincerest apologies!\"","Another young man, still trying to stop the destruction, ran over in disbelief. \"Xue'er, are you insane?! They’re clearly trying to scam us!\"","Meng Xue'er kept her head bowed but shot him a glare. \"No, they’re not! Look at the belt—it’s completely worn out! We neglected maintenance!\"","The young man finally examined the belt and fell silent, shamefaced.","Meng Xue'er turned back to Qiao Chuchu. \"We’ll refund you immediately, and you’re free to take whatever action you see fit. Again, we’re deeply sorry for this experience.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression softened. \"Now that’s what I call taking responsibility.\"","Seeing her calm down, Lou Yuejue ordered his men, \"Stop.\"","Meng Xue'er exhaled in relief, looking up at Qiao Chuchu. \"Thank you so much for your—\"","Her words died in her throat as she stared at Qiao Chuchu in shock.","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes also lit up with recognition.","[This girl looks just like me!]","Lou Yuejue frowned at Meng Xue'er, unimpressed.","Like her? Barely.","Just a slight resemblance in the features.","Meng Xue'er studied Qiao Chuchu’s face, then turned to Ji Yanchuan with a bitter smile. \"Yanchuan... is this the girl you once told me I resembled?\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her daze and shot Ji Yanchuan a cold look.","Ji Yanchuan couldn’t speak.","The way she looked down on him—it made his throat go dry.","Yes, this was it.","This woman had always despised him.","The feeling was unmistakable.","He took a step forward, as if entranced. \"I’ve met you before.\"","Qiao Chuchu arched a brow and laughed mockingly. \"I don’t think so. Who are you?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Ye Huining’s frantic voice crackled through Qiao Chuchu’s earpiece. \"Why would you say you don’t know him?! Just tell him he’s Ji Yanchuan, my son, and bring him home already!\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes and muttered under her breath, \"Are you stupid? If he’s been rejecting you this whole time, he’ll think this is a setup. He needs to come back on his own—otherwise, you’ll always be on the same level as a dog in his eyes. Is that what you want?\"","Ye Huining: \"...No. Fine, I’ll trust you.\"","Qiao Chuchu resumed her haughty demeanor, standing up and brushing past Ji Yanchuan. \"Just refund us, and we’ll call it even.\"","Ji Yanchuan kept staring at her. \"You really don’t remember me at all?\"","She smirked, glancing back with disdain. \"I do know someone who looks like you—a certain ‘Ji CEO’ who rode around in luxury cars, threw money around, and was so shameless he wouldn’t leave me alone. He went missing after a car accident and lost his memory. But you?\"","She gave him a once-over. \"You’re just the owner of a failing amusement park. You’re not him. So no, I don’t know you.\"","Ji Yanchuan clutched his chest, bewildered. \"But my heart recognizes you. It races whenever I see you.\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed. \"Hearts are supposed to beat. If yours stopped, you’d be dead.\"","Her tone turned cutting. \"Besides, that Ji Yanchuan was nothing special—just a scumbag who once hired men to humiliate me.\"","Ji Yanchuan’s breath hitched—and suddenly, he grabbed his head in agony!","A memory flashed through his mind:","—A cramped car interior. A girl pinning him against the window, glaring down at him with contempt.","—\"Ji Yanchuan, you’re a bastard who deserves to die a thousand deaths.\"","A flood of recollections surged into his mind, overwhelming him. He collapsed to his knees, clutching his skull.","Meng Xue'er and the young man rushed to his side. \"Yanchuan! What’s wrong?!\"","Ji Yanchuan trembled, his vision blurring as he struggled to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Ye Huining also sprinted into the park, pushing through the crowd to reach him.","Surrounded by concerned faces, Ji Yanchuan gasped, \"I... I think I remember now.\"","Ye Huining’s face lit up. \"You remember?!\"","Qiao Chuchu grinned and turned away.","Mission accomplished.","Two million dollars, here we come.","She grabbed Lou Yuejue’s hand and started walking off—until Ji Yanchuan’s voice rang out behind them:","\"Actually, I’ve fallen for you!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","In perfect sync, they turned to stare at Ji Yanchuan, who stood atop the wreckage like a lovesick fool.","Ji Yanchuan was drenched in sweat, clutching his chest as he gazed earnestly at Qiao Chuchu. \"That day when I chased after your car, I wanted to apologize to you. But then I got hit by a car, and I forgot everything. Now, though, I remember.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him in shock from the shadows.","Ji Yanchuan stood in the light, shaking his head in remorse as he looked at her.","It was as if he couldn’t bear to admit the truth, yet he had no choice but to face it.","An overwhelming love spilled from the corners of his eyes, from every flicker of his expression.","He couldn’t hide it. He couldn’t control it.","\"I know you hate me. And I know that by saying this, I’m betraying the dignity I should uphold.\"","\"But I really do like you.\"","\"I truly, truly like you.\"","\"Please give me a chance to pursue you, Qiao Chuchu.\""]},{"number":307,"title":"Chapter 307: The Truth","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan stood in the wind, his expression stern as he waited for Qiao Chuchu's answer.","Lou Yuejue nervously tightened his grip on Qiao Chuchu's hand, afraid she might impulsively agree.","Qiao Chuchu: \"Are you out of your mind?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him with disdain: \"I find it disgusting just hearing you breathe in front of me, and you expect me to give you a chance? Listening to your confession makes my ears feel dirty!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?!\"","Was he really that unworthy?!","Qiao Chuchu turned away in disgust: \"After everything you’ve done to me, you still dare to confess? Acting like you’re some one-of-a-kind devoted lover—it’s sickening.\"","Ji Yanchuan choked on his words, too furious to speak.","Lou Yuejue beamed, shaking Qiao Chuchu’s arm: \"Thank goodness, sis! At least you’re not blind!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked: \"Of course!~\"","Just then, a girl rushed up to her: \"Wait, please!\"","Qiao Chuchu took a closer look—it was Meng Xue'er.","[Speaking of Meng Xue'er, she’s the third female lead in the script.]","[After Ji Yanchuan lost his memory, he fell in love with Meng Xue'er.]","[The female lead even had a rivalry with Meng Xue'er over him for a while.]","Lou Yuejue scoffed at the thought.","A male lead who falls for another woman doesn’t deserve to be called the male lead!","Sis deserves a better one!","Qiao Chuchu smiled politely at Meng Xue'er: \"Don’t worry, Miss Meng. I have no feelings for Ji Yanchuan. I won’t interfere in your relationship.\"","Meng Xue'er froze for a moment before lowering her head sadly: \"I do like him, but he doesn’t like me. Even when he lost his memory, I knew he had someone else in his heart. He only got close to me because I resemble you. Now that he’s regained his memories, there’s no chance for us.\"","Hesitantly, she looked up at Qiao Chuchu: \"I want to ask... could you give him a chance to pursue you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Meng Xue'er twisted her hands nervously, knowing how awkward her request sounded, but she pressed on: \"I’m not asking you to accept him. Just... don’t hate him so much. He really is a good person.\"","\"Miss Meng,\" Qiao Chuchu cut her off coldly, \"He once hired people to assault me and tried to film it.\"","Meng Xue'er was stunned: \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression turned grave: \"If you were me, would you give someone like that a chance?\"","Meng Xue'er’s eyes widened in shock: \"Is that true?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded: \"Yes. He admitted it himself. Ask him now, and he’ll probably confess again.\"","Meng Xue'er’s face paled. Without another word, she stormed over to Ji Yanchuan and slapped him hard across the face: \"You scum! How dare you ask for forgiveness after doing something so vile?! You make me sick! We’re done!\"","A red handprint bloomed on Ji Yanchuan’s cheek, but he didn’t react in anger. Instead, he stared at Qiao Chuchu: \"If hitting me makes you feel better, I wish you’d be the one to do it.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t even glance at him as she walked away.","Ji Yanchuan watched her retreating figure, his gaze darkening.","His fists clenched, veins bulging at his temples as he muttered, \"You forced this, Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu and Lou Yuejue got into the car. She glanced toward the roller coaster—Ji Yanchuan stood at the highest point, his eyes locked onto her vehicle.","Her heart was in turmoil.","[According to the script, after Ji Yanchuan regains his memories, it’ll be my turn. But before I recover my memories, I’ll be kidnapped. I wonder if we can prevent it.]","Lou Yuejue quickly pulled out his phone and typed into a group chat:","「Sis Chuchu just got confessed to by Ji Yanchuan.」","Pei Yuan: 「?」","Pei Che: 「?」","Pei Youchuan: 「?」","Pei Fengnong: 「?」","Pei Mu: 「?」","Pei Ci: 「?」","Pei Buxian: 「?」","Lou Tingsi: 「And then?」","Lou Yuejue: 「She tore into him! It was epic! But Ji Yanchuan has already regained his memories. Sis says that after him, she’ll recover hers too—but before that, she’ll be kidnapped!」","Shi Yu: 「No problem. I’ll call for bodyguards.」","Shen Zhuoyan: 「I’m almost home.」","Lin Shen: 「Can I go stay with Qiao Chuchu?」","Lin Qing: 「Of course, bro! The Pei family’s mansion is big enough for all of us!~」","Weisheng Wenzhan: 「Then let’s all stay together for now. Safety in numbers. @Pei Yuan.」","Weisheng Lin: 「Big bro’s right!」","Weisheng Biehe: 「Agreed.」","Weisheng Yucan: 「True.」","Weisheng Huailing: 「Sis only needs me. I can protect her from the whole world alone.」","Shi Yu: 「?」","Ying Chen: 「?」","Ying Chen sent a meme.","Lou Yuejue excitedly added: 「Can we plan a surprise for sis?!」","Lou Tingsi: 「You mean all of us hiding in one room to celebrate her birthday?」","Lou Yuejue: 「Yes! I want her to be happy!」","Pei Yuan hesitated before replying: 「Fine. Let’s do it.」","There would always be moments when they couldn’t protect her.","Especially with the risk of \"plot enforcement.\"","Seeing his elder brother agree, Pei Che chimed in: 「No objections here. But I can’t come back tonight—I have a property viewing tomorrow. See you all in the evening.」","Weisheng Biehe: 「Funny, I’m also viewing a place tomorrow.」","Ying Chen: 「? What a coincidence. I’ll be touring one in a wheelchair.」","Lou Tingsi: 「Even funnier—I’m going with Pei Che.」","Lin Qing: 「? Are you all looking at the same property?」","Lou Yuejue chuckled at the chat, grinning at his phone—until the car suddenly braked hard!","His phone flew out of his hands!","His face fell as he bent to pick it up—but a delicate hand snatched it first.","Horrified, he looked up at Qiao Chuchu.","She didn’t check the screen, simply handing it back: \"Did it break?\"","Lou Yuejue reached for it anxiously: \"Should be fine. Let me see.\"","She nodded, her gaze accidentally skimming the display—","Group Name: [Listening to Qiao Chuchu’s Thoughts Group]","Qiao Chuchu yanked the phone back: \"What kind of group is this?!\"","Lou Yuejue panicked: \"Sis! Don’t look at my phone! That’s invading my privacy!\"","Ignoring him, she scrolled through the chat history.","Lou Yuejue lunged to grab it—but she dodged, scrolling faster and faster!","—「Qiao Chuchu knows we’re hiding something, but not what.」","—「I told you we should’ve confessed we can hear her thoughts!」","—「No! We don’t know what punishment that might trigger. Plus, she’d be furious!」","Qiao Chuchu froze.","What... was this?","A \"thoughts-listening\" group?","They could hear her inner monologue?!","Qiao Chuchu picked up her phone and opened the WPS document. Inside, a highlighted line caught her eye: \"They’re keeping secrets from me, and I don’t know what it is. My wild guess is they’ve figured out I’m a transmigrator.\"","But it wasn’t just about knowing her identity...","They could hear her thoughts!","Her body trembled uncontrollably as she clicked open the group chat members list in disbelief.","Everyone around her was there.","Everyone—except her.","Hands shaking, she typed into the group: \"Emergency. Video call now. It’s about Qiao Chuchu.\"","She initiated a group video call.","Lou Tingsi was the first to join, his usual lazy smirk in place. \"Kid—\"","His smile froze.","Qiao Chuchu sat at the center of the screen, watching as familiar faces joined one by one.","Confusion flickered across their expressions—until they saw her face. Then, their expressions twisted in shock.","A suffocating silence filled the air.","Tears of fury glistened in Qiao Chuchu’s eyes as her lips curled into a mocking smile. \"Hello, members of the ‘Can Hear Qiao Chuchu’s Thoughts’ group chat.\""]},{"number":308,"title":"Chapter 308: The Cruel Truth","paragraphs":["The carriage was enveloped in suffocating silence.","Lou Yuejue sat beside Qiao Chuchu, feeling as though he could barely breathe. Tentatively, he spoke up: \"Sis—\"","\"Don’t talk.\"","Qiao Chuchu kept her eyes fixed on the faces in the video call. \"Don’t distract me from seeing them clearly.\"","The others fell silent.","Pei Yuan carefully broke the quiet: \"Chuchu, you already know.\"","She didn’t respond, minimizing the video call to continue scrolling through the chat history.","She scrolled all the way back to the beginning.","The further she read, the colder her body grew, the more her heart pounded with dread!","A flood of information crashed into her mind!","Her head throbbed violently, and she tossed the phone aside, feeling as if her skull might split open!","\"Sis!\" Lou Yuejue panicked, grabbing her arm. \"Are you okay?! What’s wrong?!\"","Voices clamored from the phone: \"Chuchu, what’s happening?!\"","\"Are you feeling sick?!\"","Dizzy and nauseous, Qiao Chuchu didn’t dare move.","She feared even the slightest motion would make her vomit.","When the dizziness finally subsided, it was as if her soul had snapped back into place—her memories returned in full force.","Driven by the pain, she gradually steadied herself.","[I’ve regained my memories.]","[Just like the script said, my memories returned under intense stress. I guess this counts as stress too.]","A cold laugh escaped her lips.","[Stress from my own people.]","Lou Yuejue’s expression shifted, unsure whether this was good or bad. He hesitantly gripped her arm. \"Sis...\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to him.","Under the gentle glow of the starlit roof in the silent car, tears welled in her eyes—not from fragility, but from fury with no outlet. \"Why didn’t you tell me?\"","Lou Yuejue’s worried face twisted into confusion. \"I—I—\"","Qiao Chuchu’s icy fingers tightened around his.","A silent demand, equal parts encouragement and coercion.","\"Why didn’t you tell me?\"","Her probing gaze locked onto Lou Yuejue as she mustered every ounce of restraint to ask softly, \"Do you have some unspeakable reason?\"","Lou Yuejue’s lips parted, his nose stinging with unshed tears.","Guilt was written plainly across his face, a stark contrast to his earlier haughty demeanor when he’d thrown things in anger.","He even leaned back slightly, trying to pull away from her grip.","\"Sis, I don’t know how to say it... I don’t know how...\"","Lou Yuejue was resisting her.","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened. \"Stop the car.\"","Lou Yuejue: \"? Sis?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised her voice: \"Stop the car!!!\"","The car screeched to a halt.","Without a backward glance, Qiao Chuchu stepped out.","Lou Yuejue panicked, chasing after her. \"Sis! Sis, wait!\"","The bewildered bodyguards followed, lining up along the roadside.","Qiao Chuchu walked faster.","Lou Yuejue caught up. \"Sis—\"","She shoved him toward the bodyguards. \"Get lost!!!\"","Lou Yuejue paled, trembling at her shout, fear flashing in his eyes.","His phone was clutched tightly in his hand, the screen still facing Qiao Chuchu.","Bathed in the car’s headlights, she looked like she might shatter, her body haloed in gold. \"I thought you all genuinely cared about me! But you were just using me!!\"","Lou Yuejue’s legs gave out, the bodyguards catching him as he bit his lip, terrified.","Chaos erupted from the video call.","Lou Tingsi rushed to explain: \"Miss Qiao, my son was following my orders! Let me explain—I told him not to say anything!\"","Lou Yuejue seized the lifeline, lifting the phone toward Qiao Chuchu. \"Yes, Dad! Hurry and explain! Don’t let sis stay mad at me!\"","As he raised the phone, the others finally saw Qiao Chuchu’s face.","Tears brimmed in her eyes as she stared at the camera.","Like she was looking at enemies.","Their hearts lurched.","Lou Tingsi’s chest ached as he spoke carefully: \"When we first met you, I could already hear your thoughts. But because it involved life-and-death matters for me and my son, we chose not to tell you.\"","\"I’m sorry.\"","\"I was selfish. I wanted to protect us, so I kept it from you.\"","\"Miss Qiao, I’m sorry...\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing.","Two fat tears rolled down her cheeks. \"Then what about my brother? Why didn’t he tell me?\"","The Pei family’s faces drained of color, their mouths opening and closing soundlessly.","The silence choked Qiao Chuchu. She gritted her teeth. \"You all knew the plot from the start. You knew I died over and over to save you!!\"","She glared into the camera. \"Pei Fengnong, do you know what it feels like to suffocate?!\"","\"I held on through sheer willpower! I kept thinking—I have to revive you, I have to see you again, I want our family whole—and I endured it!!!\"","Pei Fengnong’s eyes reddened. \"Chuchu—\"","\"And Lin Qing!\"","Lin Qing flinched at the sudden callout.","On screen, Qiao Chuchu looked utterly betrayed, tears streaming. \"That time you were kidnapped, I knew you’d suffer. I didn’t want you to endure that, so I risked my life to save you! And what happened? Your father shot me in the shoulder, then in the forehead!\"","\"I died once and still kept protecting you!\"","\"Tell me—how many people in this world would go that far? Who would knowingly face death to save someone they’re not even related to?!\"","Lin Qing’s eyes welled up, guilt-ridden. \"I’m sorry...\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head, crying. \"After everything I did for you, was honesty too much to ask?! What would’ve happened if you’d just told me from the start?!\"","\"Or did you think it didn’t matter because I could just come back to life?!\"","Her voice cracked. \"When I make friends, I give them my all. I’m not as clever as you, not as calculating—but I thought sincerity would be met with sincerity!\"","\"I even naively believed you liked me for who I am.\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a bitter laugh. \"I was wrong. You were only nice to me out of survival instinct!\"","Lou Yuejue and the others shouted in unison: \"That’s not true! We genuinely care about you!!\"","She fired back: \"Then why couldn’t you tell me the truth?!\"","They froze.","Qiao Chuchu demanded, \"Or do you have a system controlling you too?! Does your heart hurt when you try to tell the truth?!\"","A familiar, searing pain flared in her chest—the same warning she’d endured under the system’s control, when honesty was forbidden.","Clutching her heart, she let out a strained laugh. \"You already knew I was forced into this by the system. I admit I was conditioned—back then, I was trapped, helpless, unable to speak freely!\"","\"So what’s your excuse?! Were you conditioned too?!\"","Her face gradually turned a sickly shade of purple. \"Don’t tell me you—you’re like me too? After telling the truth, you also—\"","Before Qiao Chuchu could finish her sentence, she collapsed to the ground with a thud.","Lou Yuejue saw her falling and lunged forward, catching her just in time—taking the brunt of the impact as they both hit the floor!","\"Master!\" the bodyguard cried out in alarm.","Lou Yuejue, acting as a human cushion, held Qiao Chuchu securely against him, wincing in pain. \"Get her to the hospital—now!\""]},{"number":309,"title":"Chapter 309: Caged Bird","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu woke up in a large bed.","The blanket covering her was light and silky, and the air carried a faint, pleasant fragrance.","It was the familiar scent of her room’s aromatherapy.","But this wasn’t her room.","She sat up, looking around in confusion.","The room was decorated in creamy white tones, spacious and luxurious, with a walk-in closet and study visible at a glance.","This wasn’t her room.","Yet it was filled with her belongings?","She walked straight to the closet.","The closet was expansive and meticulously organized—her bags neatly categorized and displayed in glass cabinets with motion-sensor lighting.","As she approached, the lights automatically illuminated, as if paving a path of opulence just for her.","Something felt off. She opened the wardrobe, and the more she looked, the more uneasy she became.","This wasn’t her room, yet it was packed with her clothes—even her favorite childhood pajamas were here!","Qiao Chuchu rushed to the door, trying to open it.","It was locked.","A chime sounded from outside, as if signaling something.","She scanned the room, searching for something to pick the lock.","Then, with a sharp click, the lock turned.","Someone had opened the door.","She grabbed a decorative vase from the coffee table, hiding it behind her back, and glared warily at the door.","Weisheng Yucan stepped inside.","Dressed in an elegant black silk three-piece set, her dark hair lazily pinned up, she smiled at Qiao Chuchu. \"You’re finally awake.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Finally?\"","[Have I been asleep for long?]","\"You’ve been asleep for three days,\" Weisheng Yucan replied matter-of-factly.","Qiao Chuchu froze, then laughed coldly. \"You’re not even bothering to hide it anymore, are you?\"","\"Things are already out in the open. There’s nothing left to hide.\" Weisheng Yucan circled behind her and took the vase she’d hidden. \"We’ve been waiting for you to wake up. We want to talk properly.\"","Qiao Chuchu shoved her away. \"No!\"","She hurried out of the room.","Weisheng Yucan watched her retreating figure calmly. \"You can’t run, Chuchu. Sit down. They’ll be here soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu shot her a strange look, only then noticing the long nightgown she was wearing.","She lifted the hem, glancing around.","This was a house she’d never been to—she had no idea where to go.","Her heart pounded wildly. \"Xiao Xie! Xiao Xie!!\"","Pei Buxian’s voice sounded behind her. \"Xiao Xie isn’t here.\"","She turned in surprise.","Pei Buxian looked at her sorrowfully. \"Xiao Xie is at your old home. Only we are here.\"","[We?]","Qiao Chuchu didn’t understand.","[Who’s ‘we’?]","Pei Buxian stepped closer. \"You, the seven of us brothers, Lin Qing and Lin Shen, the five Weishengs, Lou Tingsi and his son, Ying Chen, Shen Zhuoyan, and Shi Yu.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in shock.","[Everyone’s here?!]","Then it hit her: [Wait—did he just respond to my thoughts?]","\"Yes, Chuchu.\" Pei Buxian reached out, brushing her cheek. \"I am speaking to your thoughts.\"","A wave of horror surged through Qiao Chuchu, goosebumps erupting across her skin like a tidal wave.","Pei Buxian’s hand lingered gently on her face.","His bloodshot eyes reflected her image. \"I haven’t heard your voice in three days. You’re finally awake.\"","Disgusted, Qiao Chuchu slapped his hand away and bolted.","[Where is this?!]","[What is this place?!]","She sprinted to the staircase, turning the corner—only to collide with Weisheng Wenzhan ascending the steps.","Dressed in comfortable black sleepwear, he looked up at her, his frameless glasses unable to hide the heat in his gaze. \"You’re awake, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu averted her eyes, spotting Weisheng Lin behind him.","Weisheng Lin grinned up at her. \"Seeing you alive and well feels amazing.\"","Her face paled. With no escape, she dashed up to the third floor.","[It’s fine! It’s fine!]","[Big houses like this have multiple staircases—there’s got to be a way out!]","She reached the third floor and rushed toward another staircase.","Weisheng Lin’s voice echoed from below: \"Chuchu, stop running! None of these stairs will lead you out!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s pupils constricted.","[They can hear my thoughts from this far away?!]","Her foot caught on her nightgown, sending her stumbling forward—","Strong hands caught her just in time.","Terrified, she looked up into Shen Zhuoyan’s pained, conflicted eyes. \"Are you okay?\"","Instinctively, she wanted to cling to him—but remembering he could hear her thoughts, she jerked her hand back. \"Shen Zhuoyan, I trusted you so much. How is this not a betrayal?\"","Shen Zhuoyan lowered his head guiltily, like a man resigned to punishment. \"Hit me if you want. I didn’t want to tell you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"Why?\"","After a hesitation, he met her gaze. \"Because I could hear you praise me, hear your real thoughts. If I told you the truth, you’d hold back, and I’d never hear those words again.\"","He pulled her into an embrace, his broad shoulders an immovable mountain.","His voice was heavy with remorse. \"I’m sorry.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s breath hitched. Shoving him away in disgust, she lifted her nightgown and ran for the central staircase.","Pei Yuan was coming up the steps, his face lighting up at the sight of her. \"Chuchu?\"","Ignoring him, she charged downstairs—only to find Pei Mu and Pei Ci ascending toward her.","Like a pair of meticulously crafted duplicates, they grinned in eerie unison. \"Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu whirled around and ran back.","Pei Yuan caught her arm, blocking her path. \"Where are you going?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci closed in from both sides, pressing against her. \"Chuchu, you’ve been asleep for days. Now that you’re awake, let’s talk. Don’t avoid us.\"","She recoiled from their touch. \"Don’t touch me!!\"","Pei Yuan tightened his grip, pulling her close. \"Chuchu, I know you’re angry, but don’t you want an explanation? Won’t you listen to your big brother?\"","She wrenched free. \"Like hell I will!!\"","Losing her balance, she stumbled backward—","Hands steadied her shoulders. \"Careful!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned, horrified, to see Pei Youchuan watching her with concern. \"You just woke up from a coma. You can’t afford another fall. Let me take you back to your room.\"","Gasping, she pushed Pei Youchuan away and scrambled upstairs again.","Pei Yuan sighed, following at a measured pace. \"Chuchu, stop running. You’ll exhaust yourself.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced back.","Pei Yuan, Pei Mu, Pei Ci, and Pei Youchuan were advancing toward her.","Behind them came Shen Zhuoyan, Weisheng Wenzhan, and Weisheng Lin.","Their long legs carried them forward with unsettling calm, their expressions a mix of worry and certainty—as if they knew she couldn’t escape.","Her nerves frayed. \"Are you keeping me prisoner?\"","They paused, their gazes darkening with unreadable emotions.","\"This isn't imprisonment, Chuchu,\" Pei Youchuan stepped forward, speaking to her with sincerity. \"We're just protecting you.\"","Pei Yuan nodded, his expression pained as he added, \"We know you're supposed to go through the kidnapping plotline, so this is for your own good.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"You were afraid someone else would kidnap me... so you kidnapped me first?!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci looked baffled. \"How can you call this kidnapping?!\"","They took a step closer, offering her an ingratiating smile. \"You were so angry before—we were just afraid you'd leave us.\"","Pei Mu coaxed her gently, \"For now, just stay here. This is a new house we bought for you. We only own a small share, so all our names are on the same property deed!\"","Pei Yuan smiled warmly at this, his voice tender as he asked, \"Our names are right next to each other! Do you want to see?\""]},{"number":310,"title":"Chapter 310: Home","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stared at them in shock, taken aback by their casual expressions.","It was as if they were just chatting with her about everyday things.","Her mouth hung slightly open, unable to comprehend their calm demeanor.","[They’re insane...]","She couldn’t hold back any longer: “You’re all fucking crazy!!!”","With that, she turned and sprinted toward the staircase at the end of the hall!","This was the last staircase.","Her final chance to escape!","Lou Tingsi happened to run into her head-on.","His signature fox-like grin spread across his face: “Our sleeping beauty is awake?”","She ignored him, lifting her skirt as she dashed down the stairs, nearly colliding with Lou Yuejue.","Lou Yuejue beamed: “Sister!”","She halted, glaring at Lou Tingsi in disbelief: “You brought your son along for this?! Aren’t you afraid of corrupting a child?!”","Lou Tingsi’s smile faded, replaced by a wounded expression as he met her furious gaze: “You’re so mean.”","Lou Yuejue tugged at her sleeve: “Sister, don’t be angry.”","She turned to Yuejue, puzzled.","Yuejue smiled gently at her: “My father and I are the same kind of people. You don’t need to worry about me.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","[Right, how could I forget? This is the father-son duo with the mentally unstable personalities. Lou Yuejue is a little yandere! In the original plot, he was obsessed with Xia Xuechun!]","Lou Yuejue’s eyes darkened. He stepped onto the higher stair to meet her gaze, his lips curling into a sweet smile: “Sister, I was never obsessed with Xia Xuechun. From the very beginning, it was you I wanted. The version of me in the script wasn’t the real me. None of us actually pursued the people the story forced us to chase.”","He tilted his head, grinning: “I believe the versions of us outside the plot are the real ones.”","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened: “I have nothing to say to you!”","She bolted downstairs.","Lin Qing and Lin Shen approached her: “Chuchu!”","Lin Qing ran up to her: “You’re awake!”","Qiao Chuchu ignored them, brushing past!","Lin Shen chased after her: “Don’t go, Chuchu! Let’s talk!”","She shoved him aside, lifting her skirt as she continued her frantic descent.","Shi Yu was waiting for her on the first floor. When he saw her, he pointed down the hallway: “Miss Qiao, there’s an elevator at the end of the corridor that leads to the underground garage.”","Qiao Chuchu frowned: “You’re actually giving me directions? Aren’t you afraid those psychos will kill you for it??”","Shi Yu paused, then smirked meaningfully: “Even when you’re this angry, you’re still worried about me. Miss Qiao, you really are kind.”","She choked back a retort, speechless, and sprinted toward the garage.","As the elevator doors slid open, she rushed inside.","A pale, slender hand suddenly gripped the door!","Her breath hitched as she looked up into Pei Che’s dark, unreadable eyes.","Pei Che stared at her calmly, his voice low: “Come out, Chuchu. You can’t leave. You’re just wasting your energy.”","She ignored him, frantically pressing the close-door button: “You don’t get to decide whether I can leave or not!”","Pei Che sighed, releasing the door and watching as it slowly shut between them.","When the elevator reached the basement, she scanned the garage in panic, searching for her car.","[All my things were moved here, so my car should be here too.]","Her eyes locked onto a white G-Wagon, and she dashed toward it!","Another car suddenly pulled into the garage, stopping right beside her G-Wagon!","Qiao Chuchu’s face paled as she stared at the vehicle.","Weisheng Biehe stepped out, frowning disapprovingly at her disheveled state and bare feet: “Why are you dressed so lightly? What if you get a fever again?”","He walked toward her: “Come on, let’s go back inside.”","Qiao Chuchu ignored him, pressing the unlock button on her car.","With so many vehicles and a private garage, theft was never a concern—so she always left her keys inside.","But this time, the car didn’t unlock.","Her heart pounded: “What’s going on?!”","A jingling sound made her turn.","Weisheng Huailing dangled a keychain in front of her, smiling innocently: \"Were you looking for this, sister?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s pupils shrank as she recognized the familiar keychain—covered in her signature stickers.","[Those are all my car keys!]","She gaped at Huailing.","[Did he hide all my keys to stop me from escaping?!]","Huailing’s eyes gleamed as he signed: \"Sister, I just didn’t want you to leave.\"","His smile was deceptively sweet, his dark gaze fixed on her: \"As long as I have these, you can’t take them. Let’s go back.\"","Qiao Chuchu lunged for the keys!","Huailing effortlessly dodged, shaking his head: \"Sister, you can’t win against me. You’re no match for me.\"","Ying Chen chimed in: “Talking like that will only upset her.”","Qiao Chuchu whipped her head toward the voice.","Ying Chen emerged from the elevator. Though he had been weak from blood loss days prior, he now moved with ease as he approached her: “She just woke up and isn’t ready to accept that we’re all living together.”","His emerald-green eyes settled on her: “Chuchu, stop making a scene. Let’s go upstairs.”","Qiao Chuchu scoffed: “? ‘Chuchu’?”","She laughed bitterly: “Since when are we on a first-name basis?”","Ying Chen blinked, then smirked, undeterred: “Of course we are. I just transferred you 300 million the other day.”","Qiao Chuchu sneered: “Who wants your money?!”","Ying Chen raised a brow: “That’s not what you were thinking when I offered it. You were thrilled.”","Her face twisted in fury: “Stop bringing up my thoughts! All of you schemed against me! When I lost my memory, you and Weisheng Biehe even pretended to be my boyfriend and his mistress!”","Ying Chen and Weisheng Biehe stiffened, glancing away awkwardly.","Weisheng Huailing signed in confusion: \"...What? That happened???\"","Qiao Chuchu glared at the keys in Huailing’s hand, gritting her teeth.","[If I can’t drive, I’ll run!]","[I refuse to believe I can’t escape!!]","Ying Chen sighed: “You won’t get far, Qiao Chuchu. We’ve already prepared for everything.”","She bolted out of the garage, sprinting across the lawn toward the gates!","The others streamed out of the house, calling after her: “Chuchu, stop running! You can’t leave!”","She glanced back.","Led by Pei Yuan, the group advanced toward her with concern.","They moved like a unified force—an abyss of overwhelming pressure, threatening to swallow her whole.","Her fear intensified.","[These aren’t the kind of friends I wanted!]","[They’re all just a bunch of deranged kidnappers!]","She pushed herself harder, racing for the gates—","Her slipper caught on the grass!","She crashed face-first onto the lawn!","The men rushed to her: “Chuchu!”","Pei Yuan reached her first, turning her over: “We told you not to run!”","He winced at the scrapes on her palms: “Let’s go home, okay? Enough of this.”","She pushed her away: \"Don't touch me!!\"","Pei Che's expression darkened beside her. Without hesitation, he scooped her up forcefully. \"Why make this so difficult?! You're coming with me!!\"","Panicked, she thrashed wildly, arms and legs flailing. \"Let me go!!!\"","Pei Youchuan clamped down on her ankles, his grip firm. \"Stop struggling, Chuchu.\"","Pei Fengnong held her wrists tightly, his eyes filled with concern. \"Chuchu, enough of this. Let’s go home.\"","Lou Yuejue nodded eagerly. \"That’s right, sis. We’d never hurt you.\"","Helpless, she found herself surrounded, the exit slipping further away as her gaze darted toward the mansion’s grand door.","There, seated in a wheelchair at the threshold, Shi Yu interlaced his fingers and smiled warmly at her.","\"Welcome home, Miss Qiao.\""]},{"number":311,"title":"Chapter 311: Forgive Us","paragraphs":["\"Madmen!\"","\"All of you are madmen!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was held tightly in Pei Che's arms, her limbs completely restrained.","She struggled with all her might, like a lamb being thrown into a boiling pot of oil: \"Let me go!!!\"","Pei Che carried her into the room and gently placed her on the bed.","Qiao Chuchu sprang up like a carp, trying to slip through any gap to escape.","Pei Che effortlessly pushed her back down!","She fell onto the soft mattress, disbelief in her voice: \"How dare you treat me like this?!\"","They surrounded her in a tight circle.","Every face that had once been gentle and kind to her now looked just as refined and beautiful—even as they did something so outrageous.","So beautiful it sent chills down her spine.","She grabbed a pillow and hurled it straight at Pei Che: \"Did I waste all my sincerity on you?!\"","Their expressions faltered, eyes filled with sorrow as they stared at her in silence.","Qiao Chuchu felt like she was kicking cotton—her anger had nowhere to go. \"Say something!\"","Pei Che was the first to move.","He bent down to pick up the pillow: \"It really isn’t surprising, Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He knelt on the bed, crawling closer to her, placing the pillow back in its original spot before tilting his head to look at her: \"We’ve always been this kind of people.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, her gaze darting around at the figures encircling her.","Pei Che followed her line of sight, speaking slowly and deliberately: \"From the youngest, Lou Yuejue, to the adults among us—you’ve known from the start that we’re not good people. Every one of us is a ruthless, twisted freak.\"","Lou Yuejue, standing on the other side, added mournfully: \"That’s right, sis. Didn’t you love us before? You said the more twisted a fictional character is, the more appealing they are.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Weisheng Yucan smiled brightly: \"Exactly, Chuchu. Didn’t you save me because I was the sister you adored so much?\"","She glanced at the person beside her: \"Our Weisheng family—weren’t we all characters you loved? Now, we all love you too.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes grew increasingly frantic as they darted between them.","Suddenly, the words her system had once told her echoed in her mind—","\"Host, every single person around you is a villain, rotten to the core.\"","Her face paled, and she instinctively shrank back against the headboard, fear creeping into her voice: \"So you think this is my fault? That because I saved you, I deserve this?\"","\"Of course it’s not your fault!\" Lin Qing sat beside her, cupping her face guiltily. \"It’s our fault. We shouldn’t have hidden the fact that we could hear your thoughts. We’re the ones in the wrong!\"","\"If you hadn’t saved us, we’d all be dead by now. You’re our savior!\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t accept it, her watery eyes pleading with Lin Qing: \"Then is this how you treat your savior?\"","Her voice trembled, though she didn’t seem to notice: \"You’re keeping me locked up here.\"","Lin Qing’s gentle expression darkened: \"But you wanted to run away.\"","She stiffened.","Lin Qing’s tone turned somber: \"None of us want you to leave. We’re not restricting your freedom—you can still go out.\"","Qiao Chuchu pointed at the door: \"Then let me out right now! Let me go!\"","\"It’s too late, Chuchu,\" Lin Qing said, taking her hand soothingly. \"It’s already 8 PM. The malls are closing—where would you even go?\"","She yanked her hand back furiously: \"I’m going home!\"","Lin Qing chuckled: \"But this is your home.\"","She reached into the bedside drawer and pulled out a property deed, flipping it open to reveal Qiao Chuchu’s name alongside theirs.","They were co-owners of the house.","Lin Qing handed the deed to her like a precious gift: \"Our new home is Lan City’s finest mansion, worth 8 billion. You own 82% of it—the rest of us each have 1%. Aren’t you happy?\"","Their eyes lifted in unison, watching her reaction eagerly.","Qiao Chuchu threw the deed to the floor: \"No, I’m not!\"","Their faces fell instantly.","Her chest heaved with anger, but she bit her lower lip hesitantly.","[Am I being too harsh?]","Their despondent eyes immediately lit up with hope.","Qiao Chuchu watched their expressions shift and suddenly realized—","[Wait, they can hear my thoughts!]","[That means even my internal monologue isn’t safe!]","[Ahhh, I can’t think anymore!]","Her face flushed with frustration as she looked up at them.","Their eyes were fixed on her, lips curled in adoring smiles.","Qiao Chuchu shuddered: [How can they still smile at a time like this?!]","[This is like being naked in front of them!]","She snapped, shoving Lin Qing away: \"All of you—get out! Now!!\"","Lin Qing stubbornly wrapped her arms around her: \"We’re not angry anymore. Didn’t you want freedom? Let’s talk properly. Once you truly forgive us, we won’t keep you like this.\"","Qiao Chuchu pushed her away again, her logic sharp: \"You shouldn’t have locked me up in the first place! Letting me go isn’t a favor—it’s what you should do!\"","Lin Qing’s voice cracked with sorrow: \"But if you leave, you won’t come back! We don’t want to lose you—we love you!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lin Qing poured her heart out: \"Just like how you helped us unconditionally before, we’ve been listening to your thoughts. Did you think we wouldn’t be enchanted by them?!\"","She grabbed Qiao Chuchu’s hand and slapped her own face with it: \"Hit me if it makes you feel better! Do whatever you want—just don’t be angry. Please, hit me!\"","Qiao Chuchu wrenched her hand free: \"Stop with the act!\"","Lin Qing flinched at her shout.","Blazing with fury, Qiao Chuchu shoved Lin Qing out the door: \"All of you—out!\"","She pushed Lin Qing into the hallway, then the others, before slamming the door shut with a \"Bang!\"","Lin Qing’s sobs were muffled through the door: \"Chuchu, let’s talk this through!\"","Ignoring her, Qiao Chuchu rushed to the window, mustering the courage to look down.","Suddenly, a strong arm wrapped around her waist and yanked her back!","She shrieked in shock: \"Ah! Let go of me!\"","Pei Fengnong—who had appeared out of nowhere—held her firmly, his voice stern: \"Don’t be reckless, Chuchu. Even from two stories up, a bad fall could break your legs or arms. Then you’d really never escape.\"","She gaped at the door, then back at him: \"How are you here?\"","[Didn’t I just push everyone out?!]","Pei Fengnong answered matter-of-factly: \"I hid behind the curtains during the chaos.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He tossed her back onto the bed—and pinned her down!"]},{"number":312,"title":"Chapter 312: You're Not Going Anywhere 02","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu resisted, “Don’t touch me!!”","Pei Fengnong ignored her protest, cupping her face as he humbly apologized, “I’m sorry, Chuchu. I shouldn’t have kept it from you back then. The others and I planned to come clean on the final day, but I didn’t expect you to find out now.”","“Do you really think I’d believe that?” Qiao Chuchu met his gaze, her eyes like a blade piercing his chest, her voice icy. “I was willing to die to save you, yet you couldn’t even give me a single honest word. Do you really expect me to buy such an excuse?!”","“I’m telling the truth! And I know I was wrong!” Pei Fengnong’s hands trembled as he held hers, pleading, “Don’t be angry with me. Punish me however you want!”","Qiao Chuchu’s attention drifted to the scar on his arm, her thoughts wandering.","Years ago, she and Pei Fengnong had been in a car together.","The system had ordered her to grab the steering wheel.","At the time, she had been shocked and furious—but she had done it anyway.","Because of her, Pei Fengnong’s arm had been shattered, leaving him with permanent damage and ending his dreams of F1 racing.","The internet had exploded with hate toward him. He had locked himself in his room, refusing food, refusing to see anyone, drowning in pain.","The memory made Qiao Chuchu’s chest tighten until she could barely breathe. “Pei Fengnong, of all the brothers, you’re the one I wronged the most. I ruined your future.”","Pei Fengnong stared at her in disbelief.","She lay on the bed, her long hair cascading softly around her, her gaze avoiding his as she looked out the window. “So when you died... even though I had no memories at the time, I was driven by something—some force—to bring you back.”","A tear from Pei Fengnong fell onto her face, as if she were the one crying.","Gradually, she calmed, meeting his eyes again. “So let’s call it even.”","Pei Fengnong: “?”","Qiao Chuchu pushed him away and sat up. “I ruined your future. There’s no washing that away. No matter how forced I was, what I did was wrong, and I should bear the consequences.”","“You hid the truth from me—that was also wrong. So we’re even.”","She got out of bed and strode to the walk-in closet, flinging open the jewelry cabinet. After sifting through the pieces, she picked out the ones Pei Fengnong had given her.","The most recent was that dazzling pink diamond ring.","She placed it on the table. “Take it all back. I’ll return every cent you ever gave me. I don’t want a single thing. From now on, we’re done.”","Pei Fengnong’s face paled. “I don’t want us to be done!”","In a flash, he was in front of her. “I don’t care what you did in the past—you were forced into it! Back then, I was too blind to see that, and I held a grudge against you. But now? I don’t blame you at all. I know you were trapped, that you had no choice!”","He bent down, begging her. “You saved my life. That’s not something we can just ‘call even’! Be angry with me, treat me however you want—just don’t cut me off, please!”","Qiao Chuchu’s expression remained wooden, unmoved by his pleas.","Like a breeze brushing past, leaving no ripple behind.","Pei Fengnong grew more frantic, turning her face toward him. “Chuchu, I’m begging you! I’ll do anything!”","Qiao Chuchu met his eyes. “Then help me now—let me leave.”","Pei Fengnong froze—then suddenly dropped to his knees!","Qiao Chuchu: “?!”","Dressed in a perfectly tailored suit, his hair neatly slicked back, his sharp features inches away—Pei Fengnong, who was known for his ruthless efficiency in public, now knelt before her, clutching her legs in desperate supplication.","“I’m kneeling for you. Don’t be angry with me. Please, Chuchu—name your terms. Whatever you want, I’ll do it!”","Qiao Chuchu’s face twisted in shock as she tried to pull him up. “Stop this! Get up!”","“I won’t!” Pei Fengnong clung to her legs. “I know I hurt you. I know words mean nothing now. Kneeling is the only thing I can think of. Punish me however you want—I’ll take it all! I swear!”","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t take it anymore. She shoved him to the ground. “I said we’re done! Stop being so shameless!!”","[He used to be so cold and short-tempered.]","[Now he’s no different from a dog!]","Pei Fengnong stumbled but scrambled back to wrap his arms around her legs. “I’ll be a dog! If it means you’ll forgive me, I’ll be a dog!”","He straightened on his knees, looking every bit like a loyal hound waiting for its master’s command. “I’ll give you my company. I’ll work for you for free. Just forgive me, please!”","Qiao Chuchu’s chest ached with fury. “Since when did you become so disgusting?!”","[Even in the script, when Pei Fengnong turned dark, he stood tall beside Xia Xuechun, never once bowing his head! What is this?!]","Pei Fengnong didn’t hesitate. “Xia Xuechun is Xia Xuechun. You’re you. We grew up together, shared hardships—how could she ever compare to you?!”","Qiao Chuchu stiffened.","[I still haven’t gotten used to them hearing my thoughts.]","She laughed bitterly. “Fine. If you care so much, then take me outside.”","Pei Fengnong: “?”","Qiao Chuchu leaned down, her voice a silken whisper. “You said you’d do anything I ask. So take me out. Can you do that?”","Pei Fengnong hesitated, lowering his head.","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes, taunting him. “Is this your so-called sincerity? You won’t even take me out?”","Pei Fengnong’s face darkened. “Of course not!”","“Then find a way to get me out!” Qiao Chuchu cupped his face eagerly. “If you do, you’ll still be my dear fourth brother. Deal?”","For a moment, Pei Fengnong wavered.","His eyes flickered with hope—only to dim seconds later as he coldly uttered—","“No.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Still kneeling, his expression hardened. “You’re just using me to escape. Once you’re out, you’ll never come back. Do you think I don’t know you?”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","Caught, she bit her lip guiltily.","Pei Fengnong wrapped his arms around her legs again, resuming his pleading. “Isn’t this enough? The brothers are all characters you love. Everyone you care about is right here. You can boss us around however you like—isn’t that good enough?”","He pressed her hand to his cheek. “You were willing to die for me. I’d do the same for you. I’ll give you anything—except your freedom.”","She yanked her hand back in disgust. “What I need now is distance from all of you!”","Pei Fengnong’s face darkened. “You’re not going anywhere!!!”","Qiao Chuchu: “?!”","In an instant, Pei Fengnong surged to his feet, his broad frame looming over her like a mountain as he crushed her against his chest!","She gasped, shoving at him. “Let go!!”","Pei Fengnong effortlessly tightened his grip, trapping her slender body against him. “Unless you agree to go back to how things were—you’re not leaving!”"]},{"number":313,"title":"Chapter 313: None of them are good, none of them are good, none of them are good, none of them are good","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu grew increasingly alarmed: \"Is this your plan? You won't let me out unless I forgive you?!\"","\"Correct.\" Pei Fengnong buried his face in the crook of her neck, his voice fierce: \"We won’t let you go until you truly forgive us.\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a disbelieving laugh: \"How would you even know when I’ve forgiven you?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"We can hear your thoughts. No matter how hard you try to suppress them, your inner voice can’t be hidden.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong released her, his expression earnest as he spoke: \"But don’t worry—in this house, you’re the boss. You’re the only one who matters. You’re not without freedom. You can go out with us—shopping, dining, wherever you want, whatever you want to do. We’ll make time to accompany you!\"","The more she listened, the less she understood: \"Don’t you realize how twisted this is?!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"Not at all.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Pei Fengnong cupped her face, his gaze tender and pleading: \"As long as you forgive me in the end, I’ll do anything. It’s fine if you resent me now—I’ll prove my sincerity to you.\"","Her breath hitched. She felt like she was losing her mind.","[They’re actually keeping me prisoner and don’t even see it as wrong!!]","Overwhelmed, she turned her face away: \"Get out.\"","Pei Fengnong hesitated: \"Chuchu—\"","She snapped: \"Out!!\"","Pei Che’s voice suddenly cut in: \"Leave, Pei Fengnong. I need to talk to her.\"","Qiao Chuchu startled, turning toward the sound.","Pei Che stood at the doorway, one hand in his pocket, the other holding a set of keys—likely to her room.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","[Does everyone have a key to my room?! Is my lock useless?!]","Pei Che tucked the keys back into his pocket: \"We modified the lock on your door. Even if you lock it, we can still open it—just in case we can’t get in.\"","Her jaw dropped in disbelief: \"What about my privacy?\"","\"You’ll have it,\" Pei Che said. \"Once you forgive us.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong cast one last longing glance at her before brushing past and stepping out.","Shadows lingered outside the door—it seemed many others were waiting there.","Pei Fengnong shut the door, muffling the noise beyond.","At a loss for words, Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at Pei Che: \"Second Brother.\"","\"Don’t call me that,\" Pei Che met her gaze unflinchingly. \"I don’t deserve to be your brother.\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a cold laugh, grinding her teeth in frustration: \"Then what will it take for you to let me go?\"","Pei Che didn’t answer. Instead, he stepped closer. \"You’re not well. Go lie down. Your hand is injured—let me treat it.\"","She shoved him away: \"Stay back!\"","Pei Che’s eyes darkened. In an instant, he pinned her against the wall, gripping both her wrists with one hand and lifting them above her head!","With practiced ease, he twisted open a bottle of antiseptic, holding her wrist steady while dabbing iodine onto her wound with a cotton swab.","\"Does it hurt?\"","His gaze flickered down as he tended to her: \"Tell me if it does.\"","Humiliated, Qiao Chuchu tried to kick him where it would hurt most!","But Pei Che was faster—his leg pressed against hers, his knee forcing her legs apart.","Her face paled: \"What are you doing?!\"","[I didn’t even think anything! My thoughts weren’t exposed this time!]","Pei Che ignored her protest, leaning in closer to finish dressing the wound. His eyes trailed downward, a faint smirk in their depths: \"Qiao Chuchu, I raised you. Even without hearing your thoughts, I can tell when you’re up to no good.\"","Setting the cotton aside, he murmured, \"There. Now I’m at ease.\"","Then, in one swift motion, Pei Che scooped her into his arms. \"Now it’s my turn to apologize.\""]},{"number":314,"title":"Chapter 314: Pei Che: Rather Than Your Hatred, I Fear Your Indifference More","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was gently placed on the bed by Pei Che.","Pei Che sat by the bedside, calmly gazing at her.","She recoiled, shifting away from him.","His eyes followed her unhurriedly, settling on her face.","Compared to Lin Qing and Pei Fengnong’s flustered apologies, Pei Che’s composure left her at a loss.","His deep, emotionless eyes bore into her: \"You must really hate me now.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s hostility was palpable: \"What do you think?\"","\"But I can’t bear not seeing you,\" Pei Che met her gaze squarely. \"I’d rather you hate me than have you avoid me, refuse to see me, or resent me.\"","She scoffed: \"If you care so much, why didn’t you just tell me from the start?\"","Pei Che: \"Because I didn’t want to.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Che leaned closer: \"Every time I heard your inner thoughts, I felt like the distance between us shrank. I became addicted to it—so I never planned to tell you. I thought revealing it would ruin what we had.\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled: \"You really don’t see yourself as normal, do you? How can you say something like that so casually?\"","Pei Che remained unfazed: \"I can hear your thoughts—that’s unfair. So I’ll lay mine bare too. That way, we’re even.\"","She leaned in, incredulous: \"So you’ve told me everything? No more secrets?\"","Pei Che paused, watching her face draw near.","His gaze dropped, lingering meaningfully on her lips.","\"There’s still one secret left.\"","His Adam’s apple bobbed, his voice roughening: \"But it won’t hurt you. You don’t need to worry.\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes: \"...I don’t care about your secret. I just want to leave.\"","The heat in Pei Che’s eyes cooled: \"Pei Fengnong must’ve made it clear earlier. If you forgive us, you can go.\"","Qiao Chuchu threw up her hands: \"Fine, I forgive you! I won’t be angry anymore. Happy now?!\"","Pei Che studied her.","She stared back, dead serious.","Pei Che: \"Do you really think I’d believe that?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Then if you won’t let me go, aren’t you afraid I’ll get even angrier? That things between us will never be the same?\"","Pei Che took her hand, coaxing gently: \"We have all the time in the world. You’ll see how good I can be to you—no more hiding.\"","She shuddered, yanking her hand free: \"Locking me up is your idea of being good?!\"","Pei Che tightened his grip: \"Anything but your freedom. Ask for anything else, and I’ll obey.\"","She laughed bitterly: \"What if I told you to strip and run naked through the yard?\"","Pei Che stood from the bed: \"Done.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Expressionless, he held her gaze: \"If it pleases you, I’ll do it.\"","His fingers began unbuttoning his shirt, swiftly shrugging it off!","His sculpted, pale torso was unveiled with startling impact!","As his hands moved to unbuckle his belt—","Qiao Chuchu leapt up, smothering him with the blanket: \"Are you insane?!\"","Pei Che’s pants slid out from under the covers as his muffled voice came through: \"Keeping you here is real. Obeying you is real too.\"","\"Anything to ease your anger—I’ll do it.\"","His head emerged from the blanket, tilting up at her from the bed. His eyes held an almost dogged sincerity: \"Punish me however you like.\"","Speechless, she yanked the blanket tighter around him: \"Just put your clothes back on!\"","She jumped off the bed, pacing furiously by the window.","[I need to figure out how to deal with these lunatics.]","A shadow flickered past outside.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Someone’s out there?]"]},{"number":315,"title":"Chapter 315: Kick That Would End Your Bloodline","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan stood at the door, his dark gaze fixed on the shadowy figures moving on the second floor.","He had learned that Qiao Chuchu had bought a house with these people and was now living happily with them.","A cold snort escaped his nostrils. \"Living like a princess now, are you?\"","A resentful glint flashed in his eyes. \"If I can't have her, no one will.\"","Suddenly, the barrel of a gun pressed against his temple.","Ji Yanchuan’s nerves tensed instantly as he turned to the side. \"...?\"","Weisheng Huailing stood there, gun in hand, his eyes curved in amusement as he tilted his head with a smirk.","Ji Yanchuan’s face paled as he staggered back.","Huailing pulled the trigger without hesitation!","...?","Another misfire?","Ji Yanchuan reacted swiftly, spinning around and bolting for the gate. He swiped a universal keycard to unlock the electronic lock of the Pei family’s door. \"Quick! Get inside and find her!\"","Out of nowhere, a swarm of bodyguards surged forward—at least thirty of them!","Huailing, seeing the overwhelming numbers, reluctantly holstered his gun.","Killing this many people with bullets would make disposing of the bodies a nightmare.","Instead, he drew a claw knife, moving like a snow-white leopard through the crowd, leaving trails of blood in his wake.","Soon, Lou Tingsi and Ying Chen joined him. \"We’ve got your back!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared in shock at the chaos unfolding in the courtyard. \"Why is Ji Yanchuan here?\"","A familiar static buzzed in her mind.","\"Zzzzt...\"","「System connecting—」","「Connection successful!」","Qiao Chuchu: \"...? You’re back?\"","System: \"...? Did you forget you still owe me a major mission? Did you think I’d let you choose to reincarnate for free?\"","Her eyes darted to the violent scene below, her tone laced with irritation. \"You showing up at a time like this can’t mean anything good!\"","The system chuckled. 「Don’t worry, Host. I currently have no authority to interfere with events in this world. My connection with you pertains to another world’s storyline. Right now, I’m just preparing in advance. Besides, since we’re linked, I can at least provide commentary—consider it a favor!」","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","Bound to another world’s storyline?","What did that mean?","Before she could ask, the system suddenly announced: 「Host, you’ve now entered the final arc of this world. All irrelevant characters will fall into slumber, while everyone tied to the main plot will appear to face their ultimate fate.」","「Until the story concludes, no matter how much chaos you cause, no one will interfere. Rest easy.」","「You can still alter the ending, but my current scans show Ji Yanchuan’s protagonist aura remains unshaken. As the female lead, your fate isn’t independent—it’s suppressed beneath his. This... might be tricky.」","Qiao Chuchu’s focus snapped back. \"What does that mean?\"","The system hesitated. 「The script might... force you to act in ways that align with the male lead’s emotions.」","Qiao Chuchu froze, then let out a mocking laugh. \"Even if my body gets hijacked, the worst they can do is threaten me with a knife. What else—\"","Before she could finish, her legs suddenly moved on their own, sprinting forward!","Not only that, but she also began shrieking like a maniac—","\"Waaah! My man Ji Yanchuan is here to save me! You villains are so dead!~\"","Laughing hysterically, she dashed past everyone. \"HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!\"","Pei Che: \"...?! Chuchu!!\"","Pei Yuan chased after her in panic. \"Chuchu!!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned back, flashing them a cheeky grin. \"My man’s here for me! I’m going to him!\"","They stood frozen behind her, exchanging bewildered looks.","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu’s mental screams echoed in their minds: 【WHAT MAN?! I DON’T HAVE A MAN!!!】","【MY LEGS, MY MOUTH, EVEN MY HANDS—NONE OF THEM ARE LISTENING TO ME!】","【AM I BEING POSSESSED?!】","【SOMEONE PLEASE WASH MY MOUTH SO I STOP TALKING ABOUT LOVING JI YANCHUAN!!!】","Realization dawned on them, and they collectively sighed in relief.","Pei Youchuan, his face ghostly pale, stammered, \"I—I thought she’d fallen for Ji Yanchuan at first sight!\"","He rushed forward and wrapped his arms around her tightly.","Qiao Chuchu’s leg shot up, kicking him square between the legs!","Pei Youchuan crumpled to his knees with a strangled gasp.","His face went from white to beet red. \"Chuchu, are you trying to end our bloodline?!\"","After the kick, Qiao Chuchu’s body still refused to obey, sprinting away again.","She managed to turn her head, looking back at him anxiously.","【IS HE OKAY?!】","Gritting his teeth, Pei Youchuan waved weakly. \"Don’t worry... I’ll live. Probably still functional.\"","Qiao Chuchu exhaled in relief—only for her body to charge straight into the kitchen.","Her right hand snatched up a kitchen knife!","Her expression twisted in horror as her left hand desperately wrestled the right one down.","The right hand fought back, straining against her grip.","Furious, she yelled at her own limb, \"I KNEW YOU WERE A TRAITOR!\"","Her left hand clamped down harder.","Qiao Chuchu lamented, \"I caught you betraying me last time too! You’re my right hand—my ACTUAL right hand! How could you?!\"","Most people dealt with metaphorical betrayals.","Hers was literal.","The right hand ignored her, still writhing.","She growled, \"Stop struggling, or I’ll chop myself!\"","Suddenly, her right hand wrenched free—and slashed toward her left!","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in terror—","—until a firm grip seized her wrist.","Weisheng Wenzhan stood there, his expression dark as he wrestled the knife from her grasp.","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up. 【MY GOOD SON! A MOTHER’S BLESSING!】","Wenzhan’s veins bulged from the effort as he gritted out, \"You know I can hear your thoughts, and you still call me your son?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...? Sorry, forgot.\"","He flung the knife aside—","—only for her body to lunge at him, hands clamping around his throat!","Wenzhan choked as she slammed him against the wall, his vision blurring. \"Gh—!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci rushed to pull her back. \"Chuchu!!\"","But her body was unnaturally strong, resisting their efforts with terrifying ease.","Wenzhan’s lips parted, desperate for air, but none came.","His gaze locked onto hers—","—where Qiao Chuchu’s usual panic had been replaced by something sinister.","Her lips curled into a grotesque smile. \"No one will stand in the way of our glorious love.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci recoiled. \"Chuchu...?\"","Ignoring them, she tightened her grip, intent on strangling him to death—","But Wenzhan, despite his agony, managed a faint smirk. His piercing stare seemed to see past her, addressing something deeper.","\"You can hijack her body all you want... but you’ll never control her. Qiao Chuchu only loves herself...\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, suddenly jolted back to awareness of what she was doing, and forcefully smacked her right hand away with her left."]},{"number":316,"title":"Chapter 316: Only One Can Live: Ji Yanchuan and Her","paragraphs":["Wen Zhan collapsed weakly, coughing violently: \"Cough, cough, cough, cough!\"","The other three members of the Weisheng family rushed over in concern, staring at Wen Zhan's neck: \"Big brother, are you okay?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan gasped for breath, sweat dripping onto the ground as he looked at Chuchu with a disheveled expression: \"I'm fine. Don't worry about me.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood before him, staring blankly at her right hand: \"What am I doing?\"","[Kicking Pei Fengnong, trying to strangle Weisheng Wenzhan, and even wanting to chop off my own left hand?]","[My body is no longer mine.]","[Even my mouth is spouting nonsense.]","The system said: \"The script must have noticed your defiance. It’s trying to force you back on track at any cost. If you keep resisting, it will keep controlling you. You managed to snap out of it this time, but next time might be different—your consciousness could be completely overtaken.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked around in confusion.","Everyone was watching her with concern.","Pei Youchuan and Weisheng Wenzhan didn’t blame her at all.","She lowered her head hesitantly, staring at her trembling right hand.","[There are unresolved conflicts between us—their imprisoning me was their fault.]","[But conflicts aside, survival is survival.]","[I didn’t work this hard just to throw these lives away.]","[I have to kill Ji Yanchuan! Otherwise, I’ll never be free!]","She steeled herself and turned to run toward the door: \"Don’t follow me! If you do, I’ll lose control again! Stay away if you don’t want to make things worse!\"","Their expressions darkened as they hesitated, watching her sprint for the exit.","The system was shocked: \"How are you going to kill Ji Yanchuan? You’re the female lead—his protagonist aura is stronger than yours! Going now is suicide!\"","Qiao Chuchu said firmly: \"Ji Yanchuan is like Xia Xuechun. The script can only be subverted at the last moment. If I act too soon, the script will force me back onto its path. I’ll play along for now and betray him at the critical moment.\"","Weisheng Huailing, Ying Chen, and Lou Tingsi noticed Qiao Chuchu running out and immediately rushed toward her!","Qiao Chuchu shot them a sharp glare.","[Stay away! Or I’ll lose control!]","The three froze as she charged straight for Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan spotted her from a distance and took a bottle from his subordinate: \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ll ask you one last time—will you be with me?!\"","She barreled toward him like a raging bull: \"Be with you, my bleep bleep bleep!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s face darkened as he splashed an unknown liquid all over her!","Qiao Chuchu stumbled to a stop, catching a whiff of a pungent odor—her eyes widened in horror.","Gasoline?!","She looked up just as Ji Yanchuan tossed a lit match at her!","Flames instantly engulfed her body!","She screamed in agony: \"AHHHHH!!!\"","Ji Yanchuan smirked, a cold laugh escaping his lips as he turned and got into his car.","She rolled on the ground, desperately trying to smother the flames, but it was useless. Pain and terror swallowed her like a tidal wave!","Lou Tingsi and Ying Chen sprinted toward her!","Through the roaring fire, she ignored her allies, enduring the excruciating pain as she glared at Ji Yanchuan’s retreating figure.","She had to kill him...","She HAD to kill him!!","The system sighed: \"I told you it wouldn’t work. Burning to death takes a long time. Did you really think Ji Yanchuan was some pushover? Let’s just reset.\"","Qiao Chuchu jolted awake, drenched in cold sweat.","The searing pain was gone.","She was running again—just like when she had first fled the house.","She skidded to a halt, spotting Ji Yanchuan standing at the entrance through the chaos of fighting bodies.","The number before her eyes shifted from 2 to 1.","Hatred surged through her, and she clenched her fists.","[Ji Yanchuan brought gasoline.]","Those who heard her thoughts froze.","Qiao Chuchu panted, her vision darkening with rage: [He planned to burn me alive!!]","[If the system hadn’t reset me, I’d still be rolling on the ground in agony!]","Their expressions darkened as they gathered around her.","Pei Yuan asked grimly: \"This time, Ji Yanchuan burned you to death?\"","Qiao Chuchu met his gaze.","Just their proximity made her body tremble uncontrollably—she wanted to kill them.","She took a step back, answering silently: [Yes.]","Their faces darkened further.","Qiao Chuchu glared at Ji Yanchuan with pure loathing: [This bastard has plot armor. His male lead aura is stronger than my female lead aura. I can’t touch him directly—I have to use his own weapon against him.]","She commanded Huailing: [Huailing, since you can hear me, go take his gasoline! But don’t hurt him! The rest of you, deal with his bodyguards!]","They nodded and scattered, engaging the incoming guards!","Weisheng Huailing dodged an attacker, weaving through the chaos to sneak up behind Ji Yanchuan!","Qiao Chuchu also charged toward him!","Ji Yanchuan shouted: \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ll ask you one last time—will you be with me?!\"","She stopped before him, hatred burning in her chest: \"I will NEVER be with you!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s expression twisted as he reached for his bottle—","Huh?","Where was it?!","He spun around and saw Weisheng Huailing waving the gasoline canister mockingly.","Didn’t see that coming, did you?","Ji Yanchuan’s face paled—then he suddenly pulled out a gun and aimed it at Qiao Chuchu!","Huailing reacted instantly, shielding her just as the trigger was pulled!","BANG!","Huailing shuddered, collapsing onto her with a weak groan.","Qiao Chuchu lay pinned beneath him, her hand pressing against his back—coming away soaked in blood!","[He had a gun?!]","She stared at Ji Yanchuan, a horrifying realization dawning.","[Ji Yanchuan could have just shot me, but he chose to burn me alive instead?!]","Ji Yanchuan sneered at the sight of her and Huailing embracing, raising his gun again—this time aiming at Huailing’s back!","A direct hit would be fatal!","Qiao Chuchu shoved Huailing aside and lunged at Ji Yanchuan!","BANG!","The bullet struck her chest!","She staggered but ignored the pain, gripping Ji Yanchuan’s wrist with all her strength!","Ji Yanchuan’s eyes burned with fury: \"You just won’t give up, will you?!\"","\"Qiao Chuchu, you brought this on yourself!\"","\"Shooting you is mercy—I was going to let you burn alive!\"","Her ears rang, drowning out his words as she wrestled for control of the gun.","Ji Yanchuan’s finger tightened on the trigger—","With a final burst of strength, she twisted his arm—","The barrel turned toward Ji Yanchuan himself!","BANG!","Ji Yanchuan collapsed, his eyes wide with shock as blood gushed from his throat.","He convulsed on the ground, staring at her in disbelief.","Qiao Chuchu stumbled back, collapsing into someone’s arms.","She smiled faintly at the sight of his fatal wound: \"You didn’t burn me... I won.\"","Ji Yanchuan gritted his teeth, unable to speak—but the corner of his lips curled into a smirk, his eyes gleaming with twisted satisfaction.","They were going down together.","He and she could die together.","But Qiao Chuchu sneered viciously, \"I still have one more life to be reborn—I won’t die with you!\"","Ji Yanchuan froze, unable to comprehend her words, and then took his last breath.","The swarm of bodyguards he had hired at great expense, sensing the danger, turned and fled!","Qiao Chuchu, too, gradually lost strength, collapsing into Pei Yuan’s arms as blood poured endlessly from her chest.","Her vision darkened. \"Huailing... where's Huailing...?\"","Weisheng Huailing struggled to rise, clutching his wounded shoulder, and grasped her hand.","Seeing that his injury wasn’t a gunshot to the heart, she finally relaxed. \"Don’t worry... you won’t die.\"","Tears welled in Huailing’s eyes as he signed frantically, \"But I don’t want you to die! Even if you have another chance, I don’t want you to die!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu gave a weak smile, gazing at the figures gathered around her. \"The finale... at last... it’s the finale. We won.\""]},{"number":317,"title":"Chapter 317: Come to a Bad End","paragraphs":["Pei Yuan held her tightly, tears streaming down his face: \"Yes, you won. You helped us win. It's our fault. We shouldn't have locked you up. Don’t be angry with us. As long as you’re healthy, we’ll do anything. We’ll never lock you away again! I’m sorry, Chuchu!\"","Their eyes were red and brimming with tears as they gazed at her.","She no longer had the strength to speak.","In her heart, she thought: I’m willing to talk things out with you openly, to see if there’s any way to turn things around.","Their eyes lit up. \"Really?\"","She weakly blinked.","But the system said: \"No time left, Host. You only have one life remaining. I’m sending you to another world to complete your mission.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Send me to another world? What about this one?\"","The group froze, unsure who she was speaking to.","The system replied: \"You can’t come back. Your lifespan in this world is exhausted, and I need to allocate your remaining life to another world. You have tasks to complete.\"","\"Transferring soul now—\"","\"Ten, nine, eight—\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face paled in horror. She clutched Pei Yuan’s hand. \"This time, I’m really going to die. My life is being sent to another world. I want to tell you all—actually, I—\"","Her pupils dilated sharply, her breath cut off, and she died in Pei Yuan’s arms.","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","He cradled her lifeless body, lifting her face in confusion. \"Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t respond.","Her eyes were open, but the light in them was gone, her body limp under his touch.","Pei Che quickly checked her pulse.","It had stopped.","His face twisted in panic as he pulled her away, intending to perform CPR—only to see the gaping bullet wound in her chest.","There was no way to save her now.","He grabbed his phone. \"Call an ambulance! Hurry!\"","The others stared at her lifeless body, calling her name in despair. \"Chuchu!!\"","Pei Buxian gripped her hand like a madman. \"Why isn’t my Chuchu coming back?! She said she still had one life left?!\"","Shi Yu, seated in his wheelchair, watched her lifeless form before suddenly coughing up blood.","Lou Yuejue was the most devastated, sobbing as he hugged her. \"Sister! Dad, save her! I don’t want her to die! I was wrong! I know I was wrong!!!\"","Cries and shouts filled the air, chaos reigning as everyone called out her name.","Qiao Chuchu’s soul drifted further away, the voices fading into indistinct echoes.","When she opened her eyes again, she stood in an unfamiliar place.","\"Bzzzt... Loading new world.\"","Dazed, she looked around and realized she was in an orphanage.","She glanced down at herself.","Her hands were tiny. Her feet were tiny.","She was a child again.","\"New world connection successful. This time, you’ve been assigned the ‘Switched at Birth’ script. You’ll play the fake heiress, going for a blood test alongside the real heiress. Someone will tamper with the results, ensuring you’re recognized as the fake heiress and live with the real family while the true heiress suffers in the orphanage.\"","\"You know the drill, so I won’t explain further. Here’s your script.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes darkened. \"No.\"","The system: \"? No?\"","She took a deep breath, her childish voice firm. \"I won’t ruin an innocent girl’s life. She’s the real blood relative. Why should I take her place?\"","\"Because the script says so! Because you agreed to this!\"","Qiao Chuchu sat on a stone bench, lost in memories of her brothers’ cries.","She could never return to that world.","There, she had done many things against her will.","This time, she refused to hurt anyone else.","Her chest ached as she calmly argued, \"I’ll fight through heaven and earth if you ask, but I won’t steal an innocent girl’s future by pretending to be her.\"","She gave up resisting. \"Punish me if you must. Even though this body is young, my soul is old. No matter how you torment me, I won’t play the fake heiress.\"","The system fell silent before growling, \"Fine. Then we’ll reset. I’ll make you obey like I did before!\"","A sharp pain tore through her chest!","Qiao Chuchu doubled over, eyes shut—but flashes of memories assaulted her.","Pei Buxian stood hopelessly on a rooftop, eyes closed, before leaping off.","Pei Fengnong drank himself into the hospital, his hand slipping limply from the emergency bed as his heart monitor flatlined.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci lay on her bed, clutching her blankets, seemingly asleep—but their chests didn’t rise. They weren’t breathing.","Pei Youchuan, unshaven and disheveled, held her urn in one hand and a revolver in the other.","He pressed the gun to his temple.","\"Bang!\"","The scene shifted—","A bathtub filled with crimson water.","Pei Che floated in it, motionless, like a statue submerged in water.","The vision panned upward to show Shen Zhuoyan standing by the sea, walking resolutely into the waves.","Another flash—Pei Yuan stood before a cemetery, tears silently rolling down his face as he gazed at the rows of graves.","He smiled in resignation. \"Wait for me. I’ll be there soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu jolted awake, frantic. \"System, take me back! My brothers are all trying to die! Even Shen Zhuoyan is gone!\"","The system seemed to respond, but static drowned out its words.","Terrified, she shouted, \"System?? System?!!\"","There was no answer.","For two whole years, the system remained silent.","She stayed in the orphanage, watching flowers bloom and wither, turning down every family that wanted to adopt her, growing quieter with each passing day.","She dreamed of the Pei family’s demise.","Before Pei Yuan died, he divided his wealth among the Weisheng, Lin, and Lou families.","But they, too, perished one by one.","Their enemies were many, and after her death, they were all distraught, their minds elsewhere. Only Lou Yuejue endured, living alone for years—but even he met a tragic end.","None of them died peacefully.","When Lou Yuejue finally passed, the dreams stopped.","Their faces blurred in her memory, requiring effort to recall.","She sat quietly on a swing, the other children eyeing it enviously but not daring to challenge her.","They feared her.","Though she looked their age, her silence and aura had made her an unintentional leader among them.","It was fine.","Quiet.","A caretaker approached. \"Xiao Xiao, someone wants to meet you.\"","Numbly, she stepped off the swing and took the woman’s hand.","The aunt admonished her, \"Listen, this family that’s taken an interest in you is clearly very wealthy. You better seize this opportunity. You’re already five years old—any older, and no one will want to adopt you!\"","She nodded silently, like a little mute, and was led into the reception room.","The aunt smiled as she nudged her inside, saying to the people in the room, \"Call me if you need anything.\"","She kept her head down the entire time, unwilling to meet anyone’s gaze or be adopted, focusing only on the tips of her shoes.","A magnetic feminine voice reached her—","\"Your name is Qiao Chu, right?\"","The name sounded so distant, stirring something in Qiao Chuchu’s heart. She blinked in surprise and looked toward the source of the voice.","The reception room was packed with stunningly attractive people.","And every single one of them was a uniquely handsome man.","Dog ears? Dog tails? And rabbit ears?!","A group of tall, striking men—all with animal features?!","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Is this some kind of cosplay?\"","At the center of the circle of handsome men sat a radiant woman.","She had waist-length golden hair, wore a skimpy halter top and shorts, and gazed at her with a playful smile.","This woman was even more beautiful than Weisheng Yucan!","Qiao Chuchu was so awestruck she couldn’t speak.","[Oh my god, how is she this gorgeous?!]","The woman froze, exchanging glances with the others. \"How can I hear this little girl’s thoughts?\""]},{"number":318,"title":"Chapter 318: The mess made by Li Lanyu next door is now being fixed by Li Lanyu.","paragraphs":["A silver-haired handsome man chuckled at the beautiful woman: \"Maybe it's her special talent.\"","The woman nodded in understanding and said to her, \"Little girl, my name is Li Lanyu. I’m the Demon Lord from another world. A few years ago, I blew up the System World, then ran into some trouble. I just got resurrected recently and am now cleaning up the mess, seeing if I can help you with anything.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, struggling to process this: \"Demon Lord? What Demon Lord? You blew up the System World?! How did you even do that?\"","Li Lanyu shrugged casually: \"Just blew it up, no big deal. That thing was causing chaos in my world, harming people. It had to go.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[So THAT’S why I couldn’t contact the system two years ago?!]","She snapped, \"Do you have any idea how much trouble you caused me?! My entire family died, and I couldn’t even go back!\"","Li Lanyu stood up: \"That’s exactly why I’m here to fix things for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed bitterly: \"How are you going to fix this?! My brothers are dead! All of them! Can you bring the dead back to life?!\"","Li Lanyu didn’t answer. Instead, she raised a finger and pressed it against Qiao Chuchu’s forehead.","In an instant, Qiao Chuchu’s memories were stolen by this woman!","Li Lanyu saw everything—her three lifetimes.","Her first life as an orphan.","Her life as Qiao Chuchu.","And the past two years.","Every single memory was laid bare before her.","Li Lanyu gasped in amazement: \"Your life is so dramatic, I could turn it into a movie and show it to everyone back home!\"","The silver-haired man beside her wagged his tail like a dog: \"How dramatic?\"","Li Lanyu grinned mischievously: \"Extremely dramatic!~\"","Qiao Chuchu stumbled back, clutching her forehead in fury: \"Who the hell are you people?!\"","Li Lanyu leaned down and flicked her forehead playfully: \"I already told you, I’m not from this world. Now that I’ve seen your memories, I know exactly what you want most.\"","She winked: \"Don’t worry, I take responsibility for my actions. I’ll even get your money back for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? I—\"","Before she could finish, the group vanished right before her eyes.","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\"","The system had once told her that the universe was filled with parallel worlds, each with different environments.","Were these people cultivators from another world?!","Still in shock, she walked out of the orphanage, her forehead throbbing from the memory theft.","She crouched down, rubbing her temples to ease the pain.","Suddenly, frantic footsteps approached from behind: \"Why are there so many orphans coming in all of a sudden?! How are we supposed to handle this?!\"","Qiao Chuchu froze. She looked past the busy caretaker and turned toward the entrance.","A bus was parked outside the orphanage.","A familiar boy stepped out—around twelve years old, glancing around in confusion, clearly new to this place.","More familiar faces followed.","Pei Che, Pei Youchuan, Pei Fengnong, Pei Mu, Pei Ci, and Pei Buxian all emerged from the vehicle, examining their limbs and clothes in bewilderment.","Weisheng Wenzhan stepped down next, studying his body: \"Am I twelve now?\"","Weisheng Yucan jumped out excitedly: \"I’m only ten?! Ten!! TEN YEARS OLD!!!\"","Weisheng Lin was stunned: \"I’m just eleven! I’m actually younger than Pei Yuan by a year!\"","Weisheng Biehe and Huai Ling followed.","Huai Ling signed in confusion:","Why am I deaf again? I could hear just fine in the Dead City.","Ying Chen chewed his gum lazily, hands in his pockets: \"Is this some new version of the Dead City? Why is there sunlight here? Since when can ghosts sunbathe? Ridiculous.\"","Lou Tingsi, face dark, held Lou Yuejue’s hand tightly: \"You think YOU’RE annoyed?\"","Everyone turned to them.","Lou Tingsi looked absolutely livid: \"My son and I only have a ten-year age gap now. What kind of messed-up planning is this? They said they were taking us to a new place to live, but they changed our ages too?!\"","Lou Yuejue, with his chubby little face, pouted in a childish voice: \"Exactly! Now my dad’s basically my brother. This is outrageous! And out of all of us, I died the latest—I was thirty! Now I’m a two-year-old baby. This sucks!\"","From the driver’s seat, Li Lanyu laughed: \"Well, you could always separate. Let your son reincarnate and start fresh. Otherwise, you’ll have to accept the age gap. So, what’ll it be? Want to split up?\"","Lou Yuejue and Lou Tingsi shot her identical glares: \"Are you the new manager of the Dead City? Is this how you solve your residents’ problems?\"","Li Lanyu grinned: \"Nope. The Dead City’s ruler is my subordinate. I’m the sovereign of my own world.\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Li Lanyu shrugged: \"Look, you’re getting a second chance. Don’t complain too much. Either accept the age gap or say goodbye forever. If I made Lou Tingsi too old, he wouldn’t fit in with the rest of you. Not much I can do.\"","Lou Tingsi’s expression darkened further: \"Then why make us so young in the first place? You said we were just moving to a new place!\"","Li Lanyu only smiled mysteriously.","The two rolled their eyes in exasperation.","Shi Yu inspected his limbs: \"So this is what a normal body feels like. No exhaustion at all.\"","Pei Buxian muttered lifelessly: \"Doesn’t matter where we are. A world without Chuchu is meaningless.\"","At those words, the lighthearted mood vanished. Everyone’s faces turned grim.","After their deaths, they had all ended up in the Dead City, waiting for their turn to reincarnate.","The Dead City was filled with souls from countless worlds—yet Qiao Chuchu was nowhere to be found.","At least that was a good sign. It meant she was still alive.","Then, a golden-haired woman gathered them together, promising a new place to live.","Hoping Qiao Chuchu might be in another Dead City, they agreed.","But on the way, their ages suddenly regressed.","Honestly, age didn’t matter.","What hurt was not being able to see the one they longed for.","Pei Fengnong’s eyes reddened: \"I miss her so much. Every single day, I’ve ached for her. I thought death would end the pain, but it hasn’t.\"","Pei Che stared blankly at his clean wrists—no scars in sight.","Pei Youchuan murmured, hollow-eyed: \"Living in the Dead City, I was terrified of reincarnating and forgetting Qiao Chuchu. But staying there without her... every day was torture.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci remained silent.","Shen Zhuoyan hadn’t spoken a word since Qiao Chuchu’s death, like a wooden puppet, unresponsive to anyone.","Lin Shen and Lin Qing exchanged glances before comforting the group: \"At least we’re still together. We’ll see Chuchu again someday. We’ll reunite eventually.\"","They looked at the Lin siblings and felt somewhat comforted, their gazes shifting to the staff members surrounding them.","Suddenly, a small hand pushed through the crowd of staff: \"Make way, make way!\"","Qiao Chuchu squeezed through the people, popping her head out as she stared at them in shock.","Their eyes met hers, and their expressions gradually morphed into stunned disbelief.","\"Is that... Chuchu?\""]},{"number":319,"title":"Chapter 319: Reunion","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's tears fell without warning: \"Brothers, is it really you?\"","Pei Yuan thought he was seeing things, rubbing his eyes again and again.","But no matter how many times he blinked, the youthful image of Qiao Chuchu remained before him.","It wasn’t an illusion.","It really was Chuchu!","He rushed toward her!","But Pei Youchuan grabbed his arm: \"Wait, big brother! What if this is some ghost trying to deceive us?\"","The City of the Dead wasn’t entirely peaceful—there had been cases of spirits devouring souls.","Some could even take the form of those they longed for most.","Qiao Chuchu froze, then hesitantly projected her thoughts: Can you all still hear my inner voice?","Their doubtful expressions flickered like a current had passed through them, eyes widening in shock.","She bit her lower lip, gazing at each of them: On the day of the finale, I said I was willing to talk to you. Do you remember?","Pei Youchuan lunged forward and embraced her: \"Chuchu! My Chuchu!\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt like she’d been rammed by a bull as Pei Youchuan lifted her off the ground!","A nearby auntie shrieked: \"What are you doing?! Let go of Xiaoxiao! Her health is fragile!\"","But before the words even settled, the newly arrived orphans all surged toward Qiao Chuchu!","Like a horde of mutated zombies, they swarmed around her!","Little Lou Yuejue, tiny as a bean, stomped outside the circle, slapping his thighs in frustration: \"Let me in! Let me in!!\"","Pei Fengnong snatched Qiao Chuchu into his arms, squeezing her tightly: \"Chuchu, I missed you so much!\"","Pei Che shoved Pei Fengnong aside and pulled her close.","He said nothing, only tightening his grip, his entire body trembling as if he couldn’t believe this was real.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci swiftly pried Pei Che’s arms open, sandwiching Qiao Chuchu between them in a joint embrace!","Pei Ci crouched, pressing his face against hers: \"We’re finally reunited! Even if it’s in the City of the Dead, I’m content!\"","Pei Mu’s eyes brimmed with tears: \"I was so afraid—afraid that after reincarnation, I’d never see you again. Chuchu, we’ve finally met.\"","Pei Buxian barreled in from the middle, wrapping his arms around her: \"Chuchu, my Chuchu! Let me hold you!\"","He sobbed an apology: \"I’m sorry! I shouldn’t have locked you away at the end, shouldn’t have made our time together so miserable. I regret it so much! I’m truly sorry!\"","Qiao Chuchu struggled under their overwhelming affection: \"Wait, wait—you’re going to crush me!\"","She looked toward Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan stepped closer, gazing at her through the crowd.","His eyes were bittersweet—part sorrow, part joy—as he reached out and gently patted her head: \"I’m sorry, Chuchu. I made you suffer.\"","Nearby, Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes reddened: \"Chuchu, I owe you an apology too. I’ve waited years to say this to you.\"","Weisheng Yucan nudged the Pei brothers aside, gripping Qiao Chuchu’s shoulders: \"Our parting was too sudden. I wanted to apologize properly—I’m sorry, truly.\"","Lin Qing wept: \"I’m sorry, Chuchu!\"","Lin Shen couldn’t speak, but tears streamed down his face.","Qiao Chuchu’s nose stung: \"I saw your endings.\"","They froze.","Tears welled in her eyes—the anger she once held had long faded with time.","\"I’m not angry anymore.\"","None of them had met peaceful ends. Even her brothers had all died by their own hands.","How could she hold onto resentment?","\"But that doesn’t mean we shouldn’t apologize,\" Weisheng Wenzhan murmured, lightly brushing her cheek.","His eyes shimmered: \"It’s so good to see you again.\"","Weisheng Lin nodded vigorously: \"Uncle feels the same! Reuniting here is a blessing!\"","Huai Ling pushed Yucan aside, clinging to Qiao Chuchu like a lifeline.","Pei Buxian scowled, shoving Huai Ling: \"She’s mine!\"","Huai Ling didn’t react, only tightening his hold as silent tears fell.","Weisheng Biehe took Qiao Chuchu’s hand: \"You’re so small now too—like starting over.\"","Shi Yu grasped her other hand, smiling gently: \"Miss Qiao, it’s been a long time.\"","Though his expression was calm, his grip was painfully tight.","Lou Tingsi embraced her from behind, voice thick: \"I couldn’t find space anywhere else. I’m so sorry for what happened back then.\"","Ying Chen stepped forward: \"Me too.\"","His gaze was heavy: \"After you died, I thought of you every day. Living felt meaningless. But now we’re together again—even if it’s in the City of the Dead, at least we have time to make things right.\"","Lou Yuejue finally squirmed his way in, hugging Qiao Chuchu’s leg as he looked up: \"I missed you so much, sis!\"","Then he grimaced: \"I’m thirty but stuck in a two-year-old’s body. How disgusting is that?\"","Qiao Chuchu studied them.","They had all died within three years of her passing, so their appearances hadn’t changed much.","Only Lou Yuejue was different—having lived alone for over two decades, the brash, fearless youth was gone, replaced by quiet maturity.","Qiao Chuchu laughed through her tears: \"It really has been too long.\"","They blinked, nodding through their own tears.","Her voice trembled: \"But... this isn’t the City of the Dead. You’re in the real world.\"","They: \"?\"","The real world?!","Their shocked gazes snapped to Li Lanyu in the bus.","Li Lanyu’s voice echoed in their minds from the driver’s seat: I destroyed the system and ruined Qiao Chu’s plans—owed her a debt. After seeing her memories, I decided to make amends by resurrecting you all and regressing your ages.","Their faces paled.","Resurrected?!","Li Lanyu smirked: That’s why I made you kids. Qiao Chu is only five here. If you were all decades older, how much time would you have together once she grew up?","With that, Li Lanyu hopped down and snapped her fingers.","Everyone except their group froze mid-motion, even their eyes unblinking.","Time itself seemed to halt.","Qiao Chuchu gaped as Li Lanyu strolled toward her—a deity basking in sunlight, the very air parting for her.","She handed over a stack of bank cards: \"These hold the assets you left behind in other worlds. All legally transferred to your names.\"","They took them hesitantly.","Qiao Chuchu accepted her three cards with both hands: \"Thank you, Demon Sovereign. I apologize for my rudeness before.\"","Li Lanyu casually pinched her cheek with a playful smirk. \"You're quite the quick learner, little one. But don't worry—I’m tens of thousands of years old. How could I possibly hold a grudge against a kid like you?\"","She conjured a thick stack of notebooks and handed them to Qiao Chuchu. \"Here’s the revised system settings about you. Take a look, will you?\""]},{"number":320,"title":"Chapter 320: About the Truth","paragraphs":["The notebook was too thick, and Qiao Chuchu struggled to hold it steady.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci quickly took it from her, lifting it up for her to see.","As she flipped to the first page, bold words glared back at her: \"Qiao Chuchu’s fortune is the strongest. To transfer all her luck to Xia Xuechun, we must start by breaking her down from within, letting her destroy herself.\"","Everyone’s expressions darkened, and Qiao Chuchu was especially stunned. She turned to Li Lanyu. \"What does this mean?\"","Li Lanyu explained, \"These systems operate by stealing others’ fortunes to gain power. They usually bind themselves to greedy, ambitious individuals, working together to seize luck from others.\"","\"But you’re an exception. Your fortune is the strongest, built layer by layer, with many people who love you. The system couldn’t harm you directly, so it had to wear you down from the inside.\"","With a flick of her hand, the book’s pages turned on their own. \"While you were still in your mother’s womb, the system crafted a false reality for your soul, making you endure suffering in an illusion, all to create the delusion that you were a transmigrator.\"","\"But the truth is, you’ve always been Qiao Chu. Your destiny was one of great fortune. The people around you, though flawed, complement you perfectly. Together, you could have lived a fulfilling life.\"","\"The system targeted your fate, wanting to siphon it away and transfer it to the ambitious Xia Xuechun. So, it made you believe you were a 'transmigrator,' feeding you a fabricated 'script' and forcing you to act accordingly. The more you followed it, the more you destroyed your own fortune—and the easier it became for them to manipulate not just your fate, but the fates of everyone connected to you.\"","\"And you did. For over a decade, you played along, nourishing their power until they could toy with your lives effortlessly.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s scalp prickled. \"So I really am Qiao Chu? I didn’t transmigrate here at three years old?\"","Li Lanyu leaned down, smiling. \"You inherited your mother’s talents, even sharing her temperament. How could you not be Qiao Chu?\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"Then why did the system help me? It gave me ten lives! Shouldn’t it have just killed me?\"","Li Lanyu smirked. \"Because fortune transfer requires the right timing and conditions. The system was disconnected from you for a while—because I barged into their world and disrupted them. By the time they recovered, your fortunes had begun to shift. They’d already transferred a massive amount of luck to Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan, creating a conflict—like the original 'favorites of fate' clashing with the newly crowned ones.\"","\"Coincidentally, I’d already damaged them severely. They were too weak to control you fully and still needed more fortune to recover. So, they pitted you and Xia Xuechun against each other.\"","\"Two tigers fighting—only one survives. They trapped you together like gamecocks, waiting to see who’d come out on top. It didn’t matter who lived, as long as the strongest remained.\"","Li Lanyu finished with disgust. \"It seemed like they were helping you, but they were playing both sides. Giving you ten lives while secretly trying to kill you, molding you into submission. If you obeyed, you’d be far more useful than Xia Xuechun.\"","Qiao Chuchu gagged in revulsion. \"They ruined my life so thoroughly, all while pretending to be kind! And I actually thought they were helping me! Their power came from me all along!\"","Li Lanyu chuckled. \"Scammers are always nice to their victims at first. But now, you get a fresh start.\"","She glanced at the people behind Qiao Chuchu, grinning mischievously as she whispered in her ear, \"To make things easier for you, I even adjusted their ages. Except for Lou Yuejue—if he got any younger, he’d have to be reborn. Just ignore him.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Adjusting their ages to make it easier for us to interact? What does that mean?]","Behind her, the group’s eyes darkened, their lips curling as they stared at her back.","Li Lanyu straightened. \"Alright, this is your last chance. No do-overs this time!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded solemnly. \"Got it.\"","Li Lanyu vanished, and the frozen figures around them sprang back to life.","A caretaker bustled over. \"Who’s taking these new orphans to get settled?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised her hand. \"I’ll show them around!\"","She ran up to them, beaming. \"Let me give you a tour of our new home!\"","They froze, eyes glistening, before answering in unison, \"Okay!\"","Eighteen years later—","Xie Lele stood before the estate, gaping at the mansion. \"This place is huge?!\"","An 8-billion-dollar mansion in Lan City, rumored to house over a dozen people—all stunningly attractive, and all single.","She took a deep breath and practiced her self-introduction: \"Hello, my name is Xie Lele. I'm here to apply for the kitchen assistant position. Hello, my name is Xie Lele. I'm here to apply for the kitchen assistant position. Hello, my name is Xie Lele. I'm here to apply for the kitchen assistant position...\"","Xie Lele trembled as she pressed the doorbell button.","The butler's steady voice came through: \"Who is it?\"","Xie Lele nervously blurted: \"Hello, I'm the kitchen assistant! I'm here to apply for Xie Lele!\"","Butler: \"?\"","Xie Lele: \"?\"","The grand door slowly swung open.","Butler: \"Come in.\"","Xie Lele stepped into the courtyard, stunned by the distance between the gate and the mansion's entrance.","\"Just walking there would take minutes, wouldn't it?\"","She quickened her pace into the estate, slipped on shoe covers, and followed the elderly butler inside.","The main hall's walls were adorned with three photographs.","The large group photo in the center looked solemn.","A lively, adorable young girl sat at the very center, dressed in a white puffy dress. Flanking her were two beautiful women in black dresses, and behind them stood a variety of strikingly handsome men in suits.","Every one of them looked like they belonged in a painting.","She stared, mesmerized, then turned to the next photo.","Two elegant women lounged on chairs, while the same spirited young girl stood behind them in a qipao, smiling sweetly and obediently.","Her gaze shifted to the last photo.","It was the same girl again, now in a different dress, seated at the center of a sofa.","All the handsome men surrounded her, some sitting, some standing.","Those closest to her carried an air of authority, like family heads.","The boy sitting at her feet was far less formal.","A silver-haired youth pressed close against her calf, while another platinum-haired boy lazily draped himself over her lap, gazing indifferently at the camera.","It was like a scene straight out of a novel—a harem of admirers she'd never seen in real life. She was utterly spellbound.","The butler, accustomed to seeing newcomers dumbstruck by the photos, remained unfazed.","\"See the girl in the middle?\" he asked.","Xie Lele nodded.","The butler said calmly, \"If you upset any of the other employers, the worst they'll do is fire you. But if you upset her, every single one of them will come after you.\"","Xie Lele's eyes nearly popped out of her head. \"Seriously?!\"","The butler nodded. \"Absolutely. She's the one person in this mansion you must never cross. That said, she's also the easiest to get along with—the staff's favorite young mistress. If you befriend her, she’ll even cover for you when you make mistakes.\"","Xie Lele nodded in understanding.","For some reason, she already felt drawn to the young mistress.","A broadcast echoed through the room: \"The employers have returned.\"","The butler yanked her behind him. \"Stay still!\""]},{"number":321,"title":"Chapter 321: Finale: A Cozy and Affectionate Family Reunion","paragraphs":["Xiao Xie froze in place, staring at the door.","The door swung open.","A handsome young man strode in first, holding a golf club with a playful grin as he glanced back. \"Sis, you lost today. You promised you’d go out with me if I won—no backing out now.\"","Another man with fox-like eyes smiled faintly. \"Yuejue, you’re still a kid.\"","Lou Yuejue’s smile stiffened. He shot him an exasperated look. \"I’m not a kid anymore, Dad. I’m already an adult, and I’ve even been the head of the family before. You can’t keep treating me like you did when you were alive.\"","Lou Tingsi smirked. \"Not while I’m around.\"","Lou Yuejue huffed and turned to the girl. \"Sis, tell him! He’s always restricting me like I’m still a teenager. I’m a grown man now—I deserve some freedom!\"","A platinum-haired youth shoved Lou Yuejue aside. \"Stop being so clingy! Our Chuchu doesn’t want to deal with your nonsense.\"","Lou Yuejue raised a teasing brow. \"Pei Buxian, you’re just nervous, aren’t you? Nervous because when you died, I was still a kid, but now I’m an adult, standing on equal footing with you. You feel threatened.\"","Pei Buxian’s eyes widened. \"Threatened?! What’s between Chuchu and me can’t be replaced by a sly brat like you! We’ve been through thick and thin together!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci pushed Lou Yuejue away. \"Yeah, who do you think you are, swaggering around in front of us seniors?\"","Pei Youchuan slung an arm around Qiao Chuchu’s shoulders, pressing his cheek against hers. \"No matter what, Chuchu’s bond with us Peis runs the deepest, right, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong lifted his chin proudly. \"Obviously. Chuchu foresaw each of our deaths—our connection is etched in blood.\"","Pei Che nudged Pei Youchuan aside. \"Hands off.\" He took Qiao Chuchu’s hand. \"Come on, let’s wash up.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Aren’t you also being handsy?\"","Pei Yuan grabbed her other hand. \"Right, wash up and then have some fruit.\"","The butler chimed in promptly, \"The fruit platter is ready, ladies and gentlemen.\"","Shen Zhuoyan studied Qiao Chuchu’s expression. \"Why do you look so pale? Are you feeling unwell?\"","At that, everyone tensed, eyes locked on her.","Ying Chen poked her cheek. \"You’re not running a fever, are you?\"","Weisheng Lin crouched in front of her. \"Hop on! I’ll carry you to your room!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan felt her forehead. \"No fever. Maybe heatstroke?\"","Weisheng Biehe fretted, \"Go rest, Chuchu. You need it.\"","Lin Shen shooed them aside. \"Chuchu, want some congee? I can make it for you.\"","Weisheng Huailing tugged her sleeve. \"Sis, are you okay?!\"","Shi Yu wheeled out his chair. \"Here! Take a seat!\"","They all blinked at him. \"You’re fully recovered—why the wheelchair?\"","Shi Yu deadpanned, \"Habit.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Weisheng Yucan leaned against the wall, arms crossed, watching the chaos.","Lin Qing stifled a laugh. \"She’s not sick—she’s just fed up with all of you buzzing around her nonstop.\"","Weisheng Yucan nodded. \"Let them bicker. I’m changing and meeting my darlings.\"","Lin Qing checked her phone. \"Same. Got a date tonight.\"","Surrounded by the crowd, Qiao Chuchu suddenly regretted everything.","[I should’ve only brought Yucan-jie and Lin Qing-jie back. The rest are so noisy.]","Weisheng Yucan and Lin Qing exchanged grins and high-fived. \"Yes! We’re not annoying!\"","The others perked up. \"? What was that?\"","Pei Youchuan pinched Qiao Chuchu’s cheek. \"You’d really leave us out?!\"","She winced and backtracked. \"Just kidding! Just kidding!\"","[I keep forgetting they can hear my thoughts! Ugh!]","Pei Buxian pouted. \"Your thoughts betray you! And now you’re rejecting me!\"","Lou Tingsi smiled serenely. \"Chuchu, we need to talk.\"","Weisheng Lin beamed. \"Time for a mental reset.\"","Shi Yu volunteered, \"I can play the guqin to soothe your soul.\"","Ying Chen raised his hand. \"I’ll use my height to dominate her!\"","Weisheng Huailing also raised his hand. \"I’ll use my body to dominate her!\"","Everyone: \"?\"","Pei Yuan’s face darkened. \"Throw him out.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci hoisted Weisheng Huailing up and marched off!","Huailing flailed. \"Sis, I can! I really can!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Sis cannot.\"","Shen Zhuoyan circled around, earnest. \"Chuchu, let’s reminisce about the old days so you don’t get tired of us.\"","She groaned. \"No reminiscing. I’m going to shower.\"","Shi Yu smiled. \"Then I’ll play the guqin while you bathe.\"","Pei Che: \"? Throw him out.\"","Pei Youchuan and Pei Fengnong hauled Shi Yu away like a sack of potatoes.","Weisheng Biehe said mildly, \"Mind your language, everyone. Keep it PG.\"","Ying Chen shrugged. \"Yeah, say whatever you want in private, but tone it down in front of us, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu covered her ears. \"Please, just stop. You’re all so quiet around outsiders—why so chatty with me?!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan adjusted his glasses. \"I don’t talk much.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...For you, this is talking much.\"","Lou Yuejue sidled up to her. \"Sis, a bet’s a bet. You’re going on a date with me—no tagalongs.\"","Lou Tingsi smacked the back of his head!","Lou Yuejue yelped. \"Ow!\"","Qiao Chuchu almost clutched her own head, but her gaze landed on Xie Lele and froze.","Xie Lele stood there, wide-eyed and bewildered, as if she’d stumbled into another world.","Only one thing felt familiar—this young lady.","Xie Lele shyly nodded. \"Hello, miss.\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped closer, studying her face in disbelief. \"What’s your name?\"","Xie Lele answered, \"Xie Lele. I’m here to apply as a kitchen assistant. You can call me Little Xie!\"","Little Xie?","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes reddened, her smile trembling. \"Little Xie... what a lovely name.\"","Xie Lele tilted her head, confused.","Qiao Chuchu extended a hand. \"I’m Qiao Chuchu. I think we’re fated. How about being deputy butler? The employers are a handful, so the pay’s good—¥80,000 a month. Deal?\"","Xie Lele gasped. \"Eighty thousand?!\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head. “You don’t want to?”","“No, no, no! I do! I really do!” Little Xie grabbed her hands, shaking them excitedly. “Thank you for choosing me, Miss!”","The old butler was right!","The young lady really is so easy to talk to!","Qiao Chuchu withdrew her hands, gave her a long look, then turned and went upstairs.","Pei Yuan’s eyes gleamed as he stepped in front of Qiao Chuchu. “How about we go to the art exhibition later? You’re finally on summer break, and we all want to make time to spend with you.”","The others perked up at this, watching her with hopeful yet nervous expressions.","Qiao Chuchu’s face instantly brightened. “Sure! I’ll go change!”","They exhaled in relief, their expressions softening as they hurried after her. “We’ll wait for you in your room!”","Qiao Chuchu paused. “Can’t I have a moment alone?”","They answered in unison: “No!”","Listening to the sound of the group heading upstairs, Little Xie felt an inexplicable warmth in her chest.","It was as if everything had fallen back into place, as if the world was aligning in the best possible way.","The old butler called out to her. “Come sign the contract. The young lady has taken a liking to you, so from now on, you’ll be the assistant housekeeper here.”","But then Qiao Chuchu’s voice drifted down from upstairs. “Little Xie, come help me pick an outfit!”","A chorus of deep voices protested: “Can’t we help you choose?!”","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. “You guys have no taste! Ugh, why are you all so clingy?!”","“Too bad!”","Downstairs, Little Xie glanced at the old butler. “I’ll go see the young lady first.”","The butler nodded.","Little Xie happily dashed upstairs. “Coming!~”"]},{"number":322,"title":"Chapter 322: Extra: Daily Life at the Manor 1 (The Twins)","paragraphs":["Morning—","Qiao Chuchu casually rolled over in bed, wrapping her arms around a muscular figure.","The person responded by turning toward her, pulling her close.","She didn’t like being held, so she turned away again, only for her hand to land on someone else.","That someone seemed to have been facing her the whole time, as they immediately pulled her into their arms, pressing her firmly against their chest.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Before she could break free, a strong arm from behind wrapped around her waist, smoothly yanking her into another embrace.","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","The person in front leaned in, sandwiching her between them, leaving her with barely any space.","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\"","She blinked in confusion and opened her eyes.","Right in front of her was Pei Ci—no, wait, Pei Ci’s sleeping face.","With sharp, somewhat intimidating features, he looked unexpectedly harmless with his eyes closed, his brows relaxed, and his long lashes resting softly against his cheeks.","Qiao Chuchu turned her head to look behind her.","Pei Mu had an arm draped over her waist, his face buried in her back, sleeping soundly.","Pei Ci in front tightened his grip, pulling her against his chest!","Pei Mu behind her frowned in his sleep and instinctively tugged her back!","She was like a blanket being fought over!","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened with every tug. She kicked Pei Ci off the bed, then Pei Mu for good measure: \"Get out!!\"","The two thudded onto the floor, groggily opening their eyes: \"What’s the matter, Chuchu~?\"","They sat up, resting their heads on the edge of the bed, voices soft and whiny: \"We were working late last night. We’re exhausted.\"","Qiao Chuchu scowled: \"If you’re so tired, why did you barge into my room, you creeps?!\"","Truthfully, she was used to this.","Ever since she turned eighteen, her room had become a revolving door for these weirdos.","Aside from Weisheng Wenzhan, Lou Tingsi, Lin Shen, and Shen Zhuoyan—who had never pulled this stunt—everyone else had taken turns being her \"morning surprise.\"","Of course, the one who started it all was Weisheng Huailing.","She had protested repeatedly, even calling a family meeting to publicly reprimand him. But instead of improving, the situation escalated—now, every morning, there was a new \"sleeping companion\" waiting for her.","Back when she was studying abroad, this only happened during holidays. But now that she’d graduated and was living at home full-time, nothing had changed!","She glared at the two: \"I locked my door! Did you steal my key again?!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci smirked, eyes still closed: \"We learned how to pick locks. No lock can stop us now.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...And you’re proud of that?\"","They lifted their chins proudly: \"Of course! Not everyone can master lock-picking.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Speechless, she got out of bed and headed to the bathroom to wash up.","Before long, Pei Mu and Pei Ci shuffled in after her, picking their electric toothbrushes from the wall-mounted lineup.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Yep. They even kept spare toothbrushes in her room.","Her wall looked like a toothbrush display!","The two stood on either side of her, still half-asleep, squeezing toothpaste onto their brushes.","Qiao Chuchu stood between them, waiting her turn with an empty toothbrush.","Pei Ci finished squeezing toothpaste for her, then passed the tube to Pei Mu.","All three struck the same pose—hands on hips, brushes raised—brushing their teeth in sync.","After washing her face, before she could reach for a towel, Pei Mu was already gently pressing one against her skin.","\"Living with us is great, isn’t it?\" he said smugly, dabbing her face dry. \"You don’t even have to lift a finger. We take care of everything for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu shot him a sidelong glare.","He grinned shamelessly: \"Heh.\"","Beside them, Pei Ci tied on a sweatband, looking refreshed: \"Our perks speak for themselves. Out of all the guys, we’re the most attentive! We’re the only ones who know how to do Chuchu’s hair.\"","\"Right,\" Pei Mu chimed in, deftly tying her hair into a high ponytail. \"By the way, Chuchu, do you know what today is?\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to him: \"No. What’s special about today?\"","Pei Mu’s eyes gleamed mischievously as he exchanged a glance with Pei Ci, then shook his head: \"Never mind. Let’s go work out.\"","She frowned, sensing they were hiding something: \"Tell me. What’s today?\"","Pei Mu just smiled, nudging her toward the changing room: \"Come on, let’s get dressed and exercise.\"","Baffled, she changed into workout clothes and followed them to the home gym in the basement.","Normally, everyone would be up by now, showing off in the gym.","But today, it was just the three of them.","She raised an eyebrow: \"Is everyone sick? Why isn’t anyone else here?\"","\"Don’t worry about them,\" Pei Ci said, stretching as he headed for the treadmill. \"This is our time together.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[What does he mean by \"our time\"?]","Pei Mu smirked, winking at her: \"Come on, Chuchu.\"","She grew more suspicious.","[Are they planning something?]","[Eh, whatever. They wouldn’t hurt me.]","She unrolled a yoga mat and started her routine.","\"Your cat-cow pose is off,\" Pei Mu observed, standing behind her.","She paused: \"It is?\"","Pei Mu nodded solemnly: \"Let me show you.\"","He squeezed onto the mat with her, arching his back. \"Exhale, round your spine.\"","Qiao Chuchu mimicked him, exhaling as she curved her back.","Suddenly, a firm hand slid under her stomach: \"Arch a little more.\"","She squirmed, ticklish: \"Hey—!\"","Pei Ci, who had crept up beside them, chuckled at her reaction: \"You’re that ticklish?\"","He poked her belly teasingly.","She swatted his hand away: \"Stop it!\"","Pei Mu feigned seriousness: \"Focus, student Qiao. If you want to learn, pay attention.\"","Grumbling, she repositioned herself: \"Fine!\"","As she lowered her back and lifted her head, extending her spine, Pei Ci knelt beside her, pressing lightly on her waist: \"A little lower.\"","She wriggled uncomfortably: \"I can do it myself! Quit pushing me!\"","Pei Mu chided: \"No talking. Clear your mind.\"","She shot Pei Ci an annoyed look.","[This is your fault!]","Pei Ci raised a brow, leaning in to whisper: \"My bad. Want me to make it up to you?\"","She blinked.","[Make it up how?]","His gaze flicked to her lips, then back to her eyes: \"You tell me. Whatever you want.\""]},{"number":323,"title":"Chapter 323: Extra: Daily Life at the Manor 2 (Weisheng Wenzhan)","paragraphs":["Pei Mu slowly opened her eyes, casting a sidelong glance at her: \"Chuchu, your breathing rhythm is off.\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her thoughts and adjusted her breath.","Pei Ci mischievously poked her waist.","She shuddered and swatted his hand away: \"Stop being so annoying!\"","Pei Ci grinned cheekily: \"Not annoying at all~\"","Pei Mu sighed helplessly: \"So you just can’t learn how to calm your mind, huh?\"","She pointed at Pei Ci indignantly: \"I can learn, but Pei Ci keeps messing around!\"","Pei Mu said matter-of-factly: \"But if you were truly focused, Pei Ci’s antics wouldn’t even matter.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Are you two just covering for each other now?\"","Pei Mu paused, not denying it, and knelt beside her: \"Close your eyes.\"","Reluctantly, she assumed the position and shut her eyes.","Pei Mu instructed: \"Arch your back and exhale.\"","She gradually curved her spine upward.","Pei Ci’s cheerful voice chimed in: \"Yoga teacher! I’d like to report that Miss Qiao’s posture isn’t up to standard!~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Mu cupped her stomach with a hand, speaking leisurely: \"Oh? Let me see.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Pei Ci pressed close to her right side, threatening playfully: \"Don’t let your breathing get messed up, Chuchu, or I’ll have the teacher keep you stuck in this pose forever.\"","\"She won’t get stuck.\" Pei Mu’s voice came from her left, his warm breath brushing her cheek: \"Our Miss Qiao is a naturally gifted student. She masters everything in one go, right, Miss Qiao~\"","Qiao Chuchu finally realized what was happening, her temple twitching: \"...You two perverts are messing with me on purpose, aren’t you?!\"","Her sharp gaze locked onto their amused eyes!","The two froze.","Qiao Chuchu punched them both!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci collapsed in unison, clutching their faces pitifully: \"Qiao Chuchu, what was that for?!\"","Fuming, she turned on her heel and stormed off: \"Clean this place up, both of you!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci watched her retreating figure longingly: \"Wait, Chuchu, come back! We won’t tease you anymore!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan appeared at the doorway: \"Time’s up. My turn now.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci paused, checked the time, and reluctantly fell silent.","Qiao Chuchu blinked in confusion: \"What do you mean, ‘time’s up’?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan didn’t answer, grabbing her wrist and pulling her along: \"Go shower and change first.\"","She stared at his tall, straight back, puzzled.","[Are these guys hiding something from me?]","Then it hit her: [Ugh, I forgot again—he can hear my thoughts.]","Weisheng Wenzhan ignored it, leading her straight to her room.","With practiced ease, he browsed through her wardrobe: \"Wear what I pick for you today.\"","She found it odd but nodded obediently: \"Okay.\"","He handed her a comfortable yet stylish outfit: \"This one.\"","Qiao Chuchu examined it: \"But I’m not going out today. Can’t I just wear pajamas?\"","\"You will be going out,\" Weisheng Wenzhan stated confidently. \"Now go.\"","She felt a strange suspicion.","They were definitely keeping secrets.","Without pressing further, she headed into the bathroom to shower.","Weisheng Wenzhan sat on her sofa, scrolling through recipes on his phone.","The sound of running water gradually faded.","He looked toward the bathroom as the door opened, steam wafting out with the faint scent of shower gel.","Qiao Chuchu stepped out, fully dressed: \"Well?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan’s eyes lit up. Setting his phone aside, he walked over, removed her hair towel, and began blow-drying her hair.","She squirmed: \"I can do it myself. You don’t have to bother.\"","His slender fingers deftly avoided her hands and switched on the dryer.","Qiao Chuchu sat stiffly before the mirror, stealing glances at him through the reflection.","Wenzhan’s gaze never left her.","His deep eyes lingered, his handsome features even more captivating than in his past life.","Perhaps because he was much younger now, the weight of time had lessened, making his striking features all the more pronounced.","Qiao Chuchu stared, mesmerized, thinking: [Weisheng Wenzhan carries himself like a young king.]","His hands stilled mid-motion, his dark eyes softening as a slow smile curved his lips.","She hunched her shoulders, embarrassed, and looked down.","[Why do I keep forgetting others can hear my thoughts?]","[Why do I even have this passive ability?!]","Annoyed, she lifted her head—only to meet Wenzhan’s amused stare.","Weisheng Wenzhan gazed at her intently, chuckling when their eyes locked.","Her face burned red, and she covered it: \"So annoying!\"","He laughed softly: \"Do you know why I like hearing your thoughts?\"","She peeked through her fingers: \"?\"","Wenzhan’s intense gaze held hers: \"Because the things you can’t say out loud are more sincere... and far more entertaining.\"","He continued drying her hair: \"Besides, it’s much better now. When we first met, you kept calling me ‘son’ in your head.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, mortified: \"And you weren’t mad?\"","\"Oh, I was.\" Weisheng Wenzhan combed through her hair: \"But I couldn’t say anything back then. You’d cheerfully think ‘good boy’ this and ‘good boy’ that, and I just had to endure it. Eventually, I got used to it.\"","He leaned down, hands resting on her shoulders, meeting her eyes in the mirror: \"Because even while calling me ‘son,’ you genuinely cared for me.\"","His lips curled proudly: \"Right, Chuchu?\"","She ducked her head, grinning sheepishly: \"Heh.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan took her hand: \"Come on, I’ll cook for you.\"","She gaped at him: \"You can cook?\"","[I assumed he’d had servants his whole life.]","\"I was raised by servants,\" Weisheng Wenzhan said smoothly. \"But as the first heir of the Weisheng family, my upbringing was strict. Aside from endless studies, they’d often dump me in the wilderness to survive alone.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes nearly popped out: \"Alone? Didn’t that make you miserable?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan walked into the kitchen, removed his jacket, tied on an apron, and lit the stove: \"No. From the moment I could remember, my life was bound by their rules. My body didn’t belong to me—it belonged to the family. So however they treated me was what I deserved.\"","She frowned: \"But that doesn’t make sense. Weisheng Lin can’t do anything. He couldn’t even boil water before.\"","\"Weisheng Lin is the only favored one among us five. From birth, our parents adored him. They couldn’t bear to let him lift a finger.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned: \"And none of you resented him?\"","\"Why would we?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan sliced a croissant, unfazed: \"It’s not like I don’t love myself.\"","She clicked her tongue: \"I think you just don’t have the capacity for jealousy, period.\"","His hands paused mid-plating: \"No, I can feel jealous.\"","He cast a deep, lingering gaze at her: \"Before, I would hold back when I felt jealous, thinking I was too old to have the right. But now it's different.\"","Leaning closer to Qiao Chuchu, he murmured, \"Now that I'm no longer too old, I have every right to fight for you—so my jealousy burns fiercer.\"","His eyes narrowed, voice laced with meaning: \"Fiercer than ever.\""]},{"number":324,"title":"Chapter 324: Extra: Daily Life at the Manor 3 (Pei Che Makes an Appearance)","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was puzzled by Weisheng Wenzhan's words: \"But your parents aren’t here. Who are you jealous of?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan picked up the tray without answering and led her into the dining room. \"Come on, let’s eat.\"","Pouting, Qiao Chuchu sat across from him and admired the exquisite breakfast. \"Wait, let me take a photo for my social media!\"","She flailed around like an excited crab, angling her phone for the perfect shot.","Weisheng Wenzhan rested his chin on his hand, his gaze tender and full of affection as he watched her intently.","After posting, Qiao Chuchu beamed. \"Done!\"","Wenzhan picked up his phone and checked her update: \"Thank you, Mr. Weisheng Wenzhan, for this amazing breakfast! So fancy!\"","Weisheng Huailing was the first to comment: \"?\"","Ying Chen chimed in: \"That’s it? This is worth a post?\"","Weisheng Lin added: \"I’ve never had his cooking in my life. Since when does big brother know how to cook? I thought he couldn’t even pour water.\"","Weisheng Yucan replied to Weisheng Lin: \"The one who can’t pour water is you, idiot.\"","Weisheng Biehe snarked: \"Chuchu, I suggest eating this near an ER in case of poisoning.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Embarrassed, she set her phone down. \"Don’t mind their comments.\"","A knowing smile played on Wenzhan’s lips as he locked his phone. \"I don’t.\" He looked pleased. \"They’re just jealous of me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She took a bite of the croissant, her eyes lighting up. \"This is delicious!\"","Wenzhan smirked. \"Good. Eat as much as you want.\"","She savored every bite, slowly finishing everything on her plate.","Just as she finished, Pei Che walked into the dining room. \"My turn now.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[What kind of secret code are they speaking?]","Wenzhan looked disappointed. \"That was fast.\"","Still, he composed himself and stood. \"Go have fun with Pei Che. It’s a beautiful day.\"","Startled, Qiao Chuchu got up to wash the dishes. \"Let me clean up first—\"","Pei Che grabbed her wrist and pulled her away. \"No need. The housekeeper will handle it.\"","Stumbling, she followed him.","Wenzhan chased after them with her bag. \"Chuchu, your bag.\"","She reached for it, only for Pei Che to shove her into the car.","Pei Che shot Wenzhan a glare. \"Aren’t you going to say goodbye? He made you breakfast, after all.\"","She nodded and waved. \"Bye, Wenzhan!\"","Wenzhan waved back, watching as the car drove off. \"Have fun.\"","As Pei Che turned the wheel and left the estate, Wenzhan shrank into a tiny dot in the distance.","Qiao Chuchu kept staring until a hand forcefully turned her head back.","Pei Che gripped her chin, his expression dark. \"That reluctant to leave? It’s not like you’re never coming back.\"","Wincing, she met his stormy gaze. \"No, I was just spacing out.\"","His expression softened slightly as he returned his hand to the wheel. \"I thought his cooking had won you over.\"","Her lips twitched. \"It was just breakfast. It’s not like you’ve never cooked for me.\"","Pei Che scoffed. \"Oh, so you do remember that. Yet you’ve never posted about my cooking.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Satisfied by her silence, he smirked. \"There’s gum in the glove compartment. Chew it.\"","She popped a piece into her mouth, suddenly self-conscious. \"Do I smell?\"","\"No.\" Pei Che shot her a sidelong glance. \"But I don’t like the idea of you eating another man’s food. Chew the gum, and I’ll pretend it never happened.\"","She rolled her eyes. \"Where are we going?\"","\"Tian Xin is hosting an art exhibition. She asked me to invite you.\"","Her face brightened. \"Really? That’s great!\"","Seeing her smile, Pei Che’s mood improved slightly. \"Make sure to take photos. For your social media.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[So petty. Obsessed with my posts.]","Pei Che tightened his grip on the wheel. \"Yes, I’m petty. Don’t give me a reason to be, then.\"","Sighing, she lifted her phone for a selfie, making sure to include Pei Che in the frame, and typed: \"Off to an art exhibition with Second Brother! So excited!\"","She hit send and showed him. \"Happy now?\"","Pei Che glanced at it. \"You really know how to half-ass things.\"","Despite his words, his expression had already cleared.","Qiao Chuchu grinned to herself. [Pei Che might seem fierce, but he’s actually easy to placate. Handling him is a breeze!]","Pei Che: \"...Hmph.\"","At the exhibition, he offered his arm.","Resigned, she looped hers through his as they entered.","Artist Tian Xin greeted them at the entrance, delighted. \"Mr. Pei! Miss Qiao! Welcome!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled sweetly. \"Long time no see, Tian Xin.\"","A shy, delicate-looking young man peeked out from behind Tian Xin, blushing. \"Miss Qiao, it’s been a while.\"","Pei Che’s face instantly darkened.","Qiao Chuchu nodded politely. \"Tian Shan, hello.\"","Tian Shan ducked his head, smiling bashfully.","Tian Xin’s eyes darted between them before addressing Pei Che. \"Mr. Pei, why don’t I show you around? My husband is up ahead. Your sister can stay here with my brother—\"","\"No.\" Pei Che’s voice was icy. \"I’m staying with Qiao Chuchu.\"","Tian Shan and Tian Xin froze.","Qiao Chuchu coughed awkwardly. \"Second Brother, go ahead. I’ll be fine here.\"","[This is basic networking. You can’t just refuse.]","She shot him a warning look.","But Pei Che, usually so diplomatic, ignored it. \"I said I’m not leaving you.\"","Tian Shan’s face fell as he glanced at his sister.","Tian Xin forced a laugh. \"Ah, siblings these days, so close! Let’s all go together, then.\"","She signaled to Tian Shan, who quickly perked up. \"Chuchu, let’s walk at the back.\"","Before Qiao Chuchu could agree, Pei Che’s arm snaked around her waist. \"No.\"","His grip turned possessive as he glared at Tian Shan.","Tian Shan gaped at him like he was some kind of pervert. \"You—how can you act like this with your sister?\"","Pei Che raised a brow. \"Sister?\"","He tilted his chin up, looking down at Tian Shan. \"We grew up in an orphanage. No blood relation. We call each other siblings because I’m older—not because we’re family. Didn’t you know?\"","Tian Shan looked like he’d been struck by lightning.","Tian Xin paled. \"I had no idea you weren’t actually related. My apologies.\"","She wanted to dig a hole and disappear.","Her brother had always had a crush on Qiao Chuchu, and she’d been trying to set them up—only to walk straight into her boyfriend’s line of fire.","Pei Che tightened his hold on Qiao Chuchu, his smile polished but insincere. \"No worries. Now you know. Shall we proceed?\""]},{"number":325,"title":"Chapter 325: The Daily Life of the Manor 4 (Fei Che + Fei Youchuan Appearance)","paragraphs":["Tian Xin nodded eagerly at Pei Che: \"Yes, yes, of course!\"","She pulled her dazed younger brother behind her: \"After you!\"","Pei Che strode ahead with Qiao Chuchu in a domineering manner.","Qiao Chuchu glanced back at the siblings and whispered, \"Why did you reject them like that?\"","Pei Che tightened his grip around her waist. \"I could tell Tian Shan likes you. What if that kid turns out to be another unreasonable, gasoline-throwing beast? We can't leave any room for trouble.\"","Her confusion vanished instantly, and she gave him a thumbs-up. \"Makes sense! You always know how to nip problems in the bud!\"","\"Because the world is still a dangerous place,\" Pei Che said, glancing back at the dejected Tian Shan before leaning close to her ear. \"You need to know who loves you most in this world, who would never hurt you. Everyone else's kindness is just an illusion.\"","His gaze softened, as if wrapping her in a tenderness reserved only for him.","Qiao Chuchu beamed at him. \"I know who would never hurt me—you're definitely one of them.\"","Seeing her certainty, Pei Che felt a warm ripple in his chest. He turned his head and met Tian Shan’s resentful stare.","With a meaningful smile, he silently challenged him.","Tian Shan sensed the provocation and gritted his teeth.","Pei Che then looked back at Qiao Chuchu. \"You should take my hand first.\"","She pulled away slightly. \"Isn’t that too much? You already made it pretty clear earlier.\"","Pei Che studied her stiff posture. \"If you avoid touching me now, others might think we’re not that close. And if someone gets the wrong idea, they might still bother you.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s lips twitched, thinking he was overreacting. \"No way. Tian Shan wouldn’t do that. I’ve talked to him a few times—he’s not like that. Don’t assume the worst about people; it’s disrespectful.\"","[He’s just a shy, introverted guy.]","Pei Che’s eyes darkened as he averted his gaze. \"Fine. But I just wanted everyone here to know you’re taken. If some creep is watching us, they’ll come for me first—throw gasoline on me, whatever. As long as you’re safe.\"","Qiao Chuchu tensed instantly. \"No way!\"","[I’ve been burned before—I can’t let my family suffer the same!]","Without hesitation, she grabbed his hand. \"I don’t see the connection, but I won’t let you get hurt like that!\"","A glimmer of amusement flickered in Pei Che’s eyes as he glanced at their clasped hands. \"Chuchu, you’re squeezing too hard. You’re that worried about me?\"","She snapped back to reality and loosened her grip. \"Sorry, I just... still have some trauma. I’ll let go now.\"","But before she could, Pei Che seized her hand firmly.","His warm, dry palm enveloped hers, rubbing and kneading it like a cherished toy.","\"I know you care about me,\" he murmured, his voice low and pleased.","His gaze locked onto hers, brimming with possessiveness. \"I need you to protect me too. Without you, I wouldn’t survive.\"","Despite his words, he carried himself like a wolf leading her into his territory, his smug satisfaction evident in every glance.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[He doesn’t seem like he needs protecting at all. More like he’s teasing me.]","Still, she held his hand tighter. \"Let’s go.\"","The gasoline incident had left deep scars.","Even after all these years, the sight of someone holding a bottle made her heart race—especially if they had feelings for her.","So she might as well play along.","Pei Che lifted his chin like a proud peacock, letting her lead him away.","Tian Shan watched, crestfallen, until Pei Che shot him another meaningful look.","To his surprise, Pei Che didn’t seem annoyed—he looked delighted. \"Thanks.\"","Tian Shan: \"?\"","Why was he thanking him?","Half an hour later, Qiao Chuchu finished browsing the art exhibition and prepared to leave.","But Pei Youchuan appeared at the entrance. \"Well, well, if it isn’t our dear Chuchu! What a coincidence~\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in surprise. \"Pei Youchuan? What are you doing here?\"","Pei Youchuan wore a casual white T-shirt, his denim jacket tied loosely around his waist. \"Because my time’s up.\"","?","[Time? What time? What are they talking about?]","Noticing she was wearing pants, Pei Youchuan effortlessly hoisted her over his shoulder. \"Let’s go!\"","Caught off guard, she nearly yelped and smacked his back. \"What are you doing?!\"","[This guy just loves carrying me around, huh?!]","Pei Youchuan grinned shamelessly. \"You walk too slow. This is faster.\"","She frowned. \"Where are you taking me? Isn’t Pei Che coming?\"","She turned to Pei Che, who stood at the exhibition entrance, waving unhappily. \"See you tonight, Chuchu.\"","[? Why isn’t Pei Che coming?]","Pei Youchuan’s expression darkened. He abruptly pulled her into his arms and tossed her into the air!","Qiao Chuchu shrieked. \"Ah!\"","He caught her smoothly, smirking. \"From now on, Qiao Chuchu, the only name you’re allowed to say is mine—Pei Youchuan. If you mention anyone else, I’ll keep flipping you like a pancake.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"????????\"","[What kind of nonsense is this?!]","He stuffed her into the passenger seat and buckled her in.","Pei Youchuan blasted music from the car speakers, singing loudly.","\"I’ll fly forward, I’m a rose waiting for love~ Buds of affection hidden in my heart~ If you give me true comfort~ I’ll bloom just for you!~\"","He ran a hand through his hair, flashing her a smug grin. \"So, Qiao Chuchu, do I look good? Check out my new tan—healthy, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him like he’d lost his mind. \"...Sure.\"","After parking, Pei Youchuan turned to her, his gaze intense.","\"Between me and Pei Che, who’s better-looking?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[How do you even compare them? Pei Che is the refined, restrained type, while he’s like a wild panther overflowing with unchecked energy.]","Pei Youchuan raised a brow. \"So... me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"When did I say that?\"","His tone turned dangerous. \"Then I’m not good-looking?\"","His tanned hand gripped her arm, as if threatening to toss her again.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...You’re more... handsome.\"","Pei Youchuan froze, then burst into laughter, his earlier menace vanishing like crashing waves. \"Ohhh, I see!\"","He scratched the back of his head, grinning like an idiot. \"So that’s how you see me! My bad—wrong word choice.\"","Qiao Chuchu forced a smile. \"Yeah, you’re super handsome.\"","Pei Youchuan flexed his arms overhead. \"Like this?!\"","She nodded half-heartedly. \"Sure!\"","He shifted his pose, showing off his muscles again. \"And like this?\"","Qiao Chuchu clapped enthusiastically, her applause a rapid patter: \"So handsome, so handsome!\"","Pei Youchuan promptly stripped off his shirt, proudly displaying his eight-pack abs!","He asked eagerly, \"How about now? Still handsome?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Without hesitation, she smacked him over the head!","\"Put your clothes back on, you!\""]},{"number":326,"title":"Chapter 326: The Daily Life of the Manor 5 (Featuring Pei Youchuan and Wei Sheng Huailing)","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the car in frustration, glancing around.","This was an amusement park?","Pei Youchuan straightened his clothes and walked over shamelessly, wrapping his long arm around her petite frame and pulling her close.","He grinned brightly: \"How could I not bring you to an amusement park? Books and paintings are boring—only fun gets the heart racing!\"","Pei Youchuan nuzzled his cheek against hers: \"Because every time I’m with you, I’m just so happy~\"","Qiao Chuchu relaxed: \"You’re right. Let’s have some fun then.\"","Pei Youchuan eagerly grabbed her hand: \"Let’s go!\"","She followed behind, watching his tall figure.","In this life and the last, nothing about them had changed.","Pei Youchuan was still the tallest among the brothers, and just like before, he loved getting a tan.","His hair shimmered under the sunlight, but it couldn’t compare to the brightness in his eyes when he looked at her.","Whenever Pei Youchuan was with her, he always wore a smile and had endless compliments ready.","On the carousel, Pei Fengnong stood opposite her, snapping photos: \"Come on, smile!\"","Qiao Chuchu hugged the pole, eyes closed, and grinned sweetly.","Pei Youchuan praised: \"Wow, so pretty! That’s our Chuchu for you—one more!\"","She got into the groove, stretching her arms toward the camera.","Pei Youchuan’s eyes sparkled with admiration as he crouched awkwardly on the platform to find the perfect angle: \"Gorgeous! Absolutely gorgeous! Hold still just like that!\"","A girl nearby nudged her boyfriend, grumbling: \"Look at them, then look at you—put some effort into my photos!\"","Pei Youchuan smirked proudly and handed his phone to Qiao Chuchu like a prized possession: \"See how well I captured you?\"","The composition and colors in the photo were flawless!","Qiao Chuchu gasped in delight: \"You made me look so beautiful!\"","Pei Youchuan preened: \"Of course! I studied photography just for this. But the main reason—\"","He leaned in, whispering by her ear: \"—is that you’re already stunning.\"","Qiao Chuchu beamed: \"Damn right!\"","Pei Youchuan flashed a radiant smile, pulling her close with an arm around her shoulder as he raised his phone: \"Look at the camera!\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, then tilted her head up just as the shutter clicked.","Pei Youchuan zoomed in on the photo admiringly: \"See? You’re breathtaking even like this.\"","He set the two new pictures as his wallpaper: \"So pretty! My Chuchu is just too pretty!\"","Qiao Chuchu flushed crimson: \"Okay, okay, enough already.\"","Pei Youchuan pocketed his phone: \"Fine, I’ll stop. Want some ice cream?\"","She nodded: \"Yes!\"","Pei Youchuan volunteered: \"I’ll go queue up.\"","As Qiao Chuchu stepped off the carousel, she watched Pei Youchuan dash toward the snack stand.","Bored, she waited—until a phone camera suddenly focused on her, capturing her against the glittering carousel lights.","Pei Youchuan jogged back with a strawberry ice cream: \"Here you go.\"","She took it, curious: \"What’s next?\"","Pei Youchuan checked his watch, his smile fading: \"Next... isn’t my time anymore.\"","Qiao Chuchu licked her ice cream: \"Huh?\"","[Why do they keep talking about time? Are they taking turns to hang out with me?]","Pei Youchuan tilted his head: \"Do you know what today is, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head: \"No... Is it someone’s birthday?\"","[I’m terrible with dates, so I saved all their birthdays in my phone calendar.]","[None of their birthdays are this month though. Why keep asking?]","Pei Youchuan chuckled, ruffling her hair: \"Doesn’t matter if you don’t know. It’s too late for surprises now anyway.\"","Qiao Chuchu eyed his empty hands: \"Why didn’t you get ice cream for yourself?\"","Pei Youchuan arched a brow, staring at her half-eaten cone: \"Not in the mood yet.\"","He grabbed her hand: \"Let’s squeeze in one more ride before that guy shows up.\"","As she followed, another hand suddenly seized her wrist—yanking her straight into someone’s embrace!","She turned and met Weisheng Huailing’s displeased gaze: \"Huailing?\"","Huailing first smiled at her, then shot Pei Youchuan a glare, signing sharply:","「My turn now.」","After living together for years, they’d all learned sign language to communicate seamlessly with him.","Pei Fengnong’s grin vanished as he checked his watch: \"You timed it down to the second? Couldn’t even spare a minute?\"","Weisheng Huailing smirked:","I've been here. I even took photos of my sister.","Pei Youchuan scoffed but reluctantly released Qiao Chuchu: \"Fine, have fun.\"","He turned to leave—then spun back, snatching her half-finished ice cream and devouring it in one bite!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"???\"","Pei Youchuan licked his lips, sighing contentedly: \"So sweet~\"","Qiao Chuchu grimaced: \"Couldn’t you buy your own? That was mine!\"","Pei Youchuan ignored her, waving cheekily: \"Bye!~\"","Weisheng Huailing glared after him before turning to Qiao Chuchu, signing stiffly:","「Want another ice cream?」","His fingers moved angrily:","「I’ll buy it.」","Qiao Chuchu twitched: \"No, I’m good.\"","Huailing’s eyes dimmed, shoulders slumping like a drenched puppy staring at his shoes.","Even dejected, his tall frame loomed over her, casting a shadow of melancholy.","She tried cheering him up, rising on tiptoes to sign:","「Do you want ice cream?」","Huailing lifted his gaze—pitiful, longing—and signed:","I wanted to taste my sister's ice cream.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","\"Ew.\"","Huailing pouted, undeterred:","Sister thinks it's gross. I think it's sweet.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Are we really doing this? Forcing the cringe?","She glanced toward a snack stall: \"How about cotton candy?\"","Huailing followed her gaze, head tilting in confusion.","He’d never had cotton candy.","What even was it?","Spotting his interest, Qiao Chuchu hurried to the vendor, eyeing the sign:","「Artisanal Cotton Candy」","Pricier than average, but each design was exquisite.","She pointed: \"One unicorn, please!\"","[I remember Huailing likes unicorns.]","Huailing blinked, stopping her before she could pay. He scanned the price and transferred 56 yuan himself, eyeing the vendor skeptically as sugar spun into the machine:","「What is this?」","Qiao Chuchu bounced excitedly:","「You wanted something sweet, right? This is the sweetest.」","She handed him the fluffy unicorn: \"Here, take it!\"","Huailing gaped at its size, accepting it gingerly:","「How do you eat it?!」","She laughed: \"Just tear off a piece.\"","Weisheng Huailing reached out hesitantly:","「It looks like quilt stuffing. Is this edible? Not a decoration?」","Qiao Chuchu had no choice but to tear off a small piece and hold it to his lips. \"Here, open your mouth.\"","Weisheng Huailing was caught off guard, staring at her in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu urged him, \"Eat it!\"","He parted his lips and took the cotton candy.","The sweetness of strawberry instantly spread across his tongue.","His eyes widened, shimmering like sunlight dancing on a river, flecks of gold flickering in and out of view. He signed excitedly, \"This thing melts in your mouth!\"","Seeing his delight, Qiao Chuchu relaxed. \"Now you know it's edible!\"","She plucked off another piece and popped it into her own mouth.","For a fleeting moment, the innocence on Huailing’s face froze. Then, he tore off a bit and held it out to her.","\"Eat, sister.\"","His smile was sweet.","Qiao Chuchu hesitated before opening her mouth to accept it.","Huailing’s fingertips brushed lightly against her lips—so faint it might have been imagined.","He inhaled softly before tearing off another piece to feed her.","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Why aren’t you eating any?\"","\"Soon.\"","Huailing eagerly offered the cotton candy again. \"Sister, eat.\"","She had no choice but to comply.","But just as she closed her lips around it, Huailing’s fingers pushed forward—","She accidentally sucked on his fingertip and jerked back in alarm. \"Sorry! I didn’t mean to!\"","The cool, damp sensation of her lips lingered on his skin.","Weisheng Huailing’s smile deepened as he plucked another piece of cotton candy and slipped it into his own mouth.","It was fine.","He had done it on purpose."]},{"number":327,"title":"Chapter 327: The Daily Life of the Manor 6 (Huailian + Louyuejue Take Over)","paragraphs":["After the two finished eating cotton candy and washed their hands, Huai Ling stood in front of the Ferris wheel, gazing at her with longing.","\"I want to ride this, sis.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She turned to leave. \"I have something to do, so I’ll head out first.\"","Huai Ling grabbed her sleeve, frowning. \"Sis doesn’t want to play with me?\"","Qiao Chuchu, like a cat being pulled by the arm, leaned backward. \"It’s mainly because I’m afraid of heights!\"","Weisheng Huailing looked dejected. \"Fine, then let’s go play something else.\"","He pointed at the haunted house. \"Let’s go there.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s lips twitched, and suddenly her fear of heights vanished. \"Actually, I think this ride is perfect—just a bit slow and a bit high.\"","Huai Ling happily paid for the tickets, carefully leading her onto the Ferris wheel and sitting beside her.","Qiao Chuchu stiffened. \"If you sit next to me, won’t it make this thing unbalanced?\"","\"It won’t, don’t worry.\" Huai Ling held her hand. \"I’m here.\"","He gazed at the distant scenery. \"I just wanted to be alone with sis for a while.\"","Then he blinked at her expectantly. \"Can you call my name in your heart?\"","Qiao Chuchu pursed her lips, slightly embarrassed. Huai Ling?","Weisheng Huailing raised his hand joyfully. \"I’m here!\"","She couldn’t help but laugh. Weisheng Huailing?","Weisheng Huailing waved excitedly. \"That’s me, that’s me!\"","He lowered his hand and mouthed slowly: \"Qiao~ Chu~ Chu~\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in shock. \"What?\"","He’s calling my name?!","Weisheng Huailing’s eyes sparkled like stars as he tried again. \"Qiao Chuchu?\"","His ears turned slightly red as he asked timidly, \"Di-d I s-say it r-right?\"","His voice was magnetic, smooth and pleasant.","Though his pronunciation was far from perfect, it was clear enough to recognize who he was calling.","Her eyes welled up, and she nodded eagerly. \"Yes! But you can actually say my name?! How did you learn to pronounce it? When did you practice?!\"","I know Huai Ling can make sounds—he doesn’t speak because he’s never heard voices before. But now he can talk!","She was so moved she nearly cried. \"It feels like watching your own child achieve something great!\"","Seeing her on the verge of tears, Huai Ling’s eyes also stung.","He blinked hard to hold them back, then pointed at himself. \"Weisheng Huailing.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, encouraging him.","He then pointed at her and said carefully, \"Like. Qiao Chuchu.\"","She froze.","Weisheng Huailing took a deep breath, steadied himself, and spoke in one go: \"Weisheng Huailing. Likes. Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, tears instantly spilling from her eyes.","Huai Ling panicked, clumsily wiping them away. Why are you crying?","She shook her head. \"I don’t know.\"","Overwhelmed, she replied in her heart: Qiao Chuchu also likes Weisheng Huailing very much!","Weisheng Huailing’s eyes widened, his lips trembling before tears began falling even harder. \"Mmm~\"","He was crying more than she was!","Qiao Chuchu laughed tearfully as she wiped his face. \"You just asked me why I was crying, and now you’re the one bawling!\"","Reading her lips, Huai Ling wrapped his arms around her like a little leopard, burying his face in her chest. \"Happy.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze.","He tightened his embrace, clinging to her as he struggled to speak. \"With sis. Living. Together. Hearing sis. Voice. Me. Happy.\"","Her nose stung, and she choked up, turning to look out the window.","I’m happy too.","Huai Ling gazed up at her.","She stared outside, unaware she had leaked her thoughts again: So, so happy.","Huai Ling leaned down like a kitten, gently wiping her tears away.","Then he rested his head on her lap, closing his eyes contentedly as he secretly turned off the video recording.","All that month of practice had paid off—he’d finally made Qiao Chuchu happy!","The video could capture her inner voice.","These few words, he could listen to them for a lifetime.","As the Ferris wheel ride ended and they stepped out, they ran straight into Lou Yuejue.","Dressed in a sharp suit, Lou Yuejue stood waiting like a cunning fox. \"My turn now, Huai Ling-ge.\"","Huai Ling’s expression darkened, eyeing his outfit with disdain. Wearing that now? How pretentious.","Lou Yuejue smirked. \"Unlike you, it’s lunchtime. I’m taking sis to eat.\"","Qiao Chuchu only then realized it was noon. \"Then let’s all go together.\"","Lou Yuejue’s face fell. \"No.\"","He grabbed her wrist, pulling her away firmly. \"I only reserved two seats—just sis and me. No extras!\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, glancing back at Huai Ling.","But the usually petty Weisheng Huailing didn’t seem upset, smiling as he signed: Don’t forget what I said today, sis.","Before she could nod, Lou Yuejue dragged her out of the amusement park. \"Stop talking to him!\"","He pressed her against the car, his expression icy. \"You’re with me now. Don’t look back at him—look at me, got it?\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at his sharp features. \"...Uh.\"","Lou Yuejue’s all grown up now, but I still can’t get used to him being an adult.","She nodded. \"Got it.\"","Lou Yuejue’s expression softened slightly as he opened the car door for her.","She climbed in.","Glancing at the time, he scowled. \"He stole three whole minutes from me. Weisheng Huailing definitely did it on purpose!\"","Qiao Chuchu shifted awkwardly. \"What are you guys even planning? Or is this just another day of wanting to hang out with me?\"","Lou Yuejue’s irritation vanished instantly, his gaze calm. \"Secret.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","He ordered the driver, \"Let’s go.\"","As the car started moving, Lou Yuejue’s phone rang. He answered, his voice a deep, youthful baritone. \"What?\"","His brows furrowed. \"If the shipment got hijacked, go take it back. Why bother me? Did I not say no interruptions during this time?\"","After a pause, his eyes narrowed. \"My dad told you to call me?\"","Qiao Chuchu perked up, studying Lou Yuejue.","At twenty-two, he’d shed all traces of boyishness, his fox-like eyes a perfect inheritance from Lou Tingsi.","The difference was, Lou Tingsi remained unflappable no matter what, his smiles laced with venom.","Lou Yuejue was more direct—ruthless, decisive, his demeanor cold and unyielding.","He hung up irritably, loosening his tie. \"That old fox. The second he knows I’m with you, he finds ways to ruin it.\"","Qiao Chuchu coughed awkwardly. \"Lou Tingsi’s just worried.\"","\"About what?\" Lou Yuejue arched a brow. \"Two adults being alone together?\"","Her hair stood on end. \"Don’t say nonsense!\"","\"Not talking nonsense, are you?\" Lou Yuejue lifted his chin with an arrogant expression. \"I'm twenty-two, you're twenty-four—are you saying we're not adults?\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched as she awkwardly turned her face away. \"Well, if you put it that way, I guess we are.\"","Lou Yuejue narrowed his eyes dangerously and pressed the button to raise the electric partition, sealing off the front seats from the back.","A sense of foreboding crept over Qiao Chuchu.","Lou Yuejue's muscular frame loomed over her from above. \"Sister, did you still think I was a kid?\""]},{"number":328,"title":"Chapter 328: The Daily Life of the Manor 7 (Louyue Jue)","paragraphs":["Lou Yuejue's arm rested on the back of the car seat, his body carrying a faint, cool fragrance. It seemed he had just showered and dressed up carefully before coming. Even the scent of his hair was rich and lingering.","His invasive gaze settled on her profile. \"Do you know how old I was when my father died in my previous life?\"","She couldn't help but frown. \"Twelve.\"","[Because back then, I still dreamed of him—dreamed of him standing alone in front of the gravestone, lost in thought.]","Lou Yuejue lowered his lashes. \"After you passed away, Father became a shadow of his former self, consumed by grief. He died in a shootout. Everyone in the organization came to take their share of the spoils. I was the one who held it all together.\"","She was stunned. \"You never told me any of this before.\"","\"Because I don’t like remembering that time.\" His eyes were like a treacherous night, his voice icy.","\"During that period, my father was gone, members of the Weisheng family died one after another in accidents, and even Ying Chen was gone. Everyone I could rely on disappeared.\"","\"Little by little, I secured my position, not daring to slack for even a moment. I survived until thirty, with everyone eyeing my wealth and power.\"","\"So, sister...\"","He hooked a finger under her chin, pulling her closer. \"After all I’ve been through, do you still see me as some naive child?\"","His gaze held an emotion she couldn’t decipher. \"I even skipped grades in middle school to become your classmate. I sat through years of classes with you. How can you still treat me like a kid? In your eyes, am I forever a child, never a man?\"","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip guiltily. \"I’m sorry, Yuejue. I’ve always focused on how young you used to be and forgot everything you’ve endured. I won’t do it again.\"","Lou Yuejue paused, his expression softening as the corners of his lips curled. \"So obedient, sister. You listen so well.\"","His smile melted the cold severity of his features. \"Of course, don’t blame me for being harsh. My father treating me like a child is one thing—he’s my father. But I won’t accept it from you.\"","He trapped her between himself and the car window. \"Anyone else can, but not you.\"","There was an unspoken implication in his words.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t catch it, flustered as she was, pressed into the corner. She spoke earnestly, as if writing a self-reflection. \"I understand how much you’ve suffered. If I still treated you like a child, it would mean I don’t acknowledge your struggles. Don’t worry, I won’t do it again.\"","Lou Yuejue arched a brow, his smile deepening as he pinched her cheek. \"I knew sister was the most understanding, the most obedient.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","[Why do I feel like none of the people who call me 'sister' are any good?]","[Wait, no—Weisheng Huailing can be sweet sometimes. He even mimicked speech for me earlier. Just thinking about it moves me.]","Lou Yuejue’s expression darkened instantly, his gaze sharpening dangerously.","The air thickened with the scent of jealousy.","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, noticing his stormy expression. She cringed internally. \"You heard that, didn’t you?\"","[Dammit, how do I stop my thoughts from leaking out?!]","Lou Yuejue tilted his head. \"Hear what?\"","Something flickered in his deep eyes. \"I didn’t hear anything. Were you thinking out loud?\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked. \"Ah, a little. But it’s nothing important.\"","\"Is that so?\" He smirked meaningfully. \"Good.\"","They arrived at the restaurant together.","Lou Yuejue had reserved a private room—just the two of them.","He meticulously cut the steak on his plate. \"It’s just us here, sister. No need to mind table manners.\"","He swapped his neatly sliced steak with hers. \"Eat this. You must be tired today.\"","Grateful, Qiao Chuchu accepted it. Just as she was about to take a bite, Lou Yuejue’s chilling voice cut in.","\"You’re not getting emotional over this, are you, sister?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","The steak hovered at her lips. Eating it felt wrong; not eating it felt awkward. She set down her fork with forced patience. \"You said you didn’t hear my thoughts, but you clearly did!\"","Lou Yuejue leisurely continued slicing his food, deliberately reducing it to shreds. \"I tried to ignore it, but it was too grating.\"","His sharp eyes locked onto hers, glinting coldly. \"Do you like Weisheng Huailing more than me?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s appetite vanished. \"Why would you say that? I care about everyone equally.\"","Lou Yuejue dropped the act, his face darkening. \"Then why were you thinking about Weisheng Huailing while with me? Why say you were moved by him?\"","Qiao Chuchu rubbed her temples. \"Because he couldn’t speak, but he learned to—that kind of effort is touching, isn’t it?\"","Without hesitation, Lou Yuejue countered, \"Then if a bomb blows out my eardrums someday, I’ll learn to speak too.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She stomped on his shoe under the table. \"Don’t say things like that!\"","Lou Yuejue glanced down.","In the darkness beneath the tablecloth, her pristine white sneaker ground mercilessly into his spotless leather shoe.","The little white shoe looked like an angry rabbit, venting its frustration on his immaculate footwear.","It didn’t hurt at all.","His gaze lifted back to Qiao Chuchu’s face.","Her brows were knitted, her expression stern. \"Don’t jinx yourself! Spit it out!\"","Lou Yuejue tilted his head, amused. \"You believe in that?\"","She scowled. \"Yes! Now spit. Three times.\"","\"Fine.\" He cleared his throat. \"Ptooey, ptooey, ptooey.\"","A smirk tugged at his lips. \"Hearing you say that makes me happy. You actually care whether my words bring bad luck. Since that’s the case, I’ll let your earlier comment slide.\"","Then his expression hardened again. \"But watch yourself next time. I have a short temper. One more word, and I’ll go pick a fight with him.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","What kind of threat was that?","After dinner, they drove to the mall entrance.","Curious, she asked, \"Do you need to buy something?\"","Lou Yuejue’s tone was cryptic. \"No, you do.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Me?\"","He stepped out and opened her door. \"Go on in. There’s someone familiar waiting for you.\""]},{"number":329,"title":"Chapter 329: Extra: Daily Life at the Manor 8 (Lin Qing + Lou Tingsi)","paragraphs":["A hand exuding a faint fragrance gently covered Qiao Chuchu's eyes: \"Guess who I am?\"","Qiao Chuchu carefully sniffed the scent, her voice bright with recognition: \"It's Lin Qing!\"","Lin Qing lowered her hand in disappointment: \"Huh? How do you always guess it's me?\"","Qiao Chuchu proudly placed her hands on her hips: \"Of course, I have my own secret method. But why are you at the mall today? Did you come to shop with me?\"","\"Of course not.\" Lin Qing blinked playfully. \"I'm here to buy you a dress.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","\"There's a banquet tonight, and you need to make an appearance. So, I’m here to help you pick out an evening gown.\"","Lin Qing took Qiao Chuchu's hand and led her into a luxury boutique. \"I originally thought about getting you a custom-made dress, but then I realized—custom has its perks, but buying off the rack has its own charm too. After all, it means we get to shop together.\"","Qiao Chuchu obediently followed behind her, nodding in agreement. \"If everything were custom-made, it wouldn’t be as fun. I prefer the feeling of trying things on and taking them home.\"","Lin Qing snapped her fingers. \"Exactly! That’s the feeling I’m talking about!\"","Her gaze swept over the high-end gowns as she casually asked, \"You once told me—which Disney princess was your favorite again?\"","Qiao Chuchu answered without hesitation: \"Belle from Beauty and the Beast.\"","Lin Qing smiled knowingly and picked out a voluminous, canary-yellow princess dress. \"Then how about this one? It’s the same color as Belle’s gown, and with your auburn hair, yellow would suit you perfectly.\"","Qiao Chuchu admired it. \"It really is lovely. But whose banquet is it tonight?\"","Lin Qing didn’t answer, instead gesturing for the staff to bring the dress to the fitting room. \"Go try it on first.\"","Though she didn’t get an answer, Qiao Chuchu wasn’t in a hurry. She followed the staff inside.","Normally, an attendant would assist her in putting on the dress.","But Lin Qing had called the staff away.","Left to herself, Qiao Chuchu managed to slip into the gown, but the lacing at the back proved impossible to tie alone. \"Hello? Could someone come help me with the laces?\"","The attendant’s voice came from outside: \"Are you fully dressed, miss?\"","Qiao Chuchu turned her back to the mirror. \"Yes, but I can’t tie the back.\"","The fitting room curtain was drawn aside.","A tall, imposing figure stepped in.","Qiao Chuchu, preoccupied with adjusting the hem, felt warm fingertips brush against her back as someone began lacing her up.","She glanced up absentmindedly—only to freeze at the reflection in the mirror. Whirling around, she gasped: \"Lou Tingsi?!\"","Lou Tingsi stood behind her, impeccably dressed in a tailored suit, the long ribbons of her dress looped around his fingers. \"What’s wrong?\"","His lips curled in amusement. \"Didn’t you ask for help?\"","Qiao Chuchu clutched the front of her dress in shock. \"I meant help from the staff, not you! And what are you even doing here?!\"","\"Looking for you, of course.\" Lou Tingsi circled behind her again, leisurely tightening the laces. \"I heard you needed assistance, so I made sure they asked if you were dressed before coming in. You said yes, so here I am.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s scalp prickled.","[This guy really doesn’t know boundaries!]","She shoved at him. \"Get out! I don’t need your help—find someone else!\"","Just then, Lin Qing’s voice called from outside: \"Chuchu, how’s it going? Do you need help?\"","Qiao Chuchu paled and yanked Lou Tingsi back. \"Lin Qing doesn’t know you’re here?!\"","\"Of course not.\" Lou Tingsi leaned against the doorframe, watching her with a smirk. \"Right now is Lin Qing’s time.\"","A question mark flashed in Qiao Chuchu’s mind, but she vaguely understood what he meant.","They must have some kind of schedule—taking turns.","She hissed under her breath: \"If it’s Lin Qing’s time, why are you here? What about your own time?\"","The moment she said it, she grew even more bewildered.","When did I get so used to their weird arrangement?!","Lou Tingsi sighed dramatically. \"Because I drew the short straw—no alone time with you. So, I snuck in to see you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Short straw?!","Lou Tingsi bent down, his gaze locking onto her flustered expression like a fox lazily flicking its tail. \"Well? Are you going to make me leave and let Lin Qing find out? I’ll do whatever you say.\"","His grin widened. \"But Lin Qing’s so sensitive—she might get upset.\"","Qiao Chuchu gritted her teeth. \"You—\"","Lin Qing’s voice pressed again from outside: \"Chuchu, should I come in and check?\"","Panicked, Qiao Chuchu called out: \"Wait! I’m still not done!\"","Her cheeks burned as she turned desperate, pleading eyes to Lou Tingsi. \"What do I do now? I’m trapped!\"","\"I have a solution.\"","Lou Tingsi, thoroughly enjoying himself, moved behind her again to finish tying the dress. \"If you don’t want to be caught, then don’t make a sound.\"","He leaned in, lips brushing her ear as he spoke to her reflection in the mirror. \"And don’t even think my name—Lin Qing might hear.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Delighted by her speechlessness, Lou Tingsi’s smile deepened. His fingers wound the golden ribbons, slowly cinching the dress around her waist.","\"Our Chuchu has grown into such a lovely young woman.\""]},{"number":330,"title":"Chapter 330: Extra: Daily Life at the Manor 9 (Featuring Wei Sheng Lin, Bie He, and Ying Chen)","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi gazed at Qiao Chuchu through the mirror, her face flushed with a rosy hue from agitation. \"Watching you grow up alongside me this time and seeing you blossom into such beauty is quite moving,\" he mused.","Qiao Chuchu, in a sour mood, retorted, \"Yeah, and watching you reverse-age, getting even younger, is equally touching.\"","Lou Tingsi paused, then chuckled softly, admiring her as she adjusted the dress.","His eyes brimmed with affection and appreciation, tendrils of adoration unfurling like vines. \"This dress suits you perfectly.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at her reflection.","It really did.","Lou Tingsi stepped behind her, hands resting lightly on her arms. \"I’m the first to see you in this dress. Lin Qing will only be the second. Doesn’t that feel thrilling?\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed. \"You’re genuinely twisted. Now, how do we get out? Are you just going to hide in the corner?\"","Lou Tingsi’s smile deepened as he pulled out his phone and sent a message. \"Patience.\"","Outside, a sales assistant suddenly called out, \"Miss Lin, we’ve just received some new arrivals. Would you like to take a look?\"","Lin Qing readily agreed. \"Sure!\"","As the footsteps faded, Lou Tingsi peeked out from behind the curtain, scanning the area.","\"Coast is clear.\"","He took Qiao Chuchu’s hand and led her out of the fitting room, flashing her a wink. \"See you tonight.\"","With a casual wave, he strolled out of the store, utterly unashamed of having cut in line.","Qiao Chuchu glared at his retreating figure, grinding her teeth in frustration.","Ever since his rebirth, Lou Tingsi had been acting out of character—just as unruly as Weisheng Huailing, always stirring up trouble!","Lin Qing returned just then. \"Oh, Chuchu, you’ve changed! You look stunning!\"","Qiao Chuchu forced a smile. \"Thanks!\"","Lin Qing beamed. \"This one suits you best. Let’s get it! I’ll take you home.\"","The sales assistant awkwardly interjected, \"Um... a gentleman has already paid for Miss Qiao’s dress.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked. \"What?\"","Lin Qing frowned. \"Who paid?\"","The assistant hesitated. \"Mr. Lou... He transferred the money to me just now.\"","Lin Qing’s face darkened as she whirled on Qiao Chuchu. \"Lou Tingsi was here to see you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu stammered, \"Uh—\"","She had no idea how to explain.","Lin Qing clenched her phone, seething. \"That Lou Tingsi! Even after drawing the worst lot, he still can’t behave! I knew him asking where I was taking you shopping was suspicious! Sneaky bastard!\"","She turned to Qiao Chuchu, eyes blazing. \"No, I need to buy you something else to vent my anger!\"","Qiao Chuchu faltered. \"Huh?\"","Lin Qing grabbed her hand energetically. \"Let’s go pick out some shoes, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt exhausted, nodding weakly. \"Fine, whatever you say.\"","By the time she finally dragged herself home, she could barely keep her eyes open.","On the surface, it didn’t seem like much.","But interacting and talking with them was utterly draining.","She collapsed onto the living room sofa and drifted into a hazy sleep.","BOOM!!!!","An explosion jolted Qiao Chuchu off the couch!","Her heart leaped into her throat as she scrambled up, disoriented. \"Who’s trying to kill me now?! Who’s here to kill me?!\"","The acrid smell of burnt food wafted into the room.","She rushed to the kitchen, where the stench was overpowering—but the door was shut.","She tried the handle a few times, but it wouldn’t budge. Just as she raised her hand to knock, Weisheng Lin’s furious voice erupted from inside—","\"Ying Chen, are you an idiot?! Do you have to blow up the whole damn house before you’re satisfied?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression shifted as she pressed her ear to the door.","Ying Chen shot back, \"How was I supposed to know it’d explode?! And you’re one to talk! You can’t even measure water right!\"","Weisheng Biehe growled through gritted teeth, \"You two amateurs have no right to criticize each other! Can’t you just follow the recipe?! Is it that hard?!\"","Ying Chen huffed, \"I am following it!\"","Weisheng Lin snapped, \"You call that following?! The recipe says sugar, and you dumped in salt! It’s so salty I can see my ancestors!\"","Ying Chen crossed his arms. \"How was I supposed to know sugar and salt look the same?! They should’ve used different colors! They both look like sand!\"","Weisheng Biehe scoffed, \"You can’t tell the difference between fine white sand and coarse white sand?!\"","Ying Chen bristled. \"I didn’t know sugar was fine sand!\"","Weisheng Lin slammed the counter. \"Sugar is coarse sand! Coarse! Coarse!\"","Weisheng Biehe massaged his temples. \"Even an idiot could tell! And if you can’t see it, at least taste it! Are your eyes and tongue broken?!\"","Weisheng Lin nodded—then froze. \"Wait, who are you calling an idiot?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened.","[Are they... cooking in there?]","The arguing inside abruptly stopped, replaced by the clatter of pots and pans.","The kitchen descended into chaos!","The door suddenly swung open.","Qiao Chuchu nearly fell forward, catching herself just in time to see three men glowering at her. \"Chuchu, when did you get back?\"","Her eye twitched as she took them in.","Ying Chen’s handsome face was dusted with flour, streaks of black soot smeared across his features like a soldier returning from battle.","She turned to Weisheng Lin.","His hair stood on end, as if electrocuted, his clothes streaked with flour.","Only Weisheng Biehe looked unscathed—","But the way he was gripping his prayer beads, they might as well have been on fire from friction.","She forced a smile. \"What are you all doing? Need help?\"","Weisheng Lin shook his head frantically. \"No, no, you should go!\"","Weisheng Biehe’s gaze dropped, brows furrowing. \"Why are you barefoot?\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced down. \"Oh, I forgot my slippers. I’ll just—\"","Before she could finish, Weisheng Biehe scooped her up into his arms!","She yelped, \"I can walk!\"","Ignoring her, he carried her to the sofa, eyeing the pile of shopping bags. \"Finished shopping?\"","She nodded.","Weisheng Biehe checked the time, then glared at Ying Chen and Weisheng Lin. \"Chuchu’s already back, and we still haven’t finished this simple task. Being paired with you two is the worst luck.\"","Weisheng Lin crossed his arms. \"Don’t blame me! Shopping was my job, but Lin Qing refused to switch, so I’m stuck here cooking.\"","Ying Chen, still covered in flour, sneered. \"What’s Lin Qing got to do with this? You’re just incompetent.\"","Weisheng Lin shot back, \"You’re the incompetent one. I’ve got the hang of it, but you’re still fumbling like a toddler.\"","Weisheng Biehe took a deep breath, veins bulging at his temples. \"Enough! The second-to-last has no right to lecture the last-place!\""]},{"number":331,"title":"Chapter 331: Extra: Daily Life at the Manor 10 (Trio + Shen Zhuoyan + Pei Buxian)","paragraphs":["Ying Chen let out a playful hum, kneeling on one knee in front of Qiao Chuchu’s sofa, softening his tone as he pleaded, \"Teacher Chuchu, teach me, please. I don’t know how to bake a cake. Do you know how?\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in surprise and nodded. \"I do.\"","Ying Chen’s emerald-green eyes locked onto her, like a sleek black panther slowly rising from below.","He shifted from his low position, gradually towering over her, pinning her against the backrest of the sofa.","Trapped within the circle of his arms, Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at Ying Chen’s increasingly intense gaze.","He looked as if he wanted to devour her whole, his voice deliberately slow. \"Then teach me, won’t you? Weisheng Lin and Weisheng Biehe aren’t taking my lessons seriously.\"","Weisheng Lin raised an eyebrow and sidled up to her. \"Yeah, be our strict cooking teacher.\"","He licked his lips in anticipation, leaning close to her ear. \"If I don’t do well, you can punish me—make me face the wall, tie me up, scold me, discipline me. With your guidance, I’m sure I’ll improve quickly.\"","Ying Chen shot him a disgusted look. \"Why do you have to make everything sound so perverted? We’re here to learn, not to indulge.\"","He turned back to Qiao Chuchu with utmost seriousness. \"Cooking teacher, I want to improve, so please punish me as much as necessary.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened as her gaze shifted to the space between the two men, where Weisheng Biehe stood.","Weisheng Biehe’s temple throbbed visibly as he slipped a string of prayer beads onto his wrist, his expression stormy. \"You two...\"","Unaware, Weisheng Lin and Ying Chen clung to Qiao Chuchu’s arms, whining in unison. \"Cooking teacher~ Teach us how to bake a cake~ We want to improve~\"","Weisheng Biehe punched each of them hard. \"Get your asses to the kitchen!!\"","The two collapsed onto the sofa.","Weisheng Biehe gritted his teeth in frustration before turning to Qiao Chuchu with determination. \"I’ll make the most delicious food for you.\"","He leaned down, trapping her against the sofa, his beautiful eyes filled with resolve. \"I don’t need your help. Just wait and enjoy. There’s nothing Weisheng Biehe can’t do if he sets his mind to it!\"","With that, he dragged Weisheng Lin and Ying Chen away by force.","Qiao Chuchu remained utterly bewildered.","What was she supposed to enjoy?","What exactly was she enjoying?!","Time skipped to evening.","Qiao Chuchu was suddenly whisked away by a makeup artist, dressed in a soft yellow princess gown, standing at the entrance of the manor, ready for a party.","Weisheng Yucan, clad in a sleek black high-slit dress, her curls dancing in the wind, beamed at her with a radiant smile. \"Chuchu, come here!\"","Lifting the hem of her yellow dress, Qiao Chuchu happily ran over. \"Yucan!\"","Yucan pulled her into a hug, admiring her from head to toe. \"Our Chuchu is so beautiful! Come on, let’s get in the car.\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t contain her excitement. \"Where are we going? What’s the occasion today?\"","Weisheng Yucan tilted her chin up, deliberately teasing. \"You’ll find out when we get there.\"","The car headed toward Lan City’s finest themed theater.","Qiao Chuchu eagerly peered out the window as they approached, spotting the theater illuminated in dazzling lights, with something flickering in bold letters.","The car stopped at the entrance.","She quickly stepped out and looked up at the marquee.","It read: \"Happy 24th Birthday, Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Her hands flew to her mouth in shock as she turned to Yucan. \"It’s my birthday?!\"","Yucan grinned. \"Yes! Your actual birthday. Don’t tell me you forgot?\"","Qiao Chuchu checked her phone. \"Oh my god, I really did forget. It really is my birthday today.\"","[I completely blanked on it!]","Yucan chuckled and gestured ahead. \"Look, what’s that?\"","Following her finger, Qiao Chuchu gasped in delight.","A sparkling, real-life replica of Cinderella’s pumpkin carriage—complete with two white horses!","Weisheng Yucan opened the carriage door with a flourish. \"I had this custom-made last year. Hop in, Princess.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes welled up as she stepped inside. \"Yucan, aren’t you coming?\"","Yucan shook her head with a smile. \"I’ll meet you up ahead.\"","The carriage rolled forward as enchanting music filled the courtyard.","She leaned out the window, marveling at the sight.","The castle-themed theater had been transformed into a dreamlike wonderland, with golden light strips paving a glittering path.","Elegantly dressed dancers stood in formation, moving gracefully to the melody.","The entire theater had only one guest—her!","Bathed in golden light, she gaped at the dancers and decorations, utterly speechless.","The carriage halted at the theater entrance.","She stepped out, smoothing her gown.","A waiter smiled warmly and opened the door. \"Happy Birthday, Miss Qiao.\"","Blinking against the dazzling lights, she stepped inside to find Shen Zhuoyan standing on a central platform.","Dressed in a magician’s flamboyant hat, he announced, \"Next, I shall perform a magic trick for Chuchu!\"","He removed his hat. \"As you can see, it’s empty, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu played along enthusiastically. \"Right!\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s nerves eased at her response, and he slipped into character, delivering his lines with exaggerated seriousness.","\"Give me three seconds, and I’ll show you what a real surprise is.\"","He placed the hat on a table, waved a silk scarf over it, and—","With a dramatic flick—","Several doves burst from the hat, fluttering toward Qiao Chuchu!","She gasped. \"Wow! Shen Zhuoyan, you learned magic?!\"","His eyes sparkled as he pulled one last dove from his sleeve—transforming it into a pink lily of the valley!","Her jaw dropped.","Sure, she’d seen magic shows before, and tricks like this weren’t rare. But when it came from someone she loved, it felt entirely different!","[He learned all this just for my birthday?!]","Relieved by her reaction, Shen Zhuoyan finally allowed himself to smile. \"I’m glad you like it. I—\"","\"Don’t celebrate too soon!\" Pei Buxian strode out, brandishing a flaming torch!","Qiao Chuchu paled—until Pei Buxian transformed the fire into a bouquet of flowers!","She clapped in amazement. \"No way, that’s incredible!\"","Pei Buxian smirked, shooting Shen Zhuoyan a smug look. \"Mine’s way more impressive than his.\"","Shen Zhuoyan scoffed. \"Hmph.\"","Qiao Chuchu giggled, but then sniffed the air. \"Wait... do I smell something burning?\"","Pei Buxian’s face fell as he whirled around. \"Oh no, I forgot to put out the fire again!\"","Without hesitation, Shen Zhuoyan grabbed a fire extinguisher and doused the flames, coolly reassuring Qiao Chuchu. \"No worries. I came prepared. He always forgets.\"","Pei Buxian fumed. \"Why’d you have to expose me?!\"","Ignoring him, Shen Zhuoyan turned to Qiao Chuchu, practically preening for praise.","She exhaled in relief. \"Thank goodness for Shen Zhuoyan. We almost had a disaster.\"","Shen Zhuoyan shot Pei Buxian a triumphant glance.","Pei Buxian: \"...\""]},{"number":332,"title":"Chapter 332: Extra: Because by Qiao Chuchu's Side (Extra End)","paragraphs":["Shen Zhuoyan walked up to her and handed her a bouquet of pink lilies of the valley: \"Happy birthday, Chuchu!\"","She accepted it with emotion: \"Thank you.\"","Pei Buxian sulked as he approached Qiao Chuchu, plucking a pink rose from his bouquet and offering it to her: \"Chuchu, wasn't my magic trick good?\"","She took the flower: \"Of course it was.\"","She then patted Pei Buxian reassuringly: \"Magic is inherently difficult, and I think you're amazing! I can't even do it.\"","Pei Buxian pouted stubbornly: \"Then tell me, who’s better—him or me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Why does it feel like I’ve been hearing this question all day?]","[My ears are practically calloused.]","Seeing Qiao Chuchu hesitate, Shen Zhuoyan turned to Pei Buxian: \"In Chuchu’s eyes, the best magician is definitely you.\"","She looked at Shen Zhuoyan in surprise.","He smiled at her: \"Right, Chuchu?\"","Pei Buxian remained skeptical: \"Really?\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated.","She thought Shen Zhuoyan was better.","At least he was safer.","Shen Zhuoyan stepped behind her and whispered in her ear: \"I know you think my performance was better. As long as I’m first in your heart, that’s enough. But Pei Buxian likes to fuss, so just humor him. I understand.\"","He gently squeezed her wrist in reassurance.","Qiao Chuchu immediately beamed at Pei Buxian: \"It’s true!\"","Pei Buxian’s face lit up with delight as he smugly glanced at Shen Zhuoyan: \"Good. Even though I drew the worst lot, all my training wasn’t for nothing! I’ll definitely leave a lasting impression on you.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded.","[Yes, even if that magic trick had major safety hazards.]","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Curious, she asked: \"But what exactly is this 'worst lot' you keep mentioning?\"","Shen Zhuoyan explained: \"We started planning your birthday a month ago. Everyone wanted to spend time alone with you, but there are too many of us, so we decided to draw lots.\"","Pei Buxian stepped closer: \"Whoever drew the best lot gets to spend an hour alone with you. The worst lot? Just a quick greeting and a performance.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? So this is a fan meet-up? Am I that popular?\"","Shen Zhuoyan chuckled: \"As Pei Buxian puts it, you’re the group’s favorite. For me, even the worst lot is fine—as long as it makes you happy.\"","Pei Buxian pouted unhappily: \"It’s not fine at all. I wanted to go out alone with you, not just exchange a few words.\"","Weisheng Yucan interjected from the second floor: \"Alright, enough arguing.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up at her.","Yucan smiled: \"Time to come upstairs.\"","Pei Buxian and Shen Zhuoyan immediately straightened, each offering an arm for Qiao Chuchu to take.","Noticing each other’s gesture, their faces darkened.","Afraid they might start fighting, Qiao Chuchu linked arms with both: \"No problem, I have two hands. No need to get upset.\"","Pei Buxian and Shen Zhuoyan exchanged resigned glances before escorting her up the stairs.","Weisheng Yucan, eyes crinkled with amusement, pushed open the door.","A melodious waltz began to play.","Shi Yu approached Qiao Chuchu and bowed, offering his hand for a dance.","She placed her hand in his, her skirt blooming like a flower as he led her to the center of the dance floor.","Shi Yu’s hand rested on her waist, his gentle gaze reflecting her image: \"You look beautiful today.\"","Qiao Chuchu lowered her eyes shyly: \"Thank you.\"","His gaze drifted to the others behind her: \"Are you happy today?\"","She nodded excitedly: \"So happy! The happiest!\"","Shi Yu smiled softly: \"Your happiness is mine too. It’s a shame I didn’t draw the best lot, but there’s no rush. We have a long future ahead—plenty of time to make up for it.\"","As he spun her, another figure took his place.","Pei Fengnong stepped forward nervously, his hand settling on her waist: \"Happy birthday, Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in surprise, then laughed: \"You drew the worst lot too, didn’t you?\"","Pei Fengnong scratched his head sheepishly: \"Yeah, I’ve got bad luck.\"","His eyes lingered on her intently: \"But it’s fine. I care about the long run, not just a single moment.\"","With that, he stepped back, glancing toward another figure.","Qiao Chuchu followed his gaze.","Pei Yuan stood bathed in light, smiling as he approached and took her waist.","She stifled a laugh: \"Big Brother, you drew the worst lot too?\"","Pei Yuan sighed: \"Actually, I drew a good lot. But they argued that you rely on me too much—like I’m your 'male mom'—so they downgraded me.\"","\"Still, who says dancing with you is the worst lot?\"","A mischievous glint flashed in his eyes as he leaned in: \"I’d call this the best lot. The absolute best. And since Lou Tingsi tried sneaking extra time with you, we punished him—no dancing. That means I get more time with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked over at Lou Tingsi.","He sat gloomily between Lin Qing and Weisheng Huailing, both of whom wore thunderous expressions.","Lou Tingsi met her gaze and shrugged helplessly.","She burst out laughing.","Pei Yuan shot Lou Tingsi a frosty glare: \"That’s what happens when you break the rules.\"","As the music ended, Lin Shen wheeled out a cake.","Qiao Chuchu studied it—a rather lopsided creation.","Understanding dawned as she turned to Ying Chen, Weisheng Lin, and Weisheng Biehe, who looked dazed: \"So the kitchen explosion was because you were baking me a cake?\"","The three perked up instantly: \"We promise it’s delicious!\"","Lin Shen placed a tiara on her head: \"Happy birthday, Chuchu.\"","She bent slightly as he adjusted it, then gingerly touched the heavy crown: \"Are these real diamonds?\"","Lin Shen looked offended: \"Of course they’re real. Would I ever give you fakes?\"","Leaning in, he murmured: \"You look stunning. Happy birthday, Chuchu.\"","Surrounded by them, Qiao Chuchu felt her smile ache, her eyes brimming with tears.","She sniffled: \"Thank you, everyone. Next time it’s your birthday, I’ll plan something just as special! Today has been perfect.\"","They laughed in unison: \"We’ll hold you to that!\"","Pei Yuan nudged her: \"Make a wish now.\"","She nodded firmly, closing her eyes.","[I only have one wish.]","[I hope we can stay happy like this forever!]","Blowing out the candles, she grabbed the cake knife with a playful flourish: \"Time to cut the cake! Who wants the first slice?\"","A chorus erupted: \"Me!\"","Grinning, Qiao Chuchu teased: \"Let’s see who gets it!\"","Pei Buxian: \"Definitely me!\"","Pei Fengnong scoffed: \"In your dreams.\"","Pei Yuan held out a plate expectantly: \"Give it to me, Chuchu.\"","Her heart swelling with joy, she began slicing the cake.","\"My wish will definitely come true—I will absolutely, without a doubt, be reunited with everyone and stay together forever!\"","Their expressions softened, eyes tinged with emotion.","It will happen.","It absolutely will.","Because they are already happy now.","Because they are by Qiao Chuchu's side."]}]);
